 (APC, Agent 提示缓存).md","basename":"Agent Prompt Cache (APC, Agent 提示缓存)","score":467.7276025138033,"foundWords":["tree","tree-structured","based","kv","cache"],"matches":[{"match":"Cache","offset":16},{"match":"kv","offset":738},{"match":"based","offset":1133},{"match":"Tree-Structured","offset":1301}],"excerpt":"## Agent Prompt Cache (APC, Agent 提示缓存)\n术语是什么？\nFaster-MoA 中用于桥接前驱 agent 解码输出和后继 agent prefilling 输入的中间存储组件。每个 agent 拥有一个独立的 APC，存储其解码过程中流式产出的部分 text/token chunks。后继 agent 的 Shell Router 周期性 poll 依赖 agent 的 APC，将获取的 chunk 追加到已 prefilled 前缀后，发出增量 /prefill_only 更新。APC 实现了 agent 间数据流的异步解耦：前驱写 → APC → 后继读，使得 decode 和 p…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md","basename":"SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）","score":291.2154447099989,"foundWords":["tree","tree）匹配，识别可复用的kv","tree的kv","based","kv","cache","cache前缀（跨请求共享相同前缀的kv）。","cache前缀","cache自动前缀复用）和structured","cache自动前缀复用","cache分配**：通过pagedattention机制分配物理kv块，将匹配前缀的逻辑kv映射到物理内存页。","cache分配","cache管理采用paged","cache管理采用pagedattention（vllm兼容），支持自动前缀缓存和跨请求复用。muxwise在sglang","cache管理采用pagedattention","cache，将新token返回客户端。"],"matches":[{"match":"Tree的KV","offset":96},{"match":"Cache自动前缀复用）和Structured","offset":104},{"match":"Tree）匹配，识别可复用的KV","offset":482},{"match":"Cache前缀（跨请求共享相同前缀的KV）。","offset":499},{"match":"KV","offset":527},{"match":"Cache分配**：通过PagedAttention机制分配物理KV块，将匹配前缀的逻辑KV映射到物理内存页。","offset":530},{"match":"KV","offset":767},{"match":"Cache，将新token返回客户端。","offset":770},{"match":"KV","offset":986},{"match":"Cache管理采用PagedAttention（vLLM兼容），支持自动前缀缓存和跨请求复用。MuxWise在SGLang","offset":989},{"match":"based","offset":1107}],"excerpt":"SGLang是一个高效的LLM推理服务框架，由LMSYS团队开发，核心创新包括RadixAttention（基于Radix Tree的KV Cache自动前缀复用）和Structured Language Model Programming（结构化生成语言）。SGLang支持PagedAttention、Tensor Parallelism、chunked-prefill等多种优化技术，是MuxWise的基线框架（基于SGLang v0.4.10post2实现）。SGLang使用Flashinfer作为底层attention kernel库，支持融合prefill+decode attention kernel。\n从系统架构角度拆解术语：\nSGLang的请求处理流程：\n1. **请求到达**：HTTP/API请…"},{"filen