ve Batching（迭代级调度）\",\"score\":246.54027663525392,\"foundWords\":[\"token\",\"token_2;\",\"token_1;\",\"token_1\",\"token。\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":114},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":242},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":308},{\"match\":\"token。\",\"offset\":453},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":541},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":721},{\"match\":\"token_1\",\"offset\":879},{\"match\":\"token_2;\",\"offset\":973},{\"match\":\"token_1;\",\"offset\":986},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1490},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1600},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1915}],\"excerpt\":\"## Iteration-Level Scheduling / Selective Batching（迭代级调度）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nIteration-Level Scheduling 是 LLM serving 系统中的细粒度请求调度策略，由 Orca 系统首次提出。传统 serving 的 request-level batching 将不同请求 padding 到相同长度后批处理——padding token 浪费计算、已完成生成但未结束的请求需等待同批次慢请求（head-of-line blocking）。Iteration-level…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Device-Level Capacity-Aware Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"Device-Level Capacity-Aware Inference\",\"score\":241.77371707798005,\"foundWords\":[\"token\",\"token。适用于\",\"token。在\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"过度 to\",\"offset\":158},{\"match\":\"rt-Le\",\"offset\":216},{\"match\":\"的 to\",\"offset\":240},{\"match\":\"的 to\",\"offset\":285},{\"match\":\"ce-Le\",\"offset\":303},{\"match\":\"备总 to\",\"offset\":318},{\"match\":\"也不丢弃 to\",\"offset\":361},{\"match\":\"vice-\",\"offset\":416},{\"match\":\"vice-\",\"offset\":485},{\"match\":\"pert-\",\"offset\":507},{\"match\":\"pert-\",\"offset\":528},{\"match\":\"弃 0.3\",\"offset\":588},{\"match\":\"Devi\",\"offset\":633},{\"match\":\"n3-Mo\",\"offset\":742},{\"match\":\"1× (v\",\"offset\":779},{\"match\":\"e：统计\",\"offset\":936},{\"match\":\"score 全局排\",\"offset\":1012}],\"excerpt\":\"## Device-Level Capacity-Aware Inference\\n术语解释\\n将 expert 容量约