 (稀疏路由 _ Token级门控).md","basename":"Sparse Router _ Token-Level Gating (稀疏路由 _ Token级门控)","score":693.2969904316199,"foundWords":["token","token级门控","token（不同模态、不同语义）激活不同的专家子集。其在多模态","token-level","tokens","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Token-Level","offset":19},{"match":"Token级门控","offset":46},{"match":"token","offset":136},{"match":"toke","offset":228},{"match":"toke","offset":319},{"match":"toke","offset":387},{"match":"token-leve","offset":420},{"match":"token（不同模态、不同语义）激活不同的专家子集。其在多模","offset":460},{"match":"token","offset":533},{"match":"token","offset":553},{"match":"token","offset":708},{"match":"toke","offset":739},{"match":"toke","offset":956},{"match":"toke","offset":1105},{"match":"toke","offset":1310}],"excerpt":"## Sparse Router / Token-Level Gating (稀疏路由 / Token级门控)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nSparse Router（稀疏路由器）是 MoE 架构中决定每个 token 分配给哪些专家的组件。它是一个可学习的线性函数 f(x) = W · x（W ∈ ℝ^{d×M}，d 为 hidden state 维度，M 为专家数），输出每个专家对当前 token 的分配概率（通过 softmax 归一化），然后通过 top-k 选择激活概率最高的 k 个专家。在 Uni-MoE 中，每个 MoE 层有独立的 Router，对每个…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Token-Level Overlapping _ Token-Level Pipelining.md","basename":"Token-Level Overlapping _ Token-Level Pipelining","score":664.3290076870715,"foundWords":["token","token级重叠","token-level","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Token-Level","offset":3},{"match":"Token-Level","offset":29},{"match":"Token-Level","offset":98},{"match":"Token级重叠","offset":122},{"match":"token","offset":182},{"match":"level","offset":330},{"match":"token-level","offset":381},{"match":"token","offset":469},{"match":"token-level","offset":562},{"match":"Token-Level","offset":1274},{"match":"token","offset":1352}],"excerpt":"## Token-Level Overlapping / Token-Level Pipelining\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nToken-Level Overlapping（Token级重叠）是一种在 MoE 训练中隐藏 all-to-all (A2A) 通信延迟的技术。将输入 MoE 层的 token 序列沿 sequence 维度切分为多个微批次（micro-batches），在分离的 CUDA stream 上分别执行专家计算（compute stream）和 A2A 通信（communication stream），使不同…"},{"