回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nSelectRep 是 InfiniteHiP 和 HiP Attention 中用于在 key chunk 内快速估计 top-1 注意力 token 位置的层次化二分搜索算法。给定 query block q 和 key chunk C（大小 l_c），SelectRep 通过 O(log₂ l_c) 次点积操作收敛到 chunk 内与 q 注意力分数最高的 token 的近似位置，而无需评估 chunk 内所有 l_c 个 token。这是实现高效 chu…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Pipelined Expert Processing (流水线专家处理 _ Expert-level Compute-Communication Overlap).md","basename":"Pipelined Expert Processing (流水线专家处理 _ Expert-level Compute-Communication Overlap)","score":202.40453901991162,"foundWords":["token","tokens,","tokens","level"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":49},{"match":"level","offset":155},{"match":"tokens","offset":245},{"match":"token","offset":265},{"match":"level","offset":523},{"match":"tokens,","offset":807},{"match":"tokens","offset":899},{"match":"token","offset":1186},{"match":"tokens,","offset":1347},{"match":"tokens","offset":1717},{"match":"token","offset":2228}],"excerpt":"## Pipelined Expert Processing (流水线专家处理 / Expert-level Compute-Communication Overlap)\n术语是什么？\nPipelined Expert Processing 是 ES-MoE 提出的 MoE 训练优化技术，在 expert-level 粒度上重叠 GPU 计算与 CPU↔GPU 数据传输（expert 参数上传/下载）。当 training iteration 经过 gating network 后，tokens 需要在 GPU 之间交换（token permutation / all-to-all），ES-MoE 利用这个通信窗口异步启动第一个 expert 的 CPU→GPU 上传。后续 expert…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Domain-level Expert Specialization with Segment Routing in MoE.md","basename":"Domain-level Expert Specialization with Segment Routing in MoE","score":199.16893520166397,"foundWords":["token","token-level","level"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":10},{"match":"level","offset":119},{"match":"level","offset":179},{"match":"token-level","offset":230},{"match":"token-level","offset":361},{"match":"Token-level","offset":428},{"match":"level","offset":552},{"match":"token-level","offset":1667},{"match":"token-level","offset":1690},{"match":"level","offset":2067},{"match":"token-level","offset":2080},{"match":"level","offset":2210},{"match":"token","offset":2375}],"excerpt":"## Domain-level Expert Specialization with Segment Routing in MoE\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nDomain-level Expert Specialization 是 Lory 训练后观察到的专家行为模式：使用 segment-level routing 训练的 MoE 模型，其专家自动学习按领域（domain）而非按词法特征（token-level features）进行专业化。具体表现为：不同层级的专家对特定领域（arXiv 学术论文、Python 代码、Books、Wikiped…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Cross-token Expert Correlation Heatmap (跨Token专家关联热力图).md","basename":"Cross-token Expert Correlation Heatmap (跨Token专家关联热力图)","score":197.70973314485795,"foundWords":["token","token），适合映射到大容量存储（dram）；layer-level","token-level","level"],"matches":[{"match":"token","offset":9},{"match":"Token","offset":44},{"match":"token","offset":109},{"match":"token","offset":156},{"match":"token","offset":246},{"match":"token","offset":273},{"match":"token","offset":362},{"match":"token","offset":397},{"match":"token","offset":459},{"match":"token","offset":647},{"match":"token","offset":673},{"match":"token","offset":738},{"match":"token","offset":788},{"match":"token","offset":1148},{"match":"token-level","offset":1186},{"match":"token），适合映射到大容量存储（DRAM）；layer-level","offset":1242}],"excerpt":"## Cross-token Expert Correlation Heatmap (跨Token专家关联热力图)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCross-token Expert Correlation Heatmap 是记录 MoE 模型中相邻 token 之间 expert 选择条件概率的二维矩阵。其数学定义：对同一层 l，heatmap 元素 $H_l[i][j] = P(e_j^{t+1} | e_i^t)$，即在 token t 中选择了 expert i 的条件下，token t+1 中选择 expert j 的概率。矩阵维度为 n×n…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block-Level Mask Skip _ Judge Mechanism (块级掩码跳过_判断机制).md","basename":"Block-Level Mask Skip _ Judge Mechanism (块级掩码跳过_判断机制)","score":196.43277984511343,"foundWords":["token","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":9},{"match":"Level","offset":109},{"match":"192/1","offset":2933}],"excerpt":"## Block-Level Mask Skip / Judge Mechanism (块级掩码跳过/判断机制)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nBlock-Level Mask Skip / Judge Mechanism 是 Dynamic Mask Attention (DMA) CUDA kernel 中的核心优化技术，