 (Block-level + Sub-block Cache)","score":188.50419478063944,"foundWords":["token","level"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":55},{"match":"level","offset":238},{"match":"token","offset":286},{"match":"token","offset":607},{"match":"token","offset":630},{"match":"level","offset":981},{"match":"-leve","offset":1277},{"match":"-leve","offset":1482},{"match":"-leve","offset":1654},{"match":"toke","offset":3123}],"excerpt":"## Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM (Block-level + Sub-block Cache)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nHierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM 是Fast-dLLM v2提出的两级缓存机制，用于加速block diffusion模型的推理。包含两个层级：(1) **Block-level KV Cache**：每个已完成解码的block（block size=32）的所有token的K/V被缓存为read-only prefix context。后续block仅需计算自身attention + 对prefi…"}],"totalCount":50,"truncated":true},"effectiveQuery":"LightLLM Mooncake serving framework token-level scheduling path:knowledge_notes"}}}
