atch\":\"on\",\"offset\":460},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":499},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":1035},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1285},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1579},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1632},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1661},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1676},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1724},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1746},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1844},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1885},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1922}],\"excerpt\":\"## FlashAttention\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFlashAttention（Dao et al., 2022, 2023）是一种 IO-aware 的精确注意力计算 fused kernel。传统 attention 计算需要物化完整的 N×N attention matrix（O(N²) 内存），而 FlashAttention 通过分 tile（tiling）和在线 softmax（online softmax）技术，在不物化完整 attention matrix 的情况下计算精确的 attention 输出，将内存访问从 O(N²) 降…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）\",\"score\":18.675827302858124,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"online\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":99},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":183},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":299},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":333},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":367},{\"match\":\"online\",\"offset\":401},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":518},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":617},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":643},{\"match\":\"On-chip\",\"offset\":1142},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1159},{\"match\":\"Online\",\"offset\":1417},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1597},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1606},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1871},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1925},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2050},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2077},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2185},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2266},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2415},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2497},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2528},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2743},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2829}],\"excerpt\":\"## FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFlashAttention 是 Dao et al.（2022, NeurIPS）提出的 IO-aware 精确注意力 CUDA kernel，通过 tiling 和 recomputation 技术避免将完整的 $N \\\\times N$ 注意力中间矩阵（softmax 的输入和输出）写入 GPU HBM，将 HBM 访问量从 $O(N^2)$ 降至 $O(N)$。核心洞察：GPU 的 SRAM 带宽（~20TB/s on A100）远高于 HBM…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Dynamic KV Cache Retrieval Engine (DRE)（动态KV缓存检索引擎）.md\",\"basename\":\"Dynamic KV Cache Retrieval Engine (DRE)（动态KV缓存检索引擎）\",\"score\":17.71094144377383,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":203},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":243},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":333},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":406},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":412},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":545},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":580},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":1266},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1490},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1931},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2078},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":2137},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2183},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2220},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2242},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2291},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2328},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2393},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2989},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":3046},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":3229}],\"excerpt\":\"…rieval Engine）是V-Rex提出的专用硬件加速单元，用于offload streaming video LLM中KV cache retrieval的irregular computation和memory management。DRE与LXE（LLM Execution Engine，基于LPU架构的DPE+VPE矩阵/向量计算单元）共同组成V-Rex accelerator。DRE包含两大子模块：KVPU（KV Cache Prediction Unit，集成HCU+WTU）和KVMU（KV Cache Management Unit）。核心设计理念：将ReSV算法中GPU不擅长的conditional/data-dependent操作（bit-level clustering、early-exit thresholding）和irregular memory access…\"}],\"totalCount\":50,\"truncated\":true},\"effectiveQuery\":\"GPU SM shared memory NPU L1 buffer TPU vector memory on-chip path:knowledge_notes\"}","structuredContent":{"result":{"mode":"omnisearch","hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络).md","basename":"On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络)","score":615.5232271109762,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"On-Chip","offset":3},{"match":"On-Chip","offset":90},{"match":"on","offset":178},{"match":"on","offset":200},{"match":"on","offset":496},{"match":"on","offset":1017},{"match":"on","offset":1052},{"match":"on","offset":1513},{"match":"on","offset":1618},{"match":"on","offset":1739},{"match":"on","offset":1857},{"match":"on","offset":1941}],"excerpt":"## On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nOn-Chip Ring Network 是 Stratum NMP logic die 上连接 16 个 Processing Units (PUs) 的 bidirectional ring-based interconnect 网络，用于支持 MoE 推理中的 collective 通信模式（all-gather, reduce-scatter, scalar exchange），避免 centralized glo…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Attention Buffer _ 片上注意力缓冲区（On-Chip KV Cache）.md","basename":"Attention Buffer _ 片上注意力缓冲区（On-Chip KV Cache）","score":576.9891308301634,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip","chip避免了gpu方案中hbm访问的高功耗","chip容量溢出时","chip容量不足时才将多余kv条目卸载到hbm"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":10},{"match":"On-Chip","offset":31},{"match":"on","offset":64},{"match":"on","offset":122},{"match":"on","offset":253},{"match":"on-chip","offset":274},{"match":"on","offset":321},{"match":"on","offset":369},{"match":"on","offset":398},{"match":"on","offset":489},{"match":"on-chip","offset":505},{"match":"chip","offset":539},{"match":"on","offset":597},{"match":"on","offset":604},{"match":"on","offset":616},{"match":"on","offset":631},{"match":"on","offset":712},{"match":"on","offset":784},{"match":"on-chip","offset":837},{"match":"on-chip","offset":913},{"match":"chip","offset":938},{"match":"on","offset":978}],"excerpt":"## Attention Buffer / 片上注意力缓冲区（On-Chip KV Cache）\n术语是什么？\nAttention Buffer是HNLPU芯片内专用于存储KV Cache的SRAM模块。每个芯片配备320MB Attention Buffer，由20,000个bank组成（每bank 16KB），采用1W1R（一写一读）端口配置和32-bit访问宽度。该Buffer在worst-case PVT条件下维持80 TB/s带宽和3-cycle延迟。主要功能是作为芯片所分配attention groups的KV Cache，仅在on-chip容量不足时才将多余KV条目卸载到HBM。\n从硬件架构角度…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Stream Decoder _ On-the-Fly Dequantization（流式解码器 _ 在线解量化）.md","basename":"Stream Decoder _ On-the-Fly Dequantization（流式解码器 _ 在线解量化）","score":267.4503685355004,"foundWords":["on","on-the-fly","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"On-the-Fly","offset":20},{"match":"on","offset":43},{"match":"on","offset":121},{"match":"chip","offset":124},{"match":"on-the-fly","offset":162},{"match":"chip","offset":261},{"match":"chip","offset":280},{"match":"on","offset":324},{"match":"on","offset":363},{"match":"on","offset":369},{"match":"on","offset":745},{"match":"on","offset":798},{"match":"on","offset":997},{"match":"on","offset":1029},{"match":"on","offset":1035},{"match":"on","offset":1145},{"match":"on","offset":1319},{"match":"on-the-fly","offset":1452},{"match":"on","offset":1475},{"match":"on","offset":1560}],"excerpt":"## Stream Decoder / On-the-Fly Dequantization（流式解码器 / 在线解量化）\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nStream Decoder是RPU论文提出的硬件模块，用于在权重数据从on-chip buffer流入compute pipeline的传输过程中实时（on-the-fly）将压缩的block-quantized weight tiles（BFP/MxFP/NxFP, 4-8 bit）解码还原为BF16标准精度。这使权重可以以压缩格式存储在off-chip HBM-CO中（减少off-chip capacity和energy），但计算仍以BF16 full pre…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Synchronous Dataflow Execution on GPUs.md","basename":"Synchronous Dataflow Execution on GPUs","score":218.9899888815951,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":9},{"match":"on","offset":31},{"match":"on","offset":34},{"match":"on","offset":56},{"match":"on","offset":78},{"match":"on-chip","offset":125},{"match":"on","offset":185},{"match":"on","offset":226},{"match":"on","offset":284},{"match":"on","offset":409},{"match":"on","offset":933},{"match":"on","offset":990},{"match":"on","offset":1161},{"match":"on","offset":1627},{"match":"on","offset":1731},{"match":"on","offset":2054},{"match":"on","offset":2057}],"excerpt":"## Synchronous Dataflow Execution on GPUs\n术语是什么？\nSynchronous Dataflow Execution 是一种 GPU 执行模型，将 DL 计算图中的不同算子映射到不同 CTA，通过片上队列（on-chip queue）传递 tile 级中间数据，使多个算子在不同 SM 上 **空间并发**（spatial concurrency）执行，而非 BSP 的串行执行或 Vertical Fusion 的时间复用（temporal multiplexing）。在 Kitsune 的形式定义中，属于 synchronous dataflow（SDF）：当数据到达…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Bulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) on GPUs.md","basename":"Bulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) on GPUs","score":210.2136002229176,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":14},{"match":"on","offset":38},{"match":"on","offset":65},{"match":"on","offset":643},{"match":"on-chip","offset":655},{"match":"on","offset":1197},{"match":"on","offset":1230},{"match":"on","offset":1260},{"match":"on","offset":1310},{"match":"on","offset":1332},{"match":"on","offset":1375},{"match":"on","offset":1441},{"match":"on","offset":1469},{"match":"on","offset":1603},{"match":"on","offset":1652},{"match":"on","offset":1781},{"match":"on","offset":1784}],"excerpt":"## Bulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) on GPUs\n术语是什么？\nBulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) 是 GPU 默认的执行模型：每个 DL 算子映射为单个 CUDA kernel，一个 kernel 独占 GPU，所有 CTA 完成后 global barrier，再 launch 下一个 kernel。源自 Leslie Valiant 的 BSP 并行计算模型（1990），GPU 采用简化版：每个 kernel 的 CTA 独立执行到完成 → implicit global barrier → 下一个 kernel。现代 GPU 虽通过 C…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Shared-memory Hash Table on GPU.md","basename":"Shared-memory Hash Table on GPU","score":209.66753277042724,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":28},{"match":"on-chip","offset":92},{"match":"on","offset":256},{"match":"on","offset":273},{"match":"on","offset":293},{"match":"on","offset":543},{"match":"on","offset":575},{"match":"on","offset":585},{"match":"on","offset":736},{"match":"on","offset":755},{"match":"on","offset":1163},{"match":"on","offset":1468},{"match":"on","offset":1652},{"match":"on","offset":1703},{"match":"on","offset":2143},{"match":"on","offset":2154},{"match":"on","offset":2261},{"match":"on","offset":2285},{"match":"on","offset":2339},{"match":"on","offset":2359},{"match":"on","offset":2486},{"match":"on","offset":2794},{"match":"on","offset":2841},{"match":"on","offset":2844}],"excerpt":"## Shared-memory Hash Table on GPU\n术语是什么？\nGPU shared-memory hash table (共享内存哈希表) 是一种将 GPU on-chip shared memory 作为显式管理的哈希表 scratchpad 的技术。与依赖 L1/L2 cache 的 implicit caching 不同，programmer 直接在 shared memory 中分配 key-value 数组，通过哈希函数和 probing 策略实现 lock-free concurrent insertion/lookup/accumulation。每个 CTA (Cooperative Thread Array…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units.md","basename":"LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units","score":197.89763365629105,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":25},{"match":"on","offset":40},{"match":"on","offset":103},{"match":"on","offset":191},{"match":"on","offset":246},{"match":"on","offset":820},{"match":"on-chip","offset":823},{"match":"on","offset":1245},{"match":"on","offset":1424},{"match":"on","offset":1433},{"match":"on","offset":1870},{"match":"on","offset":1964},{"match":"on","offset":2090},{"match":"on","offset":2100}],"excerpt":"## LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nLUT-based computation在NPU上使用向量单元的查表指令替代复杂数学计算，克服NPU向量单元通用计算能力弱、缺乏专用数学函数单元的瓶颈。论文两项LUT技术：(1) LUT dequantization：HVX的vlut16指令将4-bit INT4直接查表映射为FP16，避免传统mask-unpack-convert多指令序列；(2) LUT Softmax：HVX的vgather指令从预计算64KiB FP16 exp LUT收集值，替代多项式exp2展开，…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术).md","basename":"System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)","score":160.14454540793133,"foundWords":["on","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":10},{"match":"on","offset":100},{"match":"on","offset":183},{"match":"on","offset":192},{"match":"chip","offset":246},{"match":"on","offset":1321},{"match":"on","offset":1330},{"match":"on","offset":1842},{"match":"on","offset":2559}],"excerpt":"## System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\n术语是