ry Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM)","score":19.682807651113627,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"chip","offset":201},{"match":"on-chip","offset":278},{"match":"On-chip","offset":331},{"match":"on","offset":582},{"match":"on","offset":597},{"match":"on","offset":824},{"match":"On-Chip","offset":1007},{"match":"on","offset":1054},{"match":"on","offset":1176},{"match":"on","offset":1365},{"match":"on","offset":1885},{"match":"on","offset":2122},{"match":"on","offset":2265},{"match":"on","offset":2307}],"excerpt":"…chy（GPU内存层次结构）是现代GPU的多级存储体系，由不同容量和速度的内存层级组成。以NVIDIA A100为例：(1) **HBM (High Bandwidth Memory)**——off-chip DRAM，40-80GB容量，带宽1.5-2.0TB/s，是GPU的主内存，存储模型参数、激活值和中间张量；(2) **L2 Cache**——on-chip，40MB，连接所有SM（Streaming Multiprocessors）；(3) **On-chip SRAM (Shared Memory + L1 Cache)**——per SM，共192KB（可配置split between shared memory and L1），带宽约19TB/s（~10× faster than HBM）；(4) **Registers**——per thread，最快但最小（每SM 65…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Semantic Concentrator (SEC).md","basename":"Semantic Concentrator (SEC)","score":19.553548256056416,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","only","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":13},{"match":"on","offset":47},{"match":"on","offset":135},{"match":"on","offset":169},{"match":"on","offset":280},{"match":"on","offset":378},{"match":"on","offset":430},{"match":"on","offset":479},{"match":"on","offset":501},{"match":"ti","offset":637},{"match":"ti","offset":677},{"match":"tt","offset":720},{"match":"tt","offset":966},{"match":"ni","offset":1097},{"match":"tt","offset":1126},{"match":"tt","offset":1215},{"match":"Or","offset":1270},{"match":"tt","offset":1301},{"match":"ed","offset":1349},{"match":"25KB o","offset":1392},{"match":"el","offset":1493},{"match":"ing","offset":1596},{"match":"t","offset":1694},{"match":"ea","offset":1741},{"match":"a","offset":1809},{"match":"m² in 2","offset":2008},{"match":"S","offset":2270},{"match":"C","offset":2280},{"match":"fi","offset":2314}],"excerpt":"## Semantic Concentrator (SE