{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_02_pCk1HdROzvilqf6nSiC98430","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/TTFT（Time to First Token）_ TBT（Time Between Tokens）_ ITL（Inter-Token Latency）_ TPOT（Time Per Output .md\",\"basename\":\"TTFT（Time to First Token）_ TBT（Time Between Tokens）_ ITL（Inter-Token Latency）_ TPOT（Time Per Output \",\"score\":265.62664216860486,\"foundWords\":[\"serving\",\"scheduler预估能否在ttft\",\"scheduler接收带slo的请求（如\\\"p95\",\"scheduler接收带slo的请求\",\"scheduler确保批处理大小和sm资源分配使得itl不超过slo\",\"dispatcher根据itl\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Scheduler接收带SLO的请求\",\"offset\":662},{\"match\":\"Scheduler预估能否在TTFT\",\"offset\":729},{\"match\":\"Scheduler确保批处理大小和SM资源分配使得ITL不超过SLO\",\"offset\":789},{\"match\":\"Dispatcher根据ITL\",\"offset\":929},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1170},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1230},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1254},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1354}],\"excerpt\":\"1. Scheduler接收带SLO的请求（如\\\"P95 TTFT < 500ms, P95 ITL < 100ms\\\"）。\\n2. 请求排队时，Scheduler预估能否在TTFT SLO内完成该请求的Prefill，若不能则拒绝或降级。\\n3. Decode阶段，Scheduler确保批处理大小和SM资源分配使得ITL不超过SLO。\\n4. 监控系统实时追踪各请求的TTFT/ITL，违反SLO的请求不计入Goodput。\\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\\n在MuxWise中，TTFT和ITL SLO直接驱动资源分配决策：SLO-aware Dispatcher根据ITL SLO反推所需的最小Decode…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Asynchronous Expert Parallelism (AEP _ 异步专家并行).md\",\"basename\":\"Asynchronous Expert Parallelism (AEP _ 异步专家并行)\",\"score\":206.05646871484217,\"foundWords\":[\"serving\",\"scheduler\",\"dispatcher\",\"gpu\",\"gpu。这种异步方法缓解了两个主要低效问题：\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":240},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":432},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":451},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":515},{\"match\":\"GPU。这种异步方法缓解了两个主要低效问题：\",\"offset\":553},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":594},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":706},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":765},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":791},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":933},{\"match\":\"Scheduler\",\"offset\":941},{\"match\":\"Dispatcher\",\"offset\":1189},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1518},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1560},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1677},{\"match\":\"Scheduler\",\"offset\":1749},{\"match\":\"Dispatcher\",\"offset\":1811},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":2056}],\"excerpt\":\"…oE 推理服务范式，由 AMoE 系统（arXiv:2505.08944）提出。AEP 的核心思想是将 MoE 推理中的层执行（layer execution）从 barrier 式同步中解耦：每个 GPU 不在每个 decoding block 的 expert 层前后等待 all-to-all barrier 通信完成，而是动态地将 token 排队到每个 layer 级别的微队列（µ-queue），自适应地按需重新批处理（re-batch），持续执行任意 ready 的 layer。传统 EP 要求在 expert 层前后有 all-to-all barrier——所有 GPU 必须等待最慢的 expert GPU 完成计算并完成 group communication 后才能进入下一层。AEP 彻底消除了这种 barrier：每个 GPU 独立决策执行哪个 block 的哪个 ex…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Layer-wise Prefill Execution（逐层Prefill执行）.md\",\"basename\":\"Layer-wise Prefill Execution（逐层Prefill执行）\",\"score\":135.17748742466577,\"foundWords\":[\"serving\",\"scheduler在每层后评估新请求的ttft\",\"dispatcher调用estimator\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"dispatcher调用estimator\",\"offset\":474},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1331},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1512},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1572},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1596},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1717},{\"match\":\"Scheduler在每层后评估新请求的TTFT\",\"offset\":1809},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1928}],\"excerpt\":\"2. **发射数量计算**：dispatcher调用estimator，用公式 `NPL = ⌈(Td × NT) / TP⌉` 计算本轮需发射的PL数量——其中Td为decode迭代估计延时，TP为整个prefill估计延时，NT为模型总层数。目标是让NPL个PL的执行时间大致覆盖一个decode迭代窗口。\\n3. **异步发射**：decode iteration优先发射（CUDA graph launch <0.5ms），然后将NPL个PL发射到prefill stream。两个stream在不同GreenContext绑定的SM分区上并行执行。\\n4. **抢占支持**：因为PL是独立单元，当短请求的TTFT SLO…\"}],\"totalCount\":3,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"serving scheduler dispatcher GPU path:knowledge_notes\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90f21e72-12a9-4222-80a6-d2f7bacadb87","uuid":"16df7ccc-177a-4de9-b97c-ab0fee96774f","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:48:10.265Z","t