{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"0b591235-2942-4ba3-8d98-c5497e390d6e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_Fsw4EwF2euG4ApGfLxpa1613","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q2.5_L2_answer.md","content":"# Q2.5 — 开源Serving框架调度器/Dispatcher具体实现与跨GPU/NPU/TPU硬件适配现状\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM.md | 472.9 | vLLM scheduler主循环、PagedAttention block管理、continuous batching流程 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md | 433.2 | CUDA Graph优化、batched speculative decoding、timing分解 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM Inference Framework (for MoE).md | 390.5 | FusedMoE kernel、MoE层forward流程、TP/EP支持、LExI调度修改 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md | 291.2 | RadixAttention请求流程、FlashInfer集成、CUDA Graph decode、Bullet SM masking |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md | 188.2 | TensorRT-LLM图优化pipeline、in-flight batching、FP8/H100、MoE dispatch |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md | 5079.9 | CPU-GPU kernel launch开销6步分解、Nimble AoT scheduling消除策略 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph.md | 15.2 | CUDA Graph生命周期(Construct→Instantiate→Launch)、LLM serving应用 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元).md | 13.7 | GigaThread Engine、left-over scheduling、block-to-SM分配硬件机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md | 30.2 | KV Cache分布式存储、vLLM-Ascend集成(2025.08)、SGLang支持(2025.09) |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Asynchronous Expert Parallelism (AEP _ 异步专家并行).md | 206.1 | AMoE系统µ-queue、Defragging Scheduler(Algorithm 1)、兼容vLLM |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused AR-A2A Communication Algorithm.md | 21.7 | MixServe基于vLLM(Ascend 910B)、HCCL异步通信、TTFT 2.67×加速 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3.../3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md | 15243.6 | warp-specialization、TMA异步数据搬运、pingpong调度、H100 FP8 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../EPD-SERVE-...ASCEND.md | 17442.3 | Ascend NPU上EPD分离架构、Mooncake传输、硬件co-location |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/74-PiLLM.../5-Implementation.md | 1058.1 | LightLLM token-level KV cache、PD分离、hierarchical架构 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FusedMoE (vLLM Fused MoE Kernel).md | 390.2 | Triton grouped GEMM、routing+dispatch+compute融合、15-20%吞吐提升 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Prefix Caching in LLM Serving.md | 29.0 | vLLM block hash前缀缓存实现机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Iteration-Level Scheduling.md | 28.8 | vLLM/SGLang迭代级调度、Laser layer-level替代方案 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Batched MoE Inference.md | 18.8 | Continuous batching在MoE中的expert-aware scheduling挑战 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 16.5 | NVLink one-sided alltoall(TensorRT-LLM)、分层all-to-all |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节：各框架调度器/Dispatcher实现\n\n> **侧重：硬件体系结构** —— 重点分析各实现的硬件特定优化与硬件平台适配差异\n\n---\n\n### 方法1: vLLM Scheduler —— Python-frontend + C++/CUDA Backend 架构\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM.md` (score: 472.9), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM Inference Framework (for MoE).md` (score: 390.5), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md` (score: 433.2)\n\n**方法细节**（L2调度框架执行模拟）：\n\nvLLM的Scheduler是推理引擎核心，实现在 `vllm/core/scheduler.py`（Python）配合 C++/CUDA backend。以下为完整的调度框架执行模拟：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        vLLM Scheduler 主循环执行模拟（Step 1-7）\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nT=0ms   [Scheduler._schedule() 被调用]\n        ├─ Step 1: 从 waiting_queue 取出新请求\n        │   new_reqs = self.waiting.popleft()\n        │   对每个 req:\n        │       required_blocks = ceil(req.prompt_len / BLOCK_SIZE)\n        │       if gpu_free_blocks >= required_blocks:\n        │           scheduled_reqs.append(req)\n        │\n        ├─ Step 2: Preemption 检查（内存不足时触发）\n        │   if gpu_free_blocks < needed:\n        │       victims = select_victims(running, policy)\n        │       # policy ∈ {RECOMPUTE, SWAP}\n        │       if policy == RECOMPUTE:\n        │           for v in victims:\n        │               free_blocks(v.block_table)  # 丢弃KV\n        │               v.state = WAITING_FOR_RECOMPUTE\n        │       elif policy == SWAP:\n        │           for v in victims:\n        │               copy_blocks_to_cpu(v.block_table)  # 换出\n        │               v.state = SWAPPED\n\nT=1ms   ├─ Step 3: Block Table 管理（核心数据结构）\n        │   for req in scheduled_reqs:\n        │       num_blocks = ceil(req.max_tokens / 16)\n        │       req.block_table = []  # 逻辑→物理映射表\n        │       for i in range(num_blocks):\n        │           phys_blk = gpu_block_allocator.allocate()\n        │           req.block_table.append(phys_blk)\n        │       # block_table 结构:\n        │       # [phys_blk_0, phys_blk_1, ..., phys_blk_N]\n        │       # 每个phys_blk存16 tokens × num_layers × num_heads K/V\n\nT=2ms   ├─ Step 4: Prefix Caching 匹配\n        │   # 对prompt按block_size切分并hash\n        │   prompt_blocks = chunk_tokens(req.prompt_tokens, 16)\n        │   for i, blk in enumerate(prompt_blocks):\n        │       blk_hash = compute_hash(blk)  # 内容hash\n        │       if blk_hash in prefix_cache:\n        │           # 命中 → 复用物理block，跳过prefill计算\n        │           req.block_table[i] = prefix_cache[blk_hash]\n        │           req.num_cached_tokens += 16\n        │       else:\n        │           prefix_cache[blk_hash] = req.block_table[i]\n\nT=3ms   ├─ Step 5: Continuous Batching（组装running_batch）\n        │   running_batch = []\n        │   # Prefill请求 + Decode请求混合\n        │   for req in (new_prefill_reqs + running_decode_reqs):\n        │       running_batch.append({\n        │           'req_id': req.id,\n        │           'block_table': req.block_table,\n        │           'context_len': req.num_computed_tokens,\n        │           'is_prefill': req.is_prefill_stage\n        │       })\n\nT=4ms   ├─ Step 6: Model Runner 执行\n        │   # 两条硬件执行路径:\n        │   if all(r.is_decode for r in running_batch):\n        │       # 纯decode batch → CUDA Graph 快速路径\n        │       cudaGraphLaunch(decode_graph_exec, compute_stream)\n        │       # 单次launch，GPU自主执行所有kernel\n        │   else:\n        │       # 混合batch → PyTorch eager路径\n        │       model_runner.execute_model(running_batch)\n        │       # MoE模型内部调用 FusedMoE kernel:\n        │       #   router(gate) → top-k select → grouped GEMM → combine\n\nT=5ms   └─ Step 7: 完成检查 + 资源回收\n            for req in running_batch:\n                if req.generated_token == EOS or req.len >= max_tokens:\n                    for blk in req.block_table:\n                        gpu_block_allocator.free(blk)\n                    running_batch.remove(req)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `BLOCK_SIZE=16`（每block 16 tokens K/V）、`block_table` 为 `[num_blocks]int32` 映射表（类似OS页表）、`prefix_cache` 为 `{hash → physical_block}` 全局字典、`gpu_block_allocator` 为freelist管理的GPU内存分配器\n- **复杂度分析**: Scheduler主循环 O(N+M)（N=waiting请求数，M=running请求数）；Block分配 O(1)（freelist pop）；Prefix caching hash查找 O(L/16)（L=prompt长度，hash+dict lookup）；Model forward O(L·d² + L²·d)（attention项在decode阶段降至O(L·d)）\n- **数据依赖**: Step 1（请求选择）→ Step 2（preemption判断，内存约束）→ Step 3（block分配，物理资源约束）→ Step 4（prefix匹配，可并行）→ Step 5（batch组装，无数据依赖）→ Step 6（模型执行，严格依赖前序）\n- **并发可行性**: Step 4（prefix caching hash计算）可与Step 3（block分配）并行（分别作用于不同请求子集）；Step 6的CUDA Graph路径独立于CPU scheduler\n\n**硬件体系结构 —— vLLM的GPU硬件特定优化**:\n\n**(a) CUDA Graph 消除 Per-Kernel Launch Overhead**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md` (score: 5079.9) 将framework scheduling overhead分解为6个串行CPU步骤：\n\n```\nPyTorch Eager Mode 的 Per-Operator Overhead（每个算子重复）:\n  Step 1: Operator Dispatch     (~20-30μs)  Python→C++ autograd查找\n  Step 2: Output Shape Inference (~10-20μs)  CPU端meta-data计算\n  Step 3: Kernel Selection       (~5-50μs)  cuDNN auto-tune\n  Step 4: Argument Preparation    (~5-10μs)  grid/block dims, strides\n  Step 5: Kernel Launch           (~3-5μs)   cudaLaunchKernel→GPU queue\n  Step 6: Memory Allocation       (amortized) PyTorch caching allocator\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────\n  Total CPU overhead per op:     ~50-115μs\n  Typical GPU compute per op:     ~10μs\n  → GPU idle ratio:              ~90%+\n\nvLLM CUDA Graph 优化（Decode Phase）:\n  预录制整图 → cudaGraphLaunch(exec, stream) 单次提交\n  总CPU overhead: <100μs (整iteration)\n  → GPU idle ratio: 降至 <5%\n```\n\n**(b) FusedMoE Kernel —— Tensor Core 利用最大化**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FusedMoE (vLLM Fused MoE Kernel).md` (score: 390.2) 描述 FusedMoE 将 MoE 层的 token routing → expert dispatch → grouped GEMM → activation → weighted combine 融合为少量 kernel 调用：\n\n```\n// FusedMoE 伪代码（Triton kernel，vLLM实现）\n// 输入: hidden_states [num_tokens, hidden_dim]\n//       expert_weights [num_experts, hidden_dim, inter_dim*2]\n// 输出: output [num_tokens, hidden_dim]\n\n// Step 1: Router (Gate) → 极轻量，O(N·d·E)\ngate_logits = hidden_states @ router_weight  # [N, E]\ntopk_weights, topk_ids = topk(gate_logits, k=2)  # [N, 2]\n\n// Step 2: Expert Dispatch → 重排序tokens\n// 通过argsort将同expert的tokens聚集到连续区域\nsorted_indices = argsort(topk_ids.flatten())\nsorted_tokens = hidden_states[sorted_indices]\nexpert_offsets = compute_offsets(topk_ids)  # 每expert处理多少token\n\n// Step 3: Grouped GEMM（单次Triton kernel）→ compute-bound\n// 利用Triton的block-level parallelism\n@triton.jit\ndef grouped_gemm_kernel(tokens, weights, offsets, output):\n    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n    expert_id, block_id = decode_pid(pid, offsets)\n    # 每thread block处理一个expert的一个tile\n    token_tile = load_token_tile(tokens, offsets[expert_id] + block_id)\n    weight_tile = load_weight_tile(weights[expert_id], block_id)\n    output_tile = tl.dot(token_tile, weight_tile)  # Tensor Core MMA\n    store_output_tile(output, output_tile)\n\n// Step 4: Weighted Combine\nfor k in range(top_k):\n    output += topk_weights[:, k:k+1] * expert_outputs[k]\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `num_tokens`=batch中token总数；`hidden_dim`~4096（Mixtral 8x7B）；`inter_dim`~14336；`num_experts`=8；`topk_ids` [N,2] 稀疏路由结果\n- **复杂度分析**: Router O(N·d·E) memory-bound（小矩阵）；Grouped GEMM O(N·d·inter_dim/k) compute-bound（大矩阵，Tensor Core高效）\n- **硬件收益**: H100上FusedMoE vs naive实现减少 kernel launch overhead（~100次→~5次），减少 HBM round-trip（中间tensor不写回HBM），15-20%吞吐提升\n\n**(c) GPU-side Block Table 消除 CPU↔GPU 同步**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention (GPU 端 PagedAttention Block Table).md` (score: 23.2) 指出 BrownoutServe 将 block table 从 CPU 移入 GPU 显存：\n\n```\n// vLLM原始: CPU-side block table\nblock_table_cpu[req_id] = [phys_0, phys_1, ...]  // Python分配\ncudaMemcpy(block_table_gpu, block_table_cpu, ...) // 每iteration传输\n// 问题: cudaMemcpy 延迟 ~5-10μs/iteration\n\n// BrownoutServe: GPU-side block table\n// block_table 分配在GPU memory，更新通过GPU kernel:\n@triton.jit\ndef update_block_table(bt_ptr, req_idx, phys_block):\n    bt_ptr[req_idx, free_slot] = phys_block\n// 消除CPU↔GPU传输，decode iteration overhead 减少 ~50%\n```\n\n---\n\n### 方法2: SGLang Scheduler —— RadixAttention + Token-Level KV-cache Pool\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md` (score: 291.2)\n\n**方法细节**（L2调度框架执行模拟）：\n\nSGLang (LMSYS) 的核心调度创新为 **RadixAttention** —— 基于 Radix Tree（压缩前缀树）的 KV Cache 自动前缀复用，区别于 vLLM 的 hash-based prefix caching：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        SGLang Scheduler + RadixAttention 请求处理时序\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nT=0.0ms  [HTTP Request 到达]\n         POST /generate {\"prompt\": \"The theory of relativity explains...\"}\n\nT=0.1ms  [RadixAttention 前缀匹配 —— 核心调度创新]\n         ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n         │ Radix Tree（压缩前缀树）结构:                  │\n         │                                              │\n         │  root                                        │\n         │   └─ \"The theory of \" ──── [KV_blk_0]       │ ← 跨请求共享\n         │        ├─ \"relativity\" ─── [KV_blk_1]       │ ← Req_A缓存\n         │        │    ├─ \" explains\" ─ [KV_blk_2]     │ ← Req_A继续\n         │        │    └─ \" is complex\" ─ [KV_blk_3]   │ ← Req_B分支\n         │        └─ \"evolution\" ────── [KV_blk_4]     │ ← Req_C路径\n         │                                              │\n         │ 新请求 \"The theory of relativity explains...\"│\n         │ 匹配路径: root→\"The theory of \"→\"relativity\" │\n         │ → 命中 blk_0 + blk_1 (2 blocks缓存命中)      │\n         │ → 跳过prefill，直接复用已有KV cache            │\n         │ → 仅需prefill未命中部分: \"explains...\"         │\n         └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nT=0.2ms  [Token-Level KV-Cache 物理分配]\n         # 与vLLM block-level(16 tokens/block)不同，\n         # SGLang采用token-level粒度:\n         for matched_segment in radix_tree.match_prefix(prompt):\n             req.token_kv_ptrs.append(matched_segment.kv_ptr)\n         for remaining_token in unmatched_tokens:\n             new_kv_slot = kv_pool.allocate_token()  # 单token分配\n             req.token_kv_ptrs.append(new_kv_slot)\n\nT=0.5ms  [In-Flight Batching 调度]\n         # 混合prefill和decode请求\n         decode_reqs = [r for r in running if r.is_decode]\n         prefill_reqs = schedule_prefills(waiting, available_memory)\n         batch = decode_reqs + prefill_reqs\n\nT=0.8ms  [模型执行 —— FlashInfer Backend]\n         # FlashInfer是SGLang的底层attention kernel库\n         # 支持BSR(Block-Sparse Row)格式的Paged KV-cache\n         if prefill_reqs:\n             flashinfer.prefill_with_paged_kv_cache(prefill_reqs)\n         if decode_reqs:\n             flashinfer.decode_with_paged_kv_cache(decode_reqs)\n\nT=1.0ms  [CUDA Graph Decode Launch]\n         # Pure decode batch走CUDA Graph快速路径\n         # launch overhead <0.5ms（笔记SGLang记录）\n         cudaGraphLaunch(decode_graph_exec, compute_stream)\n\nT=1.5ms  [Token 采样 + Radix Tree 更新]\n         for req in batch:\n             next_token = sample(req.logits)\n             # 新token的KV自动插入Radix Tree\n             radix_tree.insert(req.full_sequence, next_token_kv_ptr)\n             # 后续请求可自动复用\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **数据结构**: Radix Tree 节点存储 `{token_seq: bytes, kv_cache_ptr: int64, ref_count: int, children: dict[token_id → node]}`；Token-level KV pool 为 linked-list 结构（笔记PiLLM/5-Implementation）\n- **并发粒度**: Radix Tree 的查找/插入为 Python 端单线程操作（~μs级别），与 GPU kernel 执行（~ms级别）相比开销可忽略\n- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: SGLang 使用 `torch.compile` + Triton JIT 生成 GPU kernel（运行时编译），vs TensorRT-LLM 的 AoT 离线编译。JIT更灵活但引入首次编译延迟\n\n**硬件体系结构 —— SGLang的GPU硬件特定优化**:\n\n**(a) FlashInfer BSR (Block-Sparse Row) Attention Kernel**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity.md` (score: 171.4) 描述 FlashInfer 使用 BSR 格式统一表示 Paged KV-cache：\n\n```\n// BSR格式: KV-cache pages → BSR non-zero blocks\n// page table / radix tree → BSR indices (kv_indptr + kv_indices)\n// 支持任意block sizes (Br, Bc) — Br对齐query tile, Bc由KV-cache粒度决定\n// Vector sparsity (Bc=1): page-level KV-cache sparsity for token-level scheduling\n//\n// 关键: gather/scatter将分散的global memory搬运到contiguous shared memory\n// → 在dense shared memory数据上使用Tensor Core MMA\n// → 避免irregular sparse pattern导致的memory access inefficiency\n```\n\n**(b) SM Spatial Sharing (Bullet方案)**\n\n笔记 SGLang 记录 Bullet 在 SGLang v0.4.6 基础上实现 SM 分区并行：\n- Prefill worker 和 Decode worker 作为两个独立进程\n- 使用 MPS spatial sharing + `libsmctrl` SM masking\n- CUDA IPC 共享 GPU memory、ZeroMQ 传递 metadata（CPU端）\n- 此方案使 prefill（compute-bound）和 decode（memory-bound）在不同 SM 分区上并行，避免资源竞争\n\n**跨平台适配现状**:\n\n| 平台 | 适配状态 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| NVIDIA H100/A100 | 原生完全支持 | FlashInfer + CUDA Graph + torch.compile + Triton |\n| Mooncake Store | 2025.09 正式支持 | KV Cache 分布式池化共享 |\n| 华为 Ascend 910B | 笔记未明确说明 | RadixAttention tree逻辑(Python端)硬件无关，但FlashInfer(CUDA)需替换为CANN算子 |\n| AMD MI300X | Triton ROCm backend理论可行 | 笔记未验证，wavefront=64 vs warp=32差异需适配 |\n| Google TPU | 笔记未明确说明 | — |\n\n---\n\n### 方法3: TensorRT-LLM —— C++ Runtime + Graph Optimization Pipeline\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md` (score: 188.2), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md` (score: 16.5)\n\n**方法细节**（L2框架执行模拟）：\n\nTensorRT-LLM (NVIDIA) 是 FasterTransformer 的后继者，采用 **离线图优化 + 运行时 C++ 执行** 架构：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      TensorRT-LLM 推理编译与运行时执行流程\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPhase 1: 离线编译（AoT Graph Optimization）\n\n[Step 1] 模型导入与IR构建\n  HuggingFace PyTorch checkpoint\n    → TensorRT-LLM Python Model Definition API\n    → 构建 GraphIR（内部计算图中间表示）\n    → 注入并行策略: TP(切Attention/Norm) + EP(分布Expert权重) + PP\n\n[Step 2] Graph Optimization Pass Pipeline\n  ├─ Operator Fusion Pass:\n  │   ├─ GEMM + GELU/SwiGLU → fused_gemm_activation\n  │   ├─ LayerNorm + QKV Projection → fused_ln_qkv\n  │   ├─ MoE: Router + Dispatch + GroupedGEMM + Combine → FusedMoE\n  │   └─ Residual Add + LayerNorm → fused_residual_layernorm\n  ├─ Memory Planning Pass:\n  │   ├─ 预分配 KV Cache buffer（PagedAttention兼容格式）\n  │   ├─ 中间tensor buffer复用（liveness分析→最小化peak memory）\n  │   └─ Workspace预分配（量化scale/zero_point存储）\n  ├─ Kernel Auto-Tuning Pass:\n  │   ├─ GEMM: cuBLASLt / CUTLASS / custom kernel 在线profile选最优\n  │   ├─ Attention: FlashAttention-2 / FlashAttention-3 (Hopper)\n  │   └─ MoE: NVLink one-sided alltoall（替代AllGather+ReduceScatter）\n  └─ FP8 Precision Pass (H100 SM90):\n      ├─ 量化校准: FP16 weights → FP8 E4M3 (per-tensor/channel scale)\n      ├─ Transformer Engine集成（动态管理scaling factor）\n      └─ FP8 Tensor Core GEMM路径（wgmma指令）\n\n[Step 3] TRT Engine 序列化\n  GraphIR + 优化后kernel binary → 单一TRT Engine文件\n  → 写入磁盘（跨session复用，无需重新编译）\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nPhase 2: 运行时推理（C++ Runtime — GptSession）\n\n[Step 4] Execution Context 初始化\n  TRT Engine 加载 → 创建 GptSession\n  ├─ 预分配 input/output/kv-cache tensor buffers\n  ├─ CUDA Graph 预录制（decode专用，固定batch size + seq len）\n  └─ 多个 CUDA stream 预分配（计算stream + 通信stream + copy stream）\n\n[Step 5] In-Flight Batching (IFB) 调度循环\n  while not all_requests_done:\n      # 动态批次管理\n      new_reqs = poll_incoming()\n      for req in new_reqs:\n          slot = alloc_ifb_slot()  # 分配IFB slot\n          req.state = CONTEXT  # Prefill阶段\n\n      # Context Phase (Prefill) & Generation Phase (Decode) 同批混合\n      context_slots = [s for s in slots if s.state == CONTEXT]\n      gen_slots = [s for s in slots if s.state == GENERATION]\n\n      # 分阶段执行\n      if context_slots:\n          execute_context_phase(context_slots)  # compute-bound\n      if gen_slots:\n          if use_cuda_graph:\n              cudaGraphLaunch(gen_graph_exec)   # 单次launch\n          else:\n              execute_generation_phase(gen_slots)  # memory-bound\n\n      # KV Cache更新 + 完成检测\n      for slot in slots:\n          if slot.gen_token == EOS:\n              free_ifb_slot(slot)\n\n[Step 6] MoE Layer 执行细节（基于FasterTransformer MoE实现）\n  对每个MoE层:\n  1. Router: token → gate_logits → top-k expert indices + weights\n  2. Token Dispatch: 按expert_id排序 → 连续内存布局\n  3. Expert FFN: CUTLASS Grouped GEMM (FP8/FP16/INT4)\n     - 利用CUB radix sort进行token routing排序\n     - Grouped GEMM避免per-expert独立kernel launch\n  4. Token Combine: 按原始token顺序重排 + 加权求和\n  5. NVLink One-Sided AlltoAll: 跨GPU expert并行通信\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **数据结构**: `IFB Slot` = `{state: CONTEXT|GENERATION|DONE, kv_cache_blocks[], tokens_generated: int, sampling_params: struct}`；`GptSession` 封装多GPU执行上下文\n- **并发粒度**: In-flight batching 在 iteration 级别混合 prefill 和 decode；NVLink one-sided alltoall 通过 GPU 硬件 RDMA 引擎异步执行，与 expert FFN 计算 overlap\n- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: TensorRT-LLM 将重量级优化（算子融合、kernel选择、内存规划）全部前移到离线编译，运行时仅需执行预编译 TRT Engine——CPU overhead 接近零\n\n**硬件体系结构 —— TensorRT-LLM 的 H100 深度整合**:\n\n**(a) FP8 Tensor Core（Transformer Engine）**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/FP8 Quantization for MoE Inference.md` (score: 17.8) 记录：\n- H100 FP8 Tensor Core 峰值: 1979 TFLOPS（vs FP16: 989 TFLOPS）\n- Mixtral 8x7B 在 2×H100 上 FP8 streaming 达 38.4 req/s（NVIDIA blog报告）\n- 需管理 FP8→FP16 scaling factor，TensorRT-LLM 通过 Transformer Engine 库自动处理\n\n**(b) TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) 异步数据搬运**\n\n笔记 `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3.../3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md` (score: 15243.6) 详细描述 TMA 在 attention kernel 中的用法：\n\n```\n// TMA warp-specialization + pingpong scheduling (FlashAttention-3)\n// 两个warpgroup: Producer (DQ) 和 Consumer (DC)\n\n// Producer (DQ): 使用TMA异步预取数据\nfor each tile:\n    tma_load(K_tile, V_tile)  // HBM→SMEM, TMA硬件执行, 不占CUDA core\n    // TMA自动处理:\n    //   - PagedAttention场景: 通过virtual shape tensor map descriptor\n    //   - 非连续memory: SM90_TMA_LOAD_PAGED_OP处理page边界\n    //   - hardware barrier: 写入完成后自动signal Consumer\n\n// Consumer (DC): 在TMA搬运期间同时执行计算\nfor each tile:\n    wait(tma_barrier)  // 等待TMA完成当前tile搬运\n    WGMMA(Q_tile, K_tile)  // Tensor Core MMA (SMEM数据)\n    softmax + rescale\n    WGMMA(P_tile, V_tile)\n    // 与Producer的下一轮TMA搬运完全重叠\n```\n\n**注解**: TMA 使 H100 上的 attention 计算与数据搬运完全 overlap，HBM bandwidth utilization 提升至接近理论峰值\n\n**(c) 跨硬件移植限制**\n\nTensorRT-LLM 深度绑定 NVIDIA 生态（CUDA/CUBLAS/CUDNN/NCCL/Transformer Engine），跨平台移植最困难：\n\n| 硬件平台 | 移植状态 | 原因 |\n|----------|----------|------|\n| NVIDIA H100/A100 | 完整支持 | 原生CUDA生态 |\n| AMD MI300X | 笔记未明确说明 | C++ runtime闭源，依赖CUDA API |\n| NPU Ascend 910B | 笔记未明确说明 | CANN算子库≠CUDA生态 |\n| Google TPU | 不适用 | XLA编译器路径，架构完全不相容 |\n\n---\n\n### 方法4: LightLLM / Mooncake / TGI 调度器要点\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/74-PiLLM.../5-Implementation.md` (score: 1058.1), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md` (score: 30.2)\n\n#### (a) LightLLM — Token-Level KV Cache + PD分离\n\nPiLLM 论文 (5-Implementation) 描述 LightLLM 调度架构：\n\n```\nLightLLM / PiLLM 三层架构:\n┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Layer 1: API Layer                    │\n│   - 客户端请求入口                     │\n│   - Input length信息收集             │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Layer 2: Global Scheduling Layer      │\n│   ├─ Dispatcher: 按计算特征路由请求    │\n│   └─ Instance Count Manager: GPU资源  │\n│       动态分配 + spike reaction      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Layer 3: Execution Instances          │\n│   ├─ Prefill Instances: 输入token处理 │\n│   └─ Decode Instances: 输出token生成  │\n│   (Token-level KV cache = linked list │\n│    而非block-level，支持batch内共享)   │\n└──────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nToken-Level KV Cache (区别于vLLM block-level):\n  KV cache = linked list of individual token slots\n  每个token slot独立分配/释放（非16-token block）\n  优势: 任意粒度跨请求共享、batch内memory sharing灵活\n  代价: 管理metadata overhead更高（per-token vs per-block）\n```\n\n#### (b) Mooncake Store — KVCache 分布式存储引擎\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md` (score: 30.2):\n\n- **Transfer Engine**: 拓扑感知多协议（RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared Memory），40GB KVCache 达 190 GB/s (8×400Gbps RoCE)\n- **Store**: 分布式缓存池（DRAM/VRAM/NVMe分层），已集成vLLM/SGLang/TensorRT-LLM\n- **Conductor**: KVCache感知全局调度器\n- **2025里程碑**: vLLM-Ascend (2025.08)、SGLang (2025.09)、TensorRT-LLM (2025.12)\n\n#### (c) TGI (Text Generation Inference)\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Batched MoE Inference.md` 仅提及 TGI 支持 continuous batching。TGI 的 Rust-based router + watermark-based batching 的具体实现在 vault 中**笔记未明确说明**——以下基于公开知识补充：\n- Rust Router: HTTP/gRPC层，watermark策略（pending请求数≥N 或 最老请求age≥T_max → 触发batch），延迟<100μs\n- Python Backend: HuggingFace Transformers + Flash Attention/Paged Attention集成\n- 硬件无关性: Rust router为CPU端组件（纯CPU）；Python backend通过PyTorch支持CUDA/ROCm\n\n---\n\n## 二、框架Dispatcher与硬件Command Queue交互深度\n\n### 2.1 GPU 侧（NVIDIA H100/A100）\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      Serving框架 → CUDA Driver → GPU Hardware 全链路\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n[Layer 1: 框架 Scheduler]\nvLLM Scheduler (Python) / TensorRT-LLM Runtime (C++)\n  ├─ 组装batch、管理block table\n  ├─ 调用 model_runner.execute_model() 或 GptSession::execute()\n  └─ 最终路径: cudaGraphLaunch() 或 cudaLaunchKernel()\n\n[Layer 2: CUDA Driver/Runtime (Userspace)]\ncudaGraphLaunch(cudaGraphExec_t, cudaStream_t)\n  → CUDA Driver内部: 参数校验、地址翻译、stream排队\n  → Host→Device Command Push (通过MMIO写入GPU Command Buffer)\n  → 开销: CUDA Graph: <5μs total; 独立kernel: ~3-5μs per kernel\n\n[Layer 3: GPU Hardware — GigaThread Engine]\n  ├─ 接收CUDA stream中的kernel blocks队列\n  ├─ 读取每个SM的available resources:\n  │   thread_capacity, free_shared_mem, free_registers\n  ├─ Left-Over Scheduling (闭源，不可配置):\n  │   for each pending block:\n  │     for each SM (0..131 for H100):\n  │       if SM.free_threads >= block.threads:\n  │         dispatch(block, SM)\n  │         break\n  └─ Block分配粒度: 每个block只能被1个SM执行（不拆分）\n\n[Layer 4: Per-SM Warp Scheduler + Dispatch Unit]\n  ├─ Warp Scheduler: 从dispatched blocks选active warps\n  │   (round-robin或priority-based, 硬件决策)\n  ├─ Dispatch Unit: 发射warp指令到执行单元\n  │   (每个cycle可发射1条warp指令 per scheduler)\n  └─ 执行单元:\n      ├─ Tensor Core (第4代): FP8/FP16/INT8 MMA (wgmma指令)\n      ├─ CUDA Core: FP32 FMA + INT32 ALU\n      ├─ SFU: sin/cos/exp/sqrt等超越函数\n      └─ LD/ST Unit: shared memory + global memory访问\n```\n\n**注解**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元).md`, score: 13.7）:\n- **MAC数量**: H100 per SM含4个第4代Tensor Core，每Tensor Core每时钟1024 FP16 FMA=2048 ops；132 SM×4×2048×1.98GHz≈2000 TFLOPS FP8；989 TFLOPS FP16\n- **带宽**: H100 HBM3 3.35 TB/s; L2 Cache 50MB (~12 TB/s); SMEM per SM 256KB (~200 TB/s per SM)\n- **闭源限制**: GPU Dispatch Unit细节未公开。left-over scheduling策略不可配置，μShare通过修改kernel blocksize间接影响调度决策（非直接控制）\n- **并行度**: 单H100可同时执行的最多blocks取决于SM数(132)×per-SM max blocks(32)=4224 blocks，但受shared memory/register限制\n\n### 2.2 NPU 侧（华为 Ascend 910B）\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      Serving框架 → CANN → Ascend NPU Hardware 全链路\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n[Layer 1: 框架 Scheduler]\nvLLM-Ascend / MixServe\n  ├─ vLLM Python Scheduler（复用，硬件无关）\n  ├─ CANN Adapter: CUDA API → CANN API 映射层\n  └─ Ascend Graph 替代 CUDA Graph（静态图编译）\n\n[Layer 2: CANN (Compute Architecture for Neural Networks)]\n  ├─ ACL (Ascend Computing Library):\n  │   提供GEMM/Conv/Attention等预优化算子\n  │   等价于cuBLAS/cuDNN\n  ├─ Ascend Graph (图编译):\n  │   计算图→Task Descriptor Chain→硬件TS执行\n  │   与CUDA Graph的关键差异: 硬件TS直接解析执行,\n  │   无需类似GigaThread Engine的软件层干预\n  └─ HCCL (Huawei Collective Communication Library):\n     替代NCCL, 支持HCCS(片间互联60 GB/s)+RoCE(25 GB/s)\n\n[Layer 3: Ascend NPU Hardware Task Scheduler (TS)]\n  ├─ 接收编译好的Task Descriptor Chain\n  ├─ 按task dependency顺序发射到AI Core\n  ├─ 支持配置优先级 + task queue depth\n  │   (vs GPU Dispatch Unit闭源不可配置)\n  └─ 笔记未明确说明TS的调度策略细节\n\n[Layer 4: Da Vinci AI Core]\n  ├─ Cube Unit (脉动阵列): MatMul主力, 等价GPU Tensor Core\n  │   但数据流模式不同 (systolic vs MMA指令)\n  ├─ Vector Unit (SIMD): 向量计算, 等价GPU CUDA Core\n  ├─ Scalar Unit: 标量/控制流\n  └─ L1 Buffer + L0 Buffer:\n     (分离设计, 非GPU shared memory统一模型)\n```\n\n**注解**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused AR-A2A Communication Algorithm.md`, score: 21.7）:\n- **MixServe实测**: Ascend 910B上DeepSeek-R1 TTFT 2.67× vs vLLM TP+PP, 1.70× vs vLLM DP+EP\n- **通信架构差异**: HCCS片间60 GB/s vs NVLink 900 GB/s——跨节点通信成为Ascend集群的主要瓶颈（MixServe的Fused AR-A2A算法正是为解决此问题）\n- **片上存储差异**: Ascend 910B L1 Buffer与GPU shared memory的容量/bank结构不同，PagedAttention的tile size需针对性调优。vault中未提供精准spec数值\n- **Task Descriptor Chain vs CUDA Graph**: Ascend Graph编译后产出task descriptor chain，由硬件TS直接解析——消除了GPU上GigaThread Engine的软件层block调度延迟\n\n### 2.3 三大硬件平台 Serving 适配关键差异对比\n\n```\n┌──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┐\n│   适配维度        │  NVIDIA GPU      │  华为 Ascend NPU  │  Google TPU      │\n│                  │  (CUDA/H100)     │  (CANN/910B)     │  (XLA/v5p)       │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 编程模型          │ CUDA C++/Python  │ CANN C++/Python  │ XLA HLO          │\n│                  │ 灵活kernel开发   │ ACL算子库+TS调度  │ (编译器驱动,     │\n│                  │                  │                  │  不可手写kernel) │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ KV Cache管理      │ PagedAttention   │ PagedAttention   │ 编译器静态管理   │\n│                  │ (动态block分配)  │ (需CANN适配)     │ (运行时不可变)   │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 片上存储         │ Shared Memory    │ L1 Buffer (分离) │ Vector Memory    │\n│                  │ (256KB/SM,       │ + L0 Buffer      │ (编译器管理)     │\n│                  │  可编程分配)     │ (硬件管理)       │                  │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 图调度机制        │ CUDA Graph       │ Ascend Graph     │ XLA编译期调度    │\n│                  │ (Record→Replay,  │ (Task Descriptor │ (静态图,         │\n│                  │  GigaThread分发) │  Chain→硬件TS)   │  无运行时调度)   │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ Kernel Launch    │ ~3-10μs/kernel   │ 笔记未明确说明   │ 0 (编译期固定)   │\n│ Overhead         │ →~100μs total    │                  │                  │\n│                  │ CUDA Graph解决)  │                  │                  │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 集合通信          │ NCCL (NVLink     │ HCCL (HCCS       │ ICI (Inter-Chip  │\n│                  │  900 GB/s)       │  60 GB/s)        │  Interconnect)   │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ Dispatch可控性   │ 低 (GigaThread   │ 中 (TS可配置     │ 无 (编译器决定)  │\n│                  │  Engine闭源)     │  queue depth)    │                  │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 框架移植难度      │ 原生支持         │ 中等 (CANN适配   │ 高 (XLA路径      │\n│                  │ (基准平台)       │  即可, 非易架构) │  完全重编译)     │\n└──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **SM亲和性绑定**(GPU): Bullet/SGLang通过`libsmctrl`实现SM masking，将prefill和decode绑定不同SM分区——但这是利用CUDA MPS特性间接实现，非直接控制GPU Dispatch Unit\n- **片上buffer感知**(NPU): Ascend 910B的L1 Buffer分离设计（非GPU unified SMEM），PagedAttention block size可能需要从16调整为NPU友好的粒度（vault未提供具体优化数值）\n- **TPU编译期边界**: XLA在编译期完成所有算子排布和内存分配，运行时零scheduling overhead——但代价是完全丧失动态batch灵活性。MoE的动态expert routing在TPU上通过编译器静态unrolling处理（非运行时动态dispatch）\n\n---\n\n## 三、方法对比表\n\n| 框架 | 核心调度机制 | 实现语言 | 硬件平台 | 关键硬件优化 | 跨平台移植 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|-------------|----------|----------|-------------|-----------|---------|\n| **vLLM** | PagedAttention block管理 + Continuous Batching + Prefix Caching Hash | Python+C++/CUDA | H100/A100原生; Ascend 910B已集成(2025.08) | CUDA Graph、FusedMoE(Triton)、FP8 Tensor Core、GPU-side block table | CANN适配(vLLM-Ascend)、ROCm社区移植中 | vLLM.md(472.9), vLLM MoE(390.5), Mooncake Store(30.2) |\n| **SGLang** | RadixAttention tree前缀复用 + Token-Level KV Pool + Programmable Scheduler | Python+PyTorch/Triton | H100/A100原生; Mooncake集成(2025.09) | FlashInfer BSR attention、torch.compile JIT、SM spatial sharing | ROCm理论可行(Triton); NPU/TPU未明确 | SGLang.md(291.2), Vector Sparsity(171.4) |\n| **TensorRT-LLM** | AoT图优化 + In-Flight Batching + Execution Context | C++闭源runtime+Python API | NVIDIA GPU专属(H100深度整合) | FP8 Tensor Core、TMA、Transformer Engine、NVLink one-sided alltoall | 跨平台极难(深度绑定CUDA生态) | FasterTransformer(188.2), FP8 MoE(17.8), A2A Comm(16.5) |\n| **LightLLM/PiLLM** | Token-Level KV Cache(linked list) + PD分离 + Hierarchical三层架构 | Python+CUDA | GPU(具体型号笔记未明确) | Token粒度内存共享、细粒度KV分配/释放 | 笔记未明确 | PiLLM 5-Impl(1058.1) |\n| **Mooncake Store** | KVCache分布式缓存 + 拓扑感知传输 + 全局Conductor调度 | C++/Python | 跨平台传输层; 已集成三大框架 | RDMA/RoCE/CXL多协议、分层缓存(DRAM/VRAM/NVMe) | vLLM-Ascend(2025.08)、SGLang(2025.09)、TensorRT-LLM(2025.12) | Mooncake Store(30.2) |\n| **AMoE/AEP** | µ-queue异步expert调度 + Defragging Scheduler | Python+C++ (pybind11, 兼容vLLM) | GPU(兼容vLLM) | 消除all-to-all barrier、GPU自决策layer执行 | 兼容vLLM API(理论上vLLM支持的所有平台) | AEP(206.1) |\n| **MixServe** | Fused AR-A2A通信融合 + 混合TP-EP | Python+C++ (vLLM/Tutel) | Ascend 910B + H20 | HCCL多stream异步、HCCS/RoCE通信重叠 | Ascend 910B(vLLM) + H20(Tutel)实测 | Fused AR-A2A(21.7) |\n\n---\n\n## 四、不确定性\n\n1. **TGI 调度器内部细节**: vault 未找到 TGI 的 Rust router + watermark batching 实现的详细笔记。上述 TGI 内容为公开知识补充，标注「笔记未明确说明」\n2. **S-LoRA 实现**: vault 中未找到 S-LoRA LoRA adapter 动态调度的专门笔记，该框架在答案中未详述\n3. **Ascend 910B 精准硬件参数**: vault 中未找到 Ascend 910B 的 L1 Buffer 大小、MAC 数量、HBM 带宽等精准 spec。上述数据来自论文上下文推断或标注「笔记未明确说明」\n4. **AMD MI300X ROCm 移植**: vault 仅 HipKittens 论文提及 ROCm hardware features，未找到 vLLM/SGLang 在 MI300X 上的基准测试或移植报告\n5. **TPU v5e/v5p 框架适配**: vault 未找到任何 serving 框架在 TPU 上的适配笔记。TPU 分析基于 XLA 编译原理推断\n6. **LightLLM/S-LoRA 性能指标**: 笔记仅描述架构特性，未提供具体 throughput/latency 基准数据\n7. **TMA 在 vLLM PagedAttention 中的具体实现**: 笔记(FlashAttention-3)描述了 TMA 机制和 `SM90_TMA_LOAD_PAGED_OP` 类的存在，但 vLLM 如何具体集成 TMA 的代码路径在 vault 中**笔记未明确说明**\n8. **Mooncake 在单加速器场景下的收益**: Mooncake 设计面向 PD 分离式多节点架构，单加速器场景下其分布式 KV cache 池化优势有限——但笔记未提供单加速器 vs 多节点 Mooncake 的消融实验对比\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q2.5\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":119877,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90f21e72-12a9-4222-80a6-d2f7bacadb87","uuid":"cd42f680-83f6-4679-a697-bef1a5048458"}
