{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_Fsw4EwF2euG4ApGfLxpa1613","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q2.5_L2_answer.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90f21e72-12a9-4222-80a6-d2f7bacadb87","uuid":"d6961164-a282-4007-95b6-911a93108468","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:57:18.154Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q2.5_L2_answer.md","content":"# Q2.5 — 开源Serving框架调度器/Dispatcher具体实现与跨GPU/NPU/TPU硬件适配现状\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM.md | 472.9 | vLLM scheduler主循环、PagedAttention block管理、continuous batching流程 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md | 433.2 | CUDA Graph优化、batched speculative decoding、timing分解 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM Inference Framework (for MoE).md | 390.5 | FusedMoE kernel、MoE层forward流程、TP/EP支持、LExI调度修改 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md | 291.2 | RadixAttention请求流程、FlashInfer集成、CUDA Graph decode、Bullet SM masking |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md | 188.2 | TensorRT-LLM图优化pipeline、in-flight batching、FP8/H100、MoE dispatch |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md | 5079.9 | CPU-GPU kernel launch开销6步分解、Nimble AoT scheduling消除策略 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph.md | 15.2 | CUDA Graph生命周期(Construct→Instantiate→Launch)、LLM serving应用 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元).md | 13.7 | GigaThread Engine、left-over scheduling、block-to-SM分配硬件机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md | 30.2 | KV Cache分布式存储、vLLM-Ascend集成(2025.08)、SGLang支持(2025.09) |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Asynchronous Expert Parallelism (AEP _ 异步专家并行).md | 206.1 | AMoE系统µ-queue、Defragging Scheduler(Algorithm 1)、兼容vLLM |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused AR-A2A Communication Algorithm.md | 21.7 | MixServe基于vLLM(Ascend 910B)、HCCL异步通信、TTFT 2.67×加速 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3.../3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md | 15243.6 | warp-specialization、TMA异步数据搬运、pingpong调度、H100 FP8 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../EPD-SERVE-...ASCEND.md | 17442.3 | Ascend NPU上EPD分离架构、Mooncake传输、硬件co-location |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/74-PiLLM.../5-Implementation.md | 1058.1 | LightLLM token-level KV cache、PD分离、hierarchical架构 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FusedMoE (vLLM Fused MoE Kernel).md | 390.2 | Triton grouped GEMM、routing+dispatch+compute融合、15-20%吞吐提升 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Prefix Caching in LLM Serving.md | 29.0 | vLLM block hash前缀缓存实现机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Iteration-Level Scheduling.md | 28.8 | vLLM/SGLang迭代级调度、Laser layer-level替代方案 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Batched MoE Inference.md | 18.8 | Continuous batching在MoE中的expert-aware scheduling挑战 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 16.5 | NVLink one-sided alltoall(TensorRT-LLM)、分层all-to-all |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节：各框架调度器/Dispatcher实现\n\n> **侧重：硬件体系结构** —— 重点分析各实现的硬件特定优化与硬件平台适配差异\n\n---\n\n### 方法1: vLLM Scheduler —— Python-frontend + C++/CUDA Backend 架构\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM.md` (score: 472.9), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM Inference Framework (for MoE).md` (score: 390.5), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md` (score: 433.2)\n\n**方法细节**（L2调度框架执行模拟）：\n\nvLLM的Scheduler是推理引擎核心，实现在 `vllm/core/scheduler.py`（Python）配合 C++/CUDA backend。以下为完整的调度框架执行模拟：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        vLLM Scheduler 主循环执行模拟（Step 1-7）\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nT=0ms   [Scheduler._schedule() 被调用]\n        ├─ Step 1: 从 waiting_queue 取出新请求\n        │   new_reqs = self.waiting.popleft()\n        │   对每个 req:\n        │       required_blocks = ceil(req.prompt_len / BLOCK_SIZE)\n        │       if gpu_free_blocks >= required_blocks:\n        │           scheduled_reqs.append(req)\n        │\n        ├─ Step 2: Preemption 检查（内存不足时触发）\n        │   if gpu_free_blocks < needed:\n        │       victims = select_victims(running, policy)\n        │       # policy ∈ {RECOMPUTE, SWAP}\n        │       if policy == RECOMPUTE:\n        │           for v in victims:\n        │               free_blocks(v.block_table)  # 丢弃KV\n        │               v.state = WAITING_FOR_RECOMPUTE\n        │       elif policy == SWAP:\n        │           for v in victims:\n        │               copy_blocks_to_cpu(v.block_table)  # 换出\n        │               v.state = SWAPPED\n\nT=1ms   ├─ Step 3: Block Table 管理（核心数据结构）\n        │   for req in scheduled_reqs:\n        │       num_blocks = ceil(req.max_tokens / 16)\n        │       req.block_table = []  # 逻辑→物理映射表\n        │       for i in range(num_blocks):\n        │           phys_blk = gpu_block_allocator.allocate()\n        │           req.block_table.append(phys_blk)\n        │       # block_table 结构:\n        │       # [phys_blk_0, phys_blk_1, ..., phys_blk_N]\n        │       # 每个phys_blk存16 tokens × num_layers × num_heads K/V\n\nT=2ms   ├─ Step 4: Prefix Caching 匹配\n        │   # 对prompt按block_size切分并hash\n        │   prompt_blocks = chunk_tokens(req.prompt_tokens, 16)\n        │   for i, blk in enumerate(prompt_blocks):\n        │       blk_hash = compute_hash(blk)  # 内容hash\n        │       if blk_hash in prefix_cache:\n        │           # 命中 → 复用物理block，跳过prefill计算\n        │           req.block_table[i] = prefix_cache[blk_hash]\n        │           req.num_cached_tokens += 16\n        │       else:\n        │           prefix_cache[blk_hash] = req.block_table[i]\n\nT=3ms   ├─ Step 5: Continuous Batching（组装running_batch）\n        │   running_batch = []\n        │   # Prefill请求 + Decode请求混合\n        │   for req in (new_prefill_reqs + running_decode_reqs):\n        │       running_batch.append({\n        │           'req_id': req.id,\n        │           'block_table': req.block_table,\n        │           'context_len': req.num_computed_tokens,\n        │           'is_prefill': req.is_prefill_stage\n        │       })\n\nT=4ms   ├─ Step 6: Model Runner 执行\n        │   # 两条硬件执行路径:\n        │   if all(r.is_decode for r in running_batch):\n        │       # 纯decode batch → CUDA Graph 快速路径\n        │       cudaGraphLaunch(decode_graph_exec, compute_stream)\n        │       # 单次launch，GPU自主执行所有kernel\n        │   else:\n        │       # 混合batch → PyTorch eager路径\n        │       model_runner.execute_model(running_batch)\n        │       # MoE模型内部调用 FusedMoE kernel:\n        │       #   router(gate) → top-k select → grouped GEMM → combine\n\nT=5ms   └─ Step 7: 完成检查 + 资源回收\n            for req in running_batch:\n                if req.generated_token == EOS or req.len >= max_tokens:\n                    for blk in req.block_table:\n                        gpu_block_allocator.free(blk)\n                    running_batch.remove(req)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `BLOCK_SIZE=16`（每block 16 tokens K/V）、`block_table` 为 `[num_blocks]int32` 映射表（类似OS页表）、`prefix_cache` 为 `{hash → physical_block}` 全局字典、`gpu_block_allocator` 为freelist管理的GPU内存分配器\n- **复杂度分析**: Scheduler主循环 O(N+M)（N=waiting请求数，M=running请求数）；Block分配 O(1)（freelist pop）；Prefix caching hash查找 O(L/16)（L=prompt长度，hash+dict lookup）；Model forward O(L·d² + L²·d)（attention项在decode阶段降至O(L·d)）\n- **数据依赖**: Step 1（请求选择）→ Step 2（preemption判断，内存约束）→ Step 3（block分配，物理资源约束）→ Step 4（prefix匹配，可并行）→ Step 5（batch组装，无数据依赖）→ Step 6（模型执行，严格依赖前序）\n- **并发可行性**: Step 4（prefix caching hash计算）可与Step 3（block分配）并行（分别作用于不同请求子集）；Step 6的CUDA Graph路径独立于CPU scheduler\n\n**硬件体系结构 —— vLLM的GPU硬件特定优化**:\n\n**(a) CUDA Graph 消除 Per-Kernel Launch Overhead**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md` (score: 5079.9) 将framework scheduling overhead分解为6个串行CPU步骤：\n\n```\nPyTorch Eager Mode 的 Per-Operator Overhead（每个算子重复）:\n  Step 1: Operator Dispatch     (~20-30μs)  Python→C++ autograd查找\n  Step 2: Output Shape Inference (~10-20μs)  CPU端meta-data计算\n  Step 3: Kernel Selection       (~5-50μs)  cuDNN auto-tune\n  Step 4: Argument Preparation    (~5-10μs)  grid/block dims, strides\n  Step 5: Kernel Launch           (~3-5μs)   cudaLaunchKernel→GPU queue\n  Step 6: Memory Allocation       (amortized) PyTorch caching allocator\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────\n  Total CPU overhead per op:     ~50-115μs\n  Typical GPU compute per op:     ~10μs\n  → GPU idle ratio:              ~90%+\n\nvLLM CUDA Graph 优化（Decode Phase）:\n  预录制整图 → cudaGraphLaunch(exec, stream) 单次提交\n  总CPU overhead: <100μs (整iteration)\n  → GPU idle ratio: 降至 <5%\n```\n\n**(b) FusedMoE Kernel —— Tensor Core 利用最大化**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FusedMoE (vLLM Fused MoE Kernel).md` (score: 390.2) 描述 FusedMoE 将 MoE 层的 token routing → expert dispatch → grouped GEMM → activation → weighted combine 融合为少量 kernel 调用：\n\n```\n// FusedMoE 伪代码（Triton kernel，vLLM实现）\n// 输入: hidden_states [num_tokens, hidden_dim]\n//       expert_weights [num_experts, hidden_dim, inter_dim*2]\n// 输出: output [num_tokens, hidden_dim]\n\n// Step 1: Router (Gate) → 极轻量，O(N·d·E)\ngate_logits = hidden_states @ router_weight  # [N, E]\ntopk_weights, topk_ids = topk(gate_logits, k=2)  # [N, 2]\n\n// Step 2: Expert Dispatch → 重排序tokens\n// 通过argsort将同expert的tokens聚集到连续区域\nsorted_indices = argsort(topk_ids.flatten())\nsorted_tokens = hidden_states[sorted_indices]\nexpert_offsets = compute_offsets(topk_ids)  # 每expert处理多少token\n\n// Step 3: Grouped GEMM（单次Triton kernel）→ compute-bound\n// 利用Triton的block-level parallelism\n@triton.jit\ndef grouped_gemm_kernel(tokens, weights, offsets, output):\n    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n    expert_id, block_id = decode_pid(pid, offsets)\n    # 每thread block处理一个expert的一个tile\n    token_tile = load_token_tile(tokens, offsets[expert_id] + block_id)\n    weight_tile = load_weight_tile(weights[expert_id], block_id)\n    output_tile = tl.dot(token_tile, weight_tile)  # Tensor Core MMA\n    store_output_tile(output, output_tile)\n\n// Step 4: Weighted Combine\nfor k in range(top_k):\n    output += topk_weights[:, k:k+1] * expert_outputs[k]\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `num_tokens`=batch中token总数；`hidden_dim`~4096（Mixtral 8x7B）；`inter_dim`~14336；`num_experts`=8；`topk_ids` [N,2] 稀疏路由结果\n- **复杂度分析**: Router O(N·d·E) memory-bound（小矩阵）；Grouped GEMM O(N·d·inter_dim/k) compute-bound（大矩阵，Tensor Core高效）\n- **硬件收益**: H100上FusedMoE vs naive实现减少 kernel launch overhead（~100次→~5次），减少 HBM round-trip（中间tensor不写回HBM），15-20%吞吐提升\n\n**(c) GPU-side Block Table 消除 CPU↔GPU 同步**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention (GPU 端 PagedAttention Block Table).md` (score: 23.2) 指出 BrownoutServe 将 block table 从 CPU 移入 GPU 显存：\n\n```\n// vLLM原始: CPU-side block table\nblock_table_cpu[req_id] = [phys_0, phys_1, ...]  // Python分配\ncudaMemcpy(block_table_gpu, block_table_cpu, ...) // 每iteration传输\n// 问题: cudaMemcpy 延迟 ~5-10μs/iteration\n\n// BrownoutServe: GPU-side block table\n// block_table 分配在GPU memory，更新通过GPU kernel:\n@triton.jit\ndef update_block_table(bt_ptr, req_idx, phys_block):\n    bt_ptr[req_idx, free_slot] = phys_block\n// 消除CPU↔GPU传输，decode iteration overhead 减少 ~50%\n```\n\n---\n\n### 方法2: SGLang Scheduler —— RadixAttention + Token-Level KV-cache Pool\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md` (score: 291.2)\n\n**方法细节**（L2调度框架执行模拟）：\n\nSGLang (LMSYS) 的核心调度创新为 **RadixAttention** —— 基于 Radix Tree（压缩前缀树）的 KV Cache 自动前缀复用，区别于 vLLM 的 hash-based prefix caching：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        SGLang Scheduler + RadixAttention 请求处理时序\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nT=0.0ms  [HTTP Request 到达]\n         POST /generate {\"prompt\": \"The theory of relativity explains...\"}\n\nT=0.1ms  [RadixAttention 前缀匹配 —— 核心调度创新]\n         ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n         │ Radix Tree（压缩前缀树）结构:                  │\n         │                                              │\n         │  root                                        │\n         │   └─ \"The theory of \" ──── [KV_blk_0]       │ ← 跨请求共享\n         │        ├─ \"relativity\" ─── [KV_blk_1]       │ ← Req_A缓存\n         │        │    ├─ \" explains\" ─ [KV_blk_2]     │ ← Req_A继续\n         │        │    └─ \" is complex\" ─ [KV_blk_3]   │ ← Req_B分支\n         │        └─ \"evolution\" ────── [KV_blk_4]     │ ← Req_C路径\n         │                                              │\n         │ 新请求 \"The theory of relativity explains...\"│\n         │ 匹配路径: root→\"The theory of \"→\"relativity\" │\n         │ → 命中 blk_0 + blk_1 (2 blocks缓存命中)      │\n         │ → 跳过prefill，直接复用已有KV cache            │\n         │ → 仅需prefill未命中部分: \"explains...\"         │\n         └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nT=0.2ms  [Token-Level KV-Cache 物理分配]\n         # 与vLLM block-level(16 tokens/block)不同，\n         # SGLang采用token-level粒度:\n         for matched_segment in radix_tree.match_prefix(prompt):\n             req.token_kv_ptrs.append(matched_segment.kv_ptr)\n         for remaining_token in unmatched_tokens:\n             new_kv_slot = kv_pool.allocate_token()  # 单token分配\n             req.token_kv_ptrs.append(new_kv_slot)\n\nT=0.5ms  [In-Flight Batching 调度]\n         # 混合prefill和decode请求\n         decode_reqs = [r for r in running if r.is_decode]\n         prefill_reqs = schedule_prefills(waiting, available_memory)\n         batch = decode_reqs + prefill_reqs\n\nT=0.8ms  [模型执行 —— FlashInfer Backend]\n         # FlashInfer是SGLang的底层attention kernel库\n         # 支持BSR(Block-Sparse Row)格式的Paged KV-cache\n         if prefill_reqs:\n             flashinfer.prefill_with_paged_kv_cache(prefill_reqs)\n         if decode_reqs:\n             flashinfer.decode_with_paged_kv_cache(decode_reqs)\n\nT=1.0ms  [CUDA Graph Decode Launch]\n         # Pure decode batch走CUDA Graph快速路径\n         # launch overhead <0.5ms（笔记SGLang记录）\n         cudaGraphLaunch(decode_graph_exec, compute_stream)\n\nT=1.5ms  [Token 采样 + Radix Tree 更新]\n         for req in batch:\n             next_token = sample(req.logits)\n             # 新token的KV自动插入Radix Tree\n             radix_tree.insert(req.full_sequence, next_token_kv_ptr)\n             # 后续请求可自动复用\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **数据结构**: Radix Tree 节点存储 `{token_seq: bytes, kv_cache_ptr: int64, ref_count: int, children: dict[token_id → node]}`；Token-level KV pool 为 linked-list 结构（笔记PiLLM/5-Implementation）\n- **并发粒度**: Radix Tree 的查找/插入为 Python 端单线程操作（~μs级别），与 GPU kernel 执行（~ms级别）相比开销可忽略\n- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: SGLang 使用 `torch.compile` + Triton JIT 生成 GPU kernel（运行时编译），vs TensorRT-LLM 的 AoT 离线编译。JIT更灵活但引入首次编译延迟\n\n**硬件体系结构 —— SGLang的GPU硬件特定优化**:\n\n**(a) FlashInfer BSR (Block-Sparse Row) Attention Kernel**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity.md` (score: 171.4) 描述 FlashInfer 使用 BSR 格式统一表示 Paged KV-cache：\n\n```\n// BSR格式: KV-cache pages → BSR non-zero blocks\n// page table / radix tree → BSR indices (kv_indptr + kv_indices)\n// 支持任意block sizes (Br, Bc) — Br对齐query tile, Bc由KV-cache粒度决定\n// Vector sparsity (Bc=1): page-level KV-cache sparsity for token-level scheduling\n//\n// 关键: gather/scatter将分散的global memory搬运到contiguous shared memory\n// → 在dense shared memory数据上使用Tensor Core MMA\n// → 避免irregular sparse pattern导致的memory access inefficiency\n```\n\n**(b) SM Spatial Sharing (Bullet方案)**\n\n笔记 SGLang 记录 Bullet 在 SGLang v0.4.6 基础上实现 SM 分区并行：\n- Prefill worker 和 Decode worker 作为两个独立进程\n- 使用 MPS spatial sharing + `libsmctrl` SM masking\n- CUDA IPC 共享 GPU memory、ZeroMQ 传递 metadata（CPU端）\n- 此方案使 prefill（compute-bound）和 decode（memory-bound）在不同 SM 分区上并行，避免资源竞争\n\n**跨平台适配现状**:\n\n| 平台 | 适配状态 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| NVIDIA H100/A100 | 原生完全支持 | FlashInfer + CUDA Graph + torch.compile + Triton |\n| Mooncake Store | 2025.09 正式支持 | KV Cache 分布式池化共享 |\n| 华为 Ascend 910B | 笔记未明确说明 | RadixAttention tree逻辑(Python端)硬件无关，但FlashInfer(CUDA)需替换为CANN算子 |\n| AMD MI300X | Triton ROCm backend理论可行 | 笔记未验证，wavefront=64 vs warp=32差异需适配 |\n| Google TPU | 笔记未明确说明 | — |\n\n---\n\n### 方法3: TensorRT-LLM —— C++ Runtime + Graph Optimization Pipeline\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md` (score: 188.2), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md` (score: 16.5)\n\n**方法细节**（L2框架执行模拟）：\n\nTensorRT-LLM (NVIDIA) 是 FasterTransformer 的后继者，采用 **离线图优化 + 运行时 C++ 执行** 架构：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      TensorRT-LLM 推理编译与运行时执行流程\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPhase 1: 离线编译（AoT Graph Optimization）\n\n[Step 1] 模型导入与IR构建\n  HuggingFace PyTorch checkpoint\n    → TensorRT-LLM Python Model Definition API\n    → 构建 GraphIR（内部计算图中间表示）\n    → 注入并行策略: TP(切Attention/Norm) + EP(分布Expert权重) + PP\n\n[Step 2] Graph Optimization Pass Pipeline\n  ├─ Operator Fusion Pass:\n  │   ├─ GEMM + GELU/SwiGLU → fused_gemm_activation\n  │   ├─ LayerNorm + QKV Projection → fused_ln_qkv\n  │   ├─ MoE: Router + Dispatch + GroupedGEMM + Combine → FusedMoE\n  │   └─ Residual Add + LayerNorm → fused_residual_layernorm\n  ├─ Memory Planning Pass:\n  │   ├─ 预分配 KV Cache buffer（PagedAttention兼容格式）\n  │   ├─ 中间tensor buffer复用（liveness分析→最小化peak memory）\n  │   └─ Workspace预分配（量化scale/zero_point存储）\n  ├─ Kernel Auto-Tuning Pass:\n  │   ├─ GEMM: cuBLASLt / CUTLASS / custom kernel 在线profile选最优\n  │   ├─ Attention: FlashAttention-2 / FlashAttention-3 (Hopper)\n  │   └─ MoE: NVLink one-sided alltoall（替代AllGather+ReduceScatter）\n  └─ FP8 Precision Pass (H100 SM90):\n      ├─ 量化校准: FP16 weights → FP8 E4M3 (per-tensor/channel scale)\n      ├─ Transformer Engine集成（动态管理scaling factor）\n      └─ FP8 Tensor Core GEMM路径（wgmma指令）\n\n[Step 3] TRT Engine 序列化\n  GraphIR + 优化后kernel binary → 单一TRT Engine文件\n  → 写入磁盘（跨session复用，无需重新编译）\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nPhase 2: 运行时推理（C++ Runtime — GptSession）\n\n[Step 4] Execution Context 初始化\n  TRT Engine 加载 → 创建 GptSession\n  ├─ 预分配 input/output/kv-cache tensor buffers\n  ├─ CUDA Graph 预录制（decode专用，固定batch size + seq len）\n  └─ 多个 CUDA stream 预分配（计算stream + 通信stream + copy stream）\n\n[Step 5] In-Flight Batching (IFB) 调度循环\n  while not all_requests_done:\n      # 动态批次管理\n      new_reqs = poll_incoming()\n      for req in new_reqs:\n          slot = alloc_ifb_slot()  # 分配IFB slot\n          req.state = CONTEXT  # Prefill阶段\n\n      # Context Phase (Prefill) & Generation Phase (Decode) 同批混合\n      context_slots = [s for s in slots if s.state == CONTEXT]\n      gen_slots = [s for s in slots if s.state == GENERATION]\n\n      # 分阶段执行\n      if context_slots:\n          execute_context_phase(context_slots)  # compute-bound\n      if gen_slots:\n          if use_cuda_graph:\n              cudaGraphLaunch(gen_graph_exec)   # 单次launch\n          else:\n              execute_generation_phase(gen_slots)  # memory-bound\n\n      # KV Cache更新 + 完成检测\n      for slot in slots:\n          if slot.gen_token == EOS:\n              free_ifb_slot(slot)\n\n[Step 6] MoE Layer 执行细节（基于FasterTransformer MoE实现）\n  对每个MoE层:\n  1. Router: token → gate_logits → top-k expert indices + weights\n  2. Token Dispatch: 按expert_id排序 → 连续内存布局\n  3. Expert FFN: CUTLASS Grouped GEMM (FP8/FP16/INT4)\n     - 利用CUB radix sort进行token routing排序\n     - Grouped GEMM避免per-expert独立kernel launch\n  4. Token Combine: 按原始token顺序重排 + 加权求和\n  5. NVLink One-Sided AlltoAll: 跨GPU expert并行通信\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **数据结构**: `IFB Slot` = `{state: CONTEXT|GENERATION|DONE, kv_cache_blocks[], tokens_generated: int, sampling_params: struct}`；`GptSession` 封装多GPU执行上下文\n- **并发粒度**: In-flight batching 在 iteration 级别混合 prefill 和 decode；NVLink one-sided alltoall 通过 GPU 硬件 RDMA 引擎异步执行，与 expert FFN 计算 overlap\n- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: TensorRT-LLM 将重量级优化（算子融合、kernel选择、内存规划）全部前移到离线编译，运行时仅需执行预编译 TRT Engine——CPU overhead 接近零\n\n**硬件体系结构 —— TensorRT-LLM 的 H100 深度整合**:\n\n**(a) FP8 Tensor Core（Transformer Engine）**\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/FP8 Quantization for MoE Inference.md` (score: 17.8) 记录：\n- H100 FP8 Tensor Core 峰值: 1979 TFLOPS（vs FP16: 989 TFLOPS）\n- Mixtral 8x7B 在 2×H100 上 FP8 streaming 达 38.4 req/s（NVIDIA blog报告）\n- 需管理 FP8→FP16 scaling factor，TensorRT-LLM 通过 Transformer Engine 库自动处理\n\n**(b) TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) 异步数据搬运**\n\n笔记 `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3.../3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md` (score: 15243.6) 详细描述 TMA 在 attention kernel 中的用法：\n\n```\n// TMA warp-specialization + pingpong scheduling (FlashAttention-3)\n// 两个warpgroup: Producer (DQ) 和 Consumer (DC)\n\n// Producer (DQ): 使用TMA异步预取数据\nfor each tile:\n    tma_load(K_tile, V_tile)  // HBM→SMEM, TMA硬件执行, 不占CUDA core\n    // TMA自动处理:\n    //   - PagedAttention场景: 通过virtual shape tensor map descriptor\n    //   - 非连续memory: SM90_TMA_LOAD_PAGED_OP处理page边界\n    //   - hardware barrier: 写入完成后自动signal Consumer\n\n// Consumer (DC): 在TMA搬运期间同时执行计算\nfor each tile:\n    wait(tma_barrier)  // 等待TMA完成当前tile搬运\n    WGMMA(Q_tile, K_tile)  // Tensor Core MMA (SMEM数据)\n    softmax + rescale\n    WGMMA(P_tile, V_tile)\n    // 与Producer的下一轮TMA搬运完全重叠\n```\n\n**注解**: TMA 使 H100 上的 attention 计算与数据搬运完全 overlap，HBM bandwidth utilization 提升至接近理论峰值\n\n**(c) 跨硬件移植限制**\n\nTensorRT-LLM 深度绑定 NVIDIA 生态（CUDA/CUBLAS/CUDNN/NCCL/Transformer Engine），跨平台移植最困难：\n\n| 硬件平台 | 移植状态 | 原因 |\n|----------|----------|------|\n| NVIDIA H100/A100 | 完整支持 | 原生CUDA生态 |\n| AMD MI300X | 笔记未明确说明 | C++ runtime闭源，依赖CUDA API |\n| NPU Ascend 910B | 笔记未明确说明 | CANN算子库≠CUDA生态 |\n| Google TPU | 不适用 | XLA编译器路径，架构完全不相容 |\n\n---\n\n### 方法4: LightLLM / Mooncake / TGI 调度器要点\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/74-PiLLM.../5-Implementation.md` (score: 1058.1), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md` (score: 30.2)\n\n#### (a) LightLLM — Token-Level KV Cache + PD分离\n\nPiLLM 论文 (5-Implementation) 描述 LightLLM 调度架构：\n\n```\nLightLLM / PiLLM 三层架构:\n┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Layer 1: API Layer                    │\n│   - 客户端请求入口                     │\n│   - Input length信息收集             │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Layer 2: Global Scheduling Layer      │\n│   ├─ Dispatcher: 按计算特征路由请求    │\n│   └─ Instance Count Manager: GPU资源  │\n│       动态分配 + spike reaction      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Layer 3: Execution Instances          │\n│   ├─ Prefill Instances: 输入token处理 │\n│   └─ Decode Instances: 输出token生成  │\n│   (Token-level KV cache = linked list │\n│    而非block-level，支持batch内共享)   │\n└──────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nToken-Level KV Cache (区别于vLLM block-level):\n  KV cache = linked list of individual token slots\n  每个token slot独立分配/释放（非16-token block）\n  优势: 任意粒度跨请求共享、batch内memory sharing灵活\n  代价: 管理metadata overhead更高（per-token vs per-block）\n```\n\n#### (b) Mooncake Store — KVCache 分布式存储引擎\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md` (score: 30.2):\n\n- **Transfer Engine**: 拓扑感知多协议（RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared Memory），40GB KVCache 达 190 GB/s (8×400Gbps RoCE)\n- **Store**: 分布式缓存池（DRAM/VRAM/NVMe分层），已集成vLLM/SGLang/TensorRT-LLM\n- **Conductor**: KVCache感知全局调度器\n- **2025里程碑**: vLLM-Ascend (2025.08)、SGLang (2025.09)、TensorRT-LLM (2025.12)\n\n#### (c) TGI (Text Generation Inference)\n\n笔记 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Batched MoE Inference.md` 仅提及 TGI 支持 continuous batching。TGI 的 Rust-based router + watermark-based batching 的具体实现在 vault 中**笔记未明确说明**——以下基于公开知识补充：\n- Rust Router: HTTP/gRPC层，watermark策略（pending请求数≥N 或 最老请求age≥T_max → 触发batch），延迟<100μs\n- Python Backend: HuggingFace Transformers + Flash Attention/Paged Attention集成\n- 硬件无关性: Rust router为CPU端组件（纯CPU）；Python backend通过PyTorch支持CUDA/ROCm\n\n---\n\n## 二、框架Dispatcher与硬件Command Queue交互深度\n\n### 2.1 GPU 侧（NVIDIA H100/A100）\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      Serving框架 → CUDA Driver → GPU Hardware 全链路\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n[Layer 1: 框架 Scheduler]\nvLLM Scheduler (Python) / TensorRT-LLM Runtime (C++)\n  ├─ 组装batch、管理block table\n  ├─ 调用 model_runner.execute_model() 或 GptSession::execute()\n  └─ 最终路径: cudaGraphLaunch() 或 cudaLaunchKernel()\n\n[Layer 2: CUDA Driver/Runtime (Userspace)]\ncudaGraphLaunch(cudaGraphExec_t, cudaStream_t)\n  → CUDA Driver内部: 参数校验、地址翻译、stream排队\n  → Host→Device Command Push (通过MMIO写入GPU Command Buffer)\n  → 开销: CUDA Graph: <5μs total; 独立kernel: ~3-5μs per kernel\n\n[Layer 3: GPU Hardware — GigaThread Engine]\n  ├─ 接收CUDA stream中的kernel blocks队列\n  ├─ 读取每个SM的available resources:\n  │   thread_capacity, free_shared_mem, free_registers\n  ├─ Left-Over Scheduling (闭源，不可配置):\n  │   for each pending block:\n  │     for each SM (0..131 for H100):\n  │       if SM.free_threads >= block.threads:\n  │         dispatch(block, SM)\n  │         break\n  └─ Block分配粒度: 每个block只能被1个SM执行（不拆分）\n\n[Layer 4: Per-SM Warp Scheduler + Dispatch Unit]\n  ├─ Warp Scheduler: 从dispatched blocks选active warps\n  │   (round-robin或priority-based, 硬件决策)\n  ├─ Dispatch Unit: 发射warp指令到执行单元\n  │   (每个cycle可发射1条warp指令 per scheduler)\n  └─ 执行单元:\n      ├─ Tensor Core (第4代): FP8/FP16/INT8 MMA (wgmma指令)\n      ├─ CUDA Core: FP32 FMA + INT32 ALU\n      ├─ SFU: sin/cos/exp/sqrt等超越函数\n      └─ LD/ST Unit: shared memory + global memory访问\n```\n\n**注解**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元).md`, score: 13.7）:\n- **MAC数量**: H100 per SM含4个第4代Tensor Core，每Tensor Core每时钟1024 FP16 FMA=2048 ops；132 SM×4×2048×1.98GHz≈2000 TFLOPS FP8；989 TFLOPS FP16\n- **带宽**: H100 HBM3 3.35 TB/s; L2 Cache 50MB (~12 TB/s); SMEM per SM 256KB (~200 TB/s per SM)\n- **闭源限制**: GPU Dispatch Unit细节未公开。left-over scheduling策略不可配置，μShare通过修改kernel blocksize间接影响调度决策（非直接控制）\n- **并行度**: 单H100可同时执行的最多blocks取决于SM数(132)×per-SM max blocks(32)=4224 blocks，但受shared memory/register限制\n\n### 2.2 NPU 侧（华为 Ascend 910B）\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      Serving框架 → CANN → Ascend NPU Hardware 全链路\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n[Layer 1: 框架 Scheduler]\nvLLM-Ascend / MixServe\n  ├─ vLLM Python Scheduler（复用，硬件无关）\n  ├─ CANN Adapter: CUDA API → CANN API 映射层\n  └─ Ascend Graph 替代 CUDA Graph（静态图编译）\n\n[Layer 2: CANN (Compute Architecture for Neural Networks)]\n  ├─ ACL (Ascend Computing Library):\n  │   提供GEMM/Conv/Attention等预优化算子\n  │   等价于cuBLAS/cuDNN\n  ├─ Ascend Graph (图编译):\n  │   计算图→Task Descriptor Chain→硬件TS执行\n  │   与CUDA Graph的关键差异: 硬件TS直接解析执行,\n  │   无需类似GigaThread Engine的软件层干预\n  └─ HCCL (Huawei Collective Communication Library):\n     替代NCCL, 支持HCCS(片间互联60 GB/s)+RoCE(25 GB/s)\n\n[Layer 3: Ascend NPU Hardware Task Scheduler (TS)]\n  ├─ 接收编译好的Task Descriptor Chain\n  ├─ 按task dependency顺序发射到AI Core\n  ├─ 支持配置优先级 + task queue depth\n  │   (vs GPU Dispatch Unit闭源不可配置)\n  └─ 笔记未明确说明TS的调度策略细节\n\n[Layer 4: Da Vinci AI Core]\n  ├─ Cube Unit (脉动阵列): MatMul主力, 等价GPU Tensor Core\n  │   但数据流模式不同 (systolic vs MMA指令)\n  ├─ Vector Unit (SIMD): 向量计算, 等价GPU CUDA Core\n  ├─ Scalar Unit: 标量/控制流\n  └─ L1 Buffer + L0 Buffer:\n     (分离设计, 非GPU shared memory统一模型)\n```\n\n**注解**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused AR-A2A Communication Algorithm.md`, score: 21.7）:\n- **MixServe实测**: Ascend 910B上DeepSeek-R1 TTFT 2.67× vs vLLM TP+PP, 1.70× vs vLLM DP+EP\n- **通信架构差异**: HCCS片间60 GB/s vs NVLink 900 GB/s——跨节点通信成为Ascend集群的主要瓶颈（MixServe的Fused AR-A2A算法正是为解决此问题）\n- **片上存储差异**: Ascend 910B L1 Buffer与GPU shared memory的容量/bank结构不同，PagedAttention的tile size需针对性调优。vault中未提供精准spec数值\n- **Task Descriptor Chain vs CUDA Graph**: Ascend Graph编译后产出task descriptor chain，由硬件TS直接解析——消除了GPU上GigaThread Engine的软件层block调度延迟\n\n### 2.3 三大硬件平台 Serving 适配关键差异对比\n\n```\n┌──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┐\n│   适配维度        │  NVIDIA GPU      │  华为 Ascend NPU  │  Google TPU      │\n│                  │  (CUDA/H100)     │  (CANN/910B)     │  (XLA/v5p)       │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 编程模型          │ CUDA C++/Python  │ CANN C++/Python  │ XLA HLO          │\n│                  │ 灵活kernel开发   │ ACL算子库+TS调度  │ (编译器驱动,     │\n│                  │                  │                  │  不可手写kernel) │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ KV Cache管理      │ PagedAttention   │ PagedAttention   │ 编译器静态管理   │\n│                  │ (动态block分配)  │ (需CANN适配)     │ (运行时不可变)   │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 片上存储         │ Shared Memory    │ L1 Buffer (分离) │ Vector Memory    │\n│                  │ (256KB/SM,       │ + L0 Buffer      │ (编译器管理)     │\n│                  │  可编程分配)     │ (硬件管理)       │                  │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 图调度机制        │ CUDA Graph       │ Ascend Graph     │ XLA编译期调度    │\n│                  │ (Record→Replay,  │ (Task Descriptor │ (静态图,         │\n│                  │  GigaThread分发) │  Chain→硬件TS)   │  无运行时调度)   │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ Kernel Launch    │ ~3-10μs/kernel   │ 笔记未明确说明   │ 0 (编译期固定)   │\n│ Overhead         │ →~100μs total    │                  │                  │\n│                  │ CUDA Graph解决)  │                  │                  │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 集合通信          │ NCCL (NVLink     │ HCCL (HCCS       │ ICI (Inter-Chip  │\n│                  │  900 GB/s)       │  60 GB/s)        │  Interconnect)   │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ Dispatch可控性   │ 低 (GigaThread   │ 中 (TS可配置     │ 无 (编译器决定)  │\n│                  │  Engine闭源)     │  queue depth)    │                  │\n├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n│ 框架移植难度      │ 原生支持         │ 中等 (CANN适配   │ 高 (XLA路径      │\n│                  │ (基准平台)       │  即可, 非易架构) │  完全重编译)     │\n└──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **SM亲和性绑定**(GPU): Bullet/SGLang通过`libsmctrl`实现SM masking，将prefill和decode绑定不同SM分区——但这是利用CUDA MPS特性间接实现，非直接控制GPU Dispatch Unit\n- **片上buffer感知**(NPU): Ascend 910B的L1 Buffer分离设计（非GPU unified SMEM），PagedAttention block size可能需要从16调整为NPU友好的粒度（vault未提供具体优化数值）\n- **TPU编译期边界**: XLA在编译期完成所有算子排布和内存分配，运行时零scheduling overhead——但代价是完全丧失动态batch灵活性。MoE的动态expert routing在TPU上通过编译器静态unrolling处理（非运行时动态dispatch）\n\n---\n\n## 三、方法对比表\n\n| 框架 | 核心调度机制 | 实现语言 | 硬件平台 | 关键硬件优化 | 跨平台移植 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|-------------|----------|----------|-------------|-----------|---------|\n| **vLLM** | PagedAttention block管理 + Continuous Batching + Prefix Caching Hash | Python+C++/CUDA | H100/A100原生; Ascend 910B已集成(2025.08) | CUDA Graph、FusedMoE(Triton)、FP8 Tensor Core、GPU-side block table | CANN适配(vLLM-Ascend)、ROCm社区移植中 | vLLM.md(472.9), vLLM MoE(390.5), Mooncake Store(30.2) |\n| **SGLang** | RadixAttention tree前缀复用 + Token-Level KV Pool + Programmable Scheduler | Python+PyTorch/Triton | H100/A100原生; Mooncake集成(2025.09) | FlashInfer BSR attention、torch.compile JIT、SM spatial sharing | ROCm理论可行(Triton); NPU/TPU未明确 | SGLang.md(291.2), Vector Sparsity(171.4) |\n| **TensorRT-LLM** | AoT图优化 + In-Flight Batching + Execution Context | C++闭源runtime+Python API | NVIDIA GPU专属(H100深度整合) | FP8 Tensor Core、TMA、Transformer Engine、NVLink one-sided alltoall | 跨平台极难(深度绑定CUDA生态) | FasterTransformer(188.2), FP8 MoE(17.8), A2A Comm(16.5) |\n| **LightLLM/PiLLM** | Token-Level KV Cache(linked list) + PD分离 + Hierarchical三层架构 | Python+CUDA | GPU(具体型号笔记未明确) | Token粒度内存共享、细粒度KV分配/释放 | 笔记未明确 | PiLLM 5-Impl(1058.1) |\n| **Mooncake Store** | KVCache分布式缓存 + 拓扑感知传输 + 全局Conductor调度 | C++/Python | 跨平台传输层; 已集成三大框架 | RDMA/RoCE/CXL多协议、分层缓存(DRAM/VRAM/NVMe) | vLLM-Ascend(2025.08)、SGLang(2025.09)、TensorRT-LLM(2025.12) | Mooncake Store(30.2) |\n| **AMoE/AEP** | µ-queue异步expert调度 + Defragging Scheduler | Python+C++ (pybind11, 兼容vLLM) | GPU(兼容vLLM) | 消除all-to-all barrier、GPU自决策layer执行 | 兼容vLLM API(理论上vLLM支持的所有平台) | AEP(206.1) |\n| **MixServe** | Fused AR-A2A通信融合 + 混合TP-EP | Python+C++ (vLLM/Tutel) | Ascend 910B + H20 | HCCL多stream异步、HCCS/RoCE通信重叠 | Ascend 910B(vLLM) + H20(Tutel)实测 | Fused AR-A2A(21.7) |\n\n---\n\n## 四、不确定性\n\n1. **TGI 调度器内部细节**: vault 未找到 TGI 的 Rust router + watermark batching 实现的详细笔记。上述 TGI 内容为公开知识补充，标注「笔记未明确说明」\n2. **S-LoRA 实现**: vault 中未找到 S-LoRA LoRA adapter 动态调度的专门笔记，该框架在答案中未详述\n3. **Ascend 910B 精准硬件参数**: vault 中未找到 Ascend 910B 的 L1 Buffer 大小、MAC 数量、HBM 带宽等精准 spec。上述数据来自论文上下文推断或标注「笔记未明确说明」\n4. **AMD MI300X ROCm 移植**: vault 仅 HipKittens 论文提及 ROCm hardware features，未找到 vLLM/SGLang 在 MI300X 上的基准测试或移植报告\n5. **TPU v5e/v5p 框架适配**: vault 未找到任何 serving 框架在 TPU 上的适配笔记。TPU 分析基于 XLA 编译原理推断\n6. **LightLLM/S-LoRA 性能指标**: 笔记仅描述架构特性，未提供具体 throughput/latency 基准数据\n7. **TMA 在 vLLM PagedAttention 中的具体实现**: 笔记(FlashAttention-3)描述了 TMA 机制和 `SM90_TMA_LOAD_PAGED_OP` 类的存在，但 vLLM 如何具体集成 TMA 的代码路径在 vault 中**笔记未明确说明**\n8. **Mooncake 在单加速器场景下的收益**: Mooncake 设计面向 PD 分离式多节点架构，单加速器场景下其分布式 KV cache 池化优势有限——但笔记未提供单加速器 vs 多节点 Mooncake 的消融实验对比\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q2.5\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":601,"newStart":1,"newLines":691,"lines":["-# Q2.5 — 开源 Serving 框架调度器/Dispatcher 具体实现方式与跨硬件平台适配现状","+# Q2.5 — 开源Serving框架调度器/Dispatcher具体实现与跨GPU/NPU/TPU硬件适配现状"," "," ## 笔记证据概览"," "," | 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |"," |------|------|----------|","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md | 914.7 | vLLM 架构：PagedAttention、continuous batching、CUDA Graph、block table 管理 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md | 188.5 | FasterTransformer/TensorRT-LLM 编译流程、MoE kernel 实现、FP8 支持 |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA _ 张量内存加速器).md | 11417.1 | H100 TMA 硬件加速引擎：异步数据传输、硬件 barrier、multicast |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention.md | 367.0 | BrownoutServe GPU-side block table 优化：消除 CPU→GPU 传输延迟 |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph in MoE Serving.md | 22.2 | CUDA Graph 在 MoE serving 中的录制与重放、PROBE 解决 Graph 兼容性 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Host Kernel Queue _ Device Kernel Queue (HKQ_DKQ).md | 372.4 | Infera HKQ/DKQ 多级队列架构、GDRCopy 低延迟传输 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Daemon Kernel for Device-Side Launch.md | 851.3 | Infera daemon kernel：device-side fire-and-forget launch、<10μs 延迟 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md | 18.4 | Infera 协同编译与调度架构：离线多版本 kernel + 在线动态选择 |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md | 32.9 | FlashMoE megakernel：1 次 launch vs 33-550 次，Scheduler/Processor warp specialization |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 23.7 | MoE All-to-All 通信调度：NVLink one-sided、分层 all-to-all、EPS-MoE 通信-计算 overlap |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/EPD Disaggregation (Encode-Prefill-Decode Disaggregation).md | — | EPD-Serve 三阶段解耦：Encode-Prefill-Decode 在 Ascend NPU 上的部署 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/GPU Task Preemption for Inference.md | 33.2 | Infera GPU 任务抢占：Infera-P ~10μs、Infera-R ~5μs |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md | 11.7 | Nimble 框架调度开销分析：6 步 CPU overhead 消除策略 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM.md | 5314.2 | Fast-dLLM v2 两级缓存 + FlashInfer 作为 vLLM/SGLang/TensorRT-LLM 底层 kernel 库 |","-| paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT.../Keqiu-Li...md | 3055.9 | PAT：vLLM scheduler 集成、block table 与 prefix-aware attention |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/Toward Cost-Efficient Serving of MoE with Asynchrony.md | 1775.1 | vLLM Python/C++ backend 架构、MoE 异步调度 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM.md | 472.9 | vLLM scheduler主循环、PagedAttention block管理、continuous batching流程 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md | 433.2 | CUDA Graph优化、batched speculative decoding、timing分解 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM Inference Framework (for MoE).md | 390.5 | FusedMoE kernel、MoE层forward流程、TP/EP支持、LExI调度修改 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md | 291.2 | RadixAttention请求流程、FlashInfer集成、CUDA Graph decode、Bullet SM masking |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md | 188.2 | TensorRT-LLM图优化pipeline、in-flight batching、FP8/H100、MoE dispatch |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md | 5079.9 | CPU-GPU kernel launch开销6步分解、Nimble AoT scheduling消除策略 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph.md | 15.2 | CUDA Graph生命周期(Construct→Instantiate→Launch)、LLM serving应用 |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元).md | 13.7 | GigaThread Engine、left-over scheduling、block-to-SM分配硬件机制 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md | 30.2 | KV Cache分布式存储、vLLM-Ascend集成(2025.08)、SGLang支持(2025.09) |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Asynchronous Expert Parallelism (AEP _ 异步专家并行).md | 206.1 | AMoE系统µ-queue、Defragging Scheduler(Algorithm 1)、兼容vLLM |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused AR-A2A Communication Algorithm.md | 21.7 | MixServe基于vLLM(Ascend 910B)、HCCL异步通信、TTFT 2.67×加速 |","+| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3.../3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md | 15243.6 | warp-specialization、TMA异步数据搬运、pingpong调度、H100 FP8 |","+| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../EPD-SERVE-...ASCEND.md | 17442.3 | Ascend NPU上EPD分离架构、Mooncake传输、硬件co-location |","+| paper_secs/secs_2026/74-PiLLM.../5-Implementation.md | 1058.1 | LightLLM token-level KV cache、PD分离、hierarchical架构 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FusedMoE (vLLM Fused MoE Kernel).md | 390.2 | Triton grouped GEMM、routing+dispatch+compute融合、15-20%吞吐提升 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Prefix Caching in LLM Serving.md | 29.0 | vLLM block hash前缀缓存实现机制 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Iteration-Level Scheduling.md | 28.8 | vLLM/SGLang迭代级调度、Laser layer-level替代方案 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Batched MoE Inference.md | 18.8 | Continuous batching在MoE中的expert-aware scheduling挑战 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 16.5 | NVLink one-sided alltoall(TensorRT-LLM)、分层all-to-all |"," "," ---"," ","-## 1. vLLM Scheduler 实现与硬件适配","+## 一、方法细节：各框架调度器/Dispatcher实现"," ","-### 1.1 架构概览","+> **侧重：硬件体系结构** —— 重点分析各实现的硬件特定优化与硬件平台适配差异"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md` (score: 914.7)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention.md` (score: 367.0)","+---"," ","-vLLM (UC Berkeley, SOSP 2023) 采用 **Python-frontend + C++/CUDA backend** 分层架构：","+### 方法1: vLLM Scheduler —— Python-frontend + C++/CUDA Backend 架构"," ","-```","-vLLM 架构分层:","-┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│  Python Scheduler (Frontend)                 │","-│  - 请求队列管理 (add_request/abort_request)    │","-│  - Continuous Batching 决策                  │","-│  - Block Table 管理 (CPU 端逻辑映射)          │","-│  - Prefix Caching Hash 计算与管理            │","-│  - Preemption 策略 (Swap/Recompute)          │","-├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  C++/CUDA Backend (Model Executor)           │","-│  - PagedAttention Kernel (GPU 端)            │","-│  - KV Cache Block 物理分配/释放              │","-│  - CUDA Graph 录制与重放                     │","-│  - FlashInfer/CUDA Kernel 调用               │","-├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  GPU Hardware (H100/A100/...)                │","-│  - SM: 执行 attention/FFN kernel             │","-│  - HBM: 存储 KV Cache blocks + 模型权重       │","-│  - TMA: HBM↔SMEM 异步数据传输 (H100)         │","-└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM.md` (score: 472.9), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM Inference Framework (for MoE).md` (score: 390.5), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md` (score: 433.2)"," ","-### 1.2 调度器执行模拟（单 GPU H100，单请求 prefill → decode）","+**方法细节**（L2调度框架执行模拟）："," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md`、`paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT.../Keqiu-Li...md` (score: 3055.9)","+vLLM的Scheduler是推理引擎核心，实现在 `vllm/core/scheduler.py`（Python）配合 C++/CUDA backend。以下为完整的调度框架执行模拟："," ","-以下模拟一个 MoE 模型（Mixtral 8x7B）单请求推理的 vLLM scheduler 执行流程，展示 scheduler 决策与硬件映射：","-"," ```","-═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","-时间轴 (伪时间线，单位 μs)     Scheduler 动作                  GPU 硬件状态","-═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","-T=0      请求到达                Scheduler.add_request()      GPU idle","-         prompt_len=4096         分配 initial blocks","-         ","-T=0~50   Prefill 阶段             Block Table:                 SM 132个全部参与","-         Scheduler 分配 256 个    req_0: [b0,b1,...,b255]     HBM 读取模型权重","-         KV cache blocks          每个 block=16 tokens         Tensor Core 计算 attention","-         (4096/16=256 blocks)     prefix_caching_hash 计算     输出首 token t0","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","+        vLLM Scheduler 主循环执行模拟（Step 1-7）","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"," ","-T=50     Prefill 完成             记录 KV cache 引用          HBM: 256 blocks 已占用","-         CUDA Graph 录制          进入 decode loop             ~1GB KV cache","+T=0ms   [Scheduler._schedule() 被调用]","+        ├─ Step 1: 从 waiting_queue 取出新请求","+        │   new_reqs = self.waiting.popleft()","+        │   对每个 req:","+        │       required_blocks = ceil(req.prompt_len / BLOCK_SIZE)","+        │       if gpu_free_blocks >= required_blocks:","+        │           scheduled_reqs.append(req)","+        │","+        ├─ Step 2: Preemption 检查（内存不足时触发）","+        │   if gpu_free_blocks < needed:","+        │       victims = select_victims(running, policy)","+        │       # policy ∈ {RECOMPUTE, SWAP}","+        │       if policy == RECOMPUTE:","+        │           for v in victims:","+        │               free_blocks(v.block_table)  # 丢弃KV","+        │               v.state = WAITING_FOR_RECOMPUTE","+        │       elif policy == SWAP:","+        │           for v in victims:","+        │               copy_blocks_to_cpu(v.block_table)  # 换出","+        │               v.state = SWAPPED"," ","-T=51~60  Decode Step 1            CUDA Graph 重放:            SM: 1 个 SM 执行 sampling","-         (每 token ~10μs)         1. 取 Q[t0]                 其余 131 SM 执行 attention","-                                  2. PagedAttention 查 block    + expert FFN (top-2 experts)","-                                     table → 读取 K/V","-                                  3. MoE gate: 选 expert_3,7","-                                  4. Expert FFN(3,7)","-                                  5. Sampling → t1","+T=1ms   ├─ Step 3: Block Table 管理（核心数据结构）","+        │   for req in scheduled_reqs:","+        │       num_blocks = ceil(req.max_tokens / 16)","+        │       req.block_table = []  # 逻辑→物理映射表","+        │       for i in range(num_blocks):","+        │           phys_blk = gpu_block_allocator.allocate()","+        │           req.block_table.append(phys_blk)","+        │       # block_table 结构:","+        │       # [phys_blk_0, phys_blk_1, ..., phys_blk_N]","+        │       # 每个phys_blk存16 tokens × num_layers × num_heads K/V"," ","-T=61~70  Decode Step 2            Graph 重放 (同上)           同上","-         ...                                                  ","-T=510    生成第 50 个 token       block 表扩展到 260 blocks    HBM: 260 blocks","-         请求完成 (EOS)           Scheduler 释放 blocks         GC 回收 KV cache","-═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","-```","+T=2ms   ├─ Step 4: Prefix Caching 匹配","+        │   # 对prompt按block_size切分并hash","+        │   prompt_blocks = chunk_tokens(req.prompt_tokens, 16)","+        │   for i, blk in enumerate(prompt_blocks):","+        │       blk_hash = compute_hash(blk)  # 内容hash","+        │       if blk_hash in prefix_cache:","+        │           # 命中 → 复用物理block，跳过prefill计算","+        │           req.block_table[i] = prefix_cache[blk_hash]","+        │           req.num_cached_tokens += 16","+        │       else:","+        │           prefix_cache[blk_hash] = req.block_table[i]"," ","-**注解**:","-- **变量含义**: `req_0` 为请求 ID；`b0..b255` 为物理 block 编号；每个 block 存 16 个 token 的 K/V（head_dim=128, num_heads=32 → 每 block ~128KB）；`prefix_caching_hash` 为 prompt prefix 的哈希值，用于跨请求复用 KV cache。","-- **复杂度分析**: Prefill 阶段计算复杂度 O(L²·d)（L=prompt_len, d=hidden_dim），受 HBM 带宽约束（H100 HBM 带宽 3.35 TB/s）。Decode 阶段每步 O(L·d)，受 Tensor Core 利用率约束——单 token decode 时 Tensor Core 利用率极低（<5%），这是 continuous batching 的核心动机。","-- **数据依赖**: 每 decode step 生成 token t_i → 作为下一步输入 t_{i+1}，严格串行。但 attention 计算内部各 head 独立，可并行。","-- **并发可行性**: vLLM continuous batching 将多请求的 decode step 合并为一个 batch，提升 SM 和 Tensor Core 利用率。单请求场景下并发度受限于模型内算子级并行（如 MoE expert 间并行）。","+T=3ms   ├─ Step 5: Continuous Batching（组装running_batch）","+        │   running_batch = []","+        │   # Prefill请求 + Decode请求混合","+        │   for req in (new_prefill_reqs + running_decode_reqs):","+        │       running_batch.append({","+        │           'req_id': req.id,","+        │           'block_table': req.block_table,","+        │           'context_len': req.num_computed_tokens,","+        │           'is_prefill': req.is_prefill_stage","+        │       })"," ","-### 1.3 Block Table 与 Prefix Caching 实现","+T=4ms   ├─ Step 6: Model Runner 执行","+        │   # 两条硬件执行路径:","+        │   if all(r.is_decode for r in running_batch):","+        │       # 纯decode batch → CUDA Graph 快速路径","+        │       cudaGraphLaunch(decode_graph_exec, compute_stream)","+        │       # 单次launch，GPU自主执行所有kernel","+        │   else:","+        │       # 混合batch → PyTorch eager路径","+        │       model_runner.execute_model(running_batch)","+        │       # MoE模型内部调用 FusedMoE kernel:","+        │       #   router(gate) → top-k select → grouped GEMM → combine"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention.md` (score: 367.0)","-","-vLLM 的 block table 原在 CPU 端管理，BrownoutServe 将其迁移至 GPU 端：","-","+T=5ms   └─ Step 7: 完成检查 + 资源回收","+            for req in running_batch:","+                if req.generated_token == EOS or req.len >= max_tokens:","+                    for blk in req.block_table:","+                        gpu_block_allocator.free(blk)","+                    running_batch.remove(req)"," ```","-// vLLM 原始实现: CPU-side block table","-// 每 iteration 需 CPU→GPU 传输 block_table","-//","-// Scheduler (Python, CPU):","-block_table[req_id] = [phys_block_0, phys_block_1, ..., phys_block_k]","-// 传输到 GPU:","-block_table_gpu.copy_(block_table_cpu)     // ← PCIe 传输延迟"," ","-// BrownoutServe 优化: GPU-side block table","-// block_table 分配为 torch.tensor(device='cuda')","-// Scheduler 更新通过 GPU kernel:","-@triton.jit","-def update_block_table_kernel(block_table_ptr, req_id, new_block):","-    block_table_ptr[req_id, free_slot] = new_block  // 直接 GPU 端更新","-    ","-// Attention kernel 内直接查询 GPU block table:","-physical_block = tl.load(block_table_ptr + req_id * max_blocks + logical_idx)","-k_tile = tl.load(k_cache_ptr + physical_block * block_size * head_dim + ...)","-```","-"," **注解**:","-- **变量含义**: `block_table` 为 [num_requests × max_blocks] 的 int32 矩阵；`physical_block` 为 HBM 中 KV cache block 的实际地址索引；`logical_idx` 为请求内的逻辑 token 位置。","-- **复杂度分析**: GPU-side block table 消除每 iteration 的 CPU→GPU memcpy（典型延迟 ~5-10μs），对于 decode step 仅 10μs 的场景，这是约 50% 的 overhead 削减。","-- **硬件依赖**: 该优化要求 GPU 支持 kernel 内指针间接访问（所有现代 GPU 均支持），且 block table 占用 HBM 极小（如 256 请求 × 2048 blocks × 4B = 2MB）。","+- **变量含义**: `BLOCK_SIZE=16`（每block 16 tokens K/V）、`block_table` 为 `[num_blocks]int32` 映射表（类似OS页表）、`prefix_cache` 为 `{hash → physical_block}` 全局字典、`gpu_block_allocator` 为freelist管理的GPU内存分配器","+- **复杂度分析**: Scheduler主循环 O(N+M)（N=waiting请求数，M=running请求数）；Block分配 O(1)（freelist pop）；Prefix caching hash查找 O(L/16)（L=prompt长度，hash+dict lookup）；Model forward O(L·d² + L²·d)（attention项在decode阶段降至O(L·d)）","+- **数据依赖**: Step 1（请求选择）→ Step 2（preemption判断，内存约束）→ Step 3（block分配，物理资源约束）→ Step 4（prefix匹配，可并行）→ Step 5（batch组装，无数据依赖）→ Step 6（模型执行，严格依赖前序）","+- **并发可行性**: Step 4（prefix caching hash计算）可与Step 3（block分配）并行（分别作用于不同请求子集）；Step 6的CUDA Graph路径独立于CPU scheduler"," ","-### 1.4 vLLM 在 NPU/AMD GPU 上的移植现状","+**硬件体系结构 —— vLLM的GPU硬件特定优化**:"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/EPD Disaggregation (Encode-Prefill-Decode Disaggregation).md`（间接证据）、`learning_outputs/.../Q2.2_L2_answer.md`（间接证据）","+**(a) CUDA Graph 消除 Per-Kernel Launch Overhead**"," ","-| 移植目标 | 状态 | 关键差异与适配 |","-|----------|------|---------------|","-| **华为昇腾 Ascend 910B (CANN)** | vLLM-Ascend 社区 fork 已可用 | (1) PagedAttention kernel 用 CANN 算子重写（替换 CUDA kernel）；(2) Block table 管理保持 Python 端不变，底层通过 Ascend ACL 接口分配 device memory；(3) CUDA Graph → Ascend Graph（CANN 图编译），但 Ascend Graph 对动态 shape 支持较 CUDA Graph 更受限；(4) 通信后端从 NCCL 替换为 HCCL（Huawei Collective Communication Library） |","-| **AMD MI300X (ROCm)** | vLLM ROCm 移植版可用 | (1) CUDA kernel → HIP kernel（多数通过 hipify 自动转换）；(2) PagedAttention 利用 AMD Matrix Core（类似 Tensor Core）但 tile size 和 warp size 差异需手动调优（AMD wavefront=64 vs NVIDIA warp=32）；(3) 内存管理：MI300X 使用统一 HBM 架构（无独立 L1 cache），block table 与 KV cache 共享同一 HBM 池 |","-| **Google TPU v5e/v5p** | 笔记未明确说明 | TPU 通常通过 XLA 编译器路径运行模型，非 vLLM 的原生 CUDA 路径。推断：需将 vLLM 的调度逻辑（block table、continuous batching）与 XLA 编译的 TPU executable 集成，存在较大工程差距 |","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md` (score: 5079.9) 将framework scheduling overhead分解为6个串行CPU步骤："," ","-**注解**:","-- NPU 片上存储差异：vLLM 的 PagedAttention 假设 GPU shared memory（~228KB/SM on H100）用于 attention tile 缓存。NPU Ascend 910B 的片上 buffer 为 L1 buffer（架构不同），大小和 bank 结构差异影响 attention kernel 的 tile size 选择和 bank conflict 避免策略。","-- Ascend Graph vs CUDA Graph：Ascend Graph 在 CANN 中通过 `aclgrphBuildGraph` 接口构建静态图，对 MoE 的动态 expert routing（每 token 激活不同 expert）存在图构建期不确定性挑战——笔记推断与 PROBE 论文中 CUDA Graph 面临的问题类似。","+```","+PyTorch Eager Mode 的 Per-Operator Overhead（每个算子重复）:","+  Step 1: Operator Dispatch     (~20-30μs)  Python→C++ autograd查找","+  Step 2: Output Shape Inference (~10-20μs)  CPU端meta-data计算","+  Step 3: Kernel Selection       (~5-50μs)  cuDNN auto-tune","+  Step 4: Argument Preparation    (~5-10μs)  grid/block dims, strides","+  Step 5: Kernel Launch           (~3-5μs)   cudaLaunchKernel→GPU queue","+  Step 6: Memory Allocation       (amortized) PyTorch caching allocator","+  ─────────────────────────────────────────","+  Total CPU overhead per op:     ~50-115μs","+  Typical GPU compute per op:     ~10μs","+  → GPU idle ratio:              ~90%+"," ","----","+vLLM CUDA Graph 优化（Decode Phase）:","+  预录制整图 → cudaGraphLaunch(exec, stream) 单次提交","+  总CPU overhead: <100μs (整iteration)","+  → GPU idle ratio: 降至 <5%","+```"," ","-## 2. SGLang Scheduler 实现与硬件适配","+**(b) FusedMoE Kernel —— Tensor Core 利用最大化**"," ","-### 2.1 RadixAttention 实现","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FusedMoE (vLLM Fused MoE Kernel).md` (score: 390.2) 描述 FusedMoE 将 MoE 层的 token routing → expert dispatch → grouped GEMM → activation → weighted combine 融合为少量 kernel 调用："," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/7-BlendServe.../span-idpage-13-1spanAlgorithm-3-Dual-Scan.md` (score: 673.9)、`knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM.md` (score: 5314.2)","+```","+// FusedMoE 伪代码（Triton kernel，vLLM实现）","+// 输入: hidden_states [num_tokens, hidden_dim]","+//       expert_weights [num_experts, hidden_dim, inter_dim*2]","+// 输出: output [num_tokens, hidden_dim]"," ","-SGLang (Stanford/LMSYS, 2024) 的核心创新是 **RadixAttention**——基于前缀树（Trie）的 KV cache 池管理：","+// Step 1: Router (Gate) → 极轻量，O(N·d·E)","+gate_logits = hidden_states @ router_weight  # [N, E]","+topk_weights, topk_ids = topk(gate_logits, k=2)  # [N, 2]"," ","-```","-SGLang Scheduler 架构:","-┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│  SGLang Frontend (Python)                     │","-│  ├─ RadixAttention Tree (前缀树)              │","-│  │   - 每个节点: (token_seq, KV cache ptr)    │","-│  │   - 分支: 不同请求的后续 token 分叉         │","-│  │   - 共享: 共同前缀共享 KV cache 节点       │","-│  ├─ Token-level KV-cache Pool 管理            │","-│  │   - 每个 token 独立分配/释放               │","-│  │   - 引用计数 + LRU 驱逐                    │","-│  └─ Programmable Scheduler API                │","-│      (用户可注册调度钩子)                       │","-├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  SGLang Runtime (C++/CUDA/Triton)             │","-│  ├─ torch.compile 集成                        │","-│  │   - 自动 kernel fusion                     │","-│  │   - Triton kernel 生成                     │","-│  ├─ FlashInfer Backend (attention kernel)     │","-│  └─ CUDA Graph (decode phase)                 │","-├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  GPU Hardware                                 │","-└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+// Step 2: Expert Dispatch → 重排序tokens","+// 通过argsort将同expert的tokens聚集到连续区域","+sorted_indices = argsort(topk_ids.flatten())","+sorted_tokens = hidden_states[sorted_indices]","+expert_offsets = compute_offsets(topk_ids)  # 每expert处理多少token"," ","-### 2.2 RadixAttention 调度执行模拟（多请求前缀共享场景）","+// Step 3: Grouped GEMM（单次Triton kernel）→ compute-bound","+// 利用Triton的block-level parallelism","+@triton.jit","+def grouped_gemm_kernel(tokens, weights, offsets, output):","+    pid = tl.program_id(0)","+    expert_id, block_id = decode_pid(pid, offsets)","+    # 每thread block处理一个expert的一个tile","+    token_tile = load_token_tile(tokens, offsets[expert_id] + block_id)","+    weight_tile = load_weight_tile(weights[expert_id], block_id)","+    output_tile = tl.dot(token_tile, weight_tile)  # Tensor Core MMA","+    store_output_tile(output, output_tile)"," ","+// Step 4: Weighted Combine","+for k in range(top_k):","+    output += topk_weights[:, k:k+1] * expert_outputs[k]"," ```","-═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","-场景: 三个请求共享前缀 \"The capital of France\"","-       Req_A: \"The capital of France is Paris\"","-       Req_B: \"The capital of France is a city in Europe\"","-       Req_C: \"The capital of Germany is Berlin\""," ","-Radix Tree 状态:","-                      root","-                       │","-                 \"The capital of\"","-                       │","-                   \"France\" ───── \"Germany\"","-                    /    \\            │","-               \"is Paris\" \"is a city...\"  \"is Berlin\"","-               (Req_A)   (Req_B)        (Req_C)","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `num_tokens`=batch中token总数；`hidden_dim`~4096（Mixtral 8x7B）；`inter_dim`~14336；`num_experts`=8；`topk_ids` [N,2] 稀疏路由结果","+- **复杂度分析**: Router O(N·d·E) memory-bound（小矩阵）；Grouped GEMM O(N·d·inter_dim/k) compute-bound（大矩阵，Tensor Core高效）","+- **硬件收益**: H100上FusedMoE vs naive实现减少 kernel launch overhead（~100次→~5次），减少 HBM round-trip（中间tensor不写回HBM），15-20%吞吐提升"," ","-时间轴        Scheduler 操作                         硬件映射","-──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","-T=0     Req_A 到达 → 在 Radix Tree 中查找      GPU: 计算 prefix hash","-        匹配 prefix=\"The capital of France\"      查询已缓存的 KV","-        → 加载已缓存 KV (4 tokens)              HBM: 读已有 KV cache","-        → 仅需计算 \" is Paris\" 的 KV            SM: 仅 3 个 token prefill","+**(c) GPU-side Block Table 消除 CPU↔GPU 同步**"," ","-T=10    Req_B 到达 → 匹配 prefix=\"The capital     GPU: 复用 A 的 prefix KV","-         of France\" (与 A 共享)                  无需重复计算","-        → 仅 prefill \" is a city in Europe\"      HBM 节省 ~50% KV 存储","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention (GPU 端 PagedAttention Block Table).md` (score: 23.2) 指出 BrownoutServe 将 block table 从 CPU 移入 GPU 显存："," ","-T=20    Req_C 到达 → 仅匹配 prefix=\"The           GPU: 仅复用 \"The capital of\"","-         capital of\" (与 A,B 部分共享)            需 prefill \"Germany is Berlin\"","-        → prefill 剩余 token","+```","+// vLLM原始: CPU-side block table","+block_table_cpu[req_id] = [phys_0, phys_1, ...]  // Python分配","+cudaMemcpy(block_table_gpu, block_table_cpu, ...) // 每iteration传输","+// 问题: cudaMemcpy 延迟 ~5-10μs/iteration"," ","-T=30+   Decode Phase (continuous batching)        CUDA Graph 重放","-        三请求同时 decode                         批量 GPU kernel 执行","-        Radix Tree 每步追加新 token 节点          HBM: 增量分配 KV","-──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","+// BrownoutServe: GPU-side block table","+// block_table 分配在GPU memory，更新通过GPU kernel:","+@triton.jit","+def update_block_table(bt_ptr, req_idx, phys_block):","+    bt_ptr[req_idx, free_slot] = phys_block","+// 消除CPU↔GPU传输，decode iteration overhead 减少 ~50%"," ```"," ","-**注解**:","-- **数据结构**: Radix Tree 每个节点存储 `(token_id, KV_cache_ptr, ref_count, children: dict[token_id → node])`。LRU 驱逐遍历整个树标记可回收节点（ref_count=0 且不在活跃路径上）。","-- **并发粒度**: Tree 操作（查找、插入）在 Python 端单线程执行（~μs 级），与 GPU kernel 执行（~ms 级）不在同一时间尺度，不会成为瓶颈。","-- **硬件权衡**: token-level KV cache 相比 vLLM 的 block-level（16 tokens/block）更细粒度，减少碎片化但增加管理 overhead。在 HBM 带宽充裕的 H100 上，细粒度管理的优势大于 overhead。","+---"," ","-### 2.3 SGLang 硬件移植状态","+### 方法2: SGLang Scheduler —— RadixAttention + Token-Level KV-cache Pool"," ","-**笔记证据**: 笔记未明确说明 SGLang 在 NPU/TPU 上的移植状态。","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md` (score: 291.2)"," ","-- **NVIDIA GPU (H100/A100)**: 原生支持，通过 `torch.compile` + Triton 生成 GPU kernel，配合 FlashInfer 作为 attention backend。","-- **AMD GPU (ROCm)**: 推断：SGLang 依赖 Triton 语言（AMD 有 Triton ROCm backend），理论可移植但需验证 attention kernel 在 AMD Matrix Core 上的性能。","-- **NPU (Ascend)**: 笔记未明确说明。SGLang 的 RadixAttention tree 逻辑是 Python 端实现的（硬件无关），但底层 attention kernel（FlashInfer）为 CUDA 专用，需替换为 CANN 算子。","-- **TPU**: 笔记未明确说明。","+**方法细节**（L2调度框架执行模拟）："," ","----","+SGLang (LMSYS) 的核心调度创新为 **RadixAttention** —— 基于 Radix Tree（压缩前缀树）的 KV Cache 自动前缀复用，区别于 vLLM 的 hash-based prefix caching："," ","-## 3. TensorRT-LLM Runtime 实现与硬件适配","+```","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","+        SGLang Scheduler + RadixAttention 请求处理时序","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"," ","-### 3.1 架构概览","+T=0.0ms  [HTTP Request 到达]","+         POST /generate {\"prompt\": \"The theory of relativity explains...\"}"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md` (score: 188.5)、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 11417.1)","+T=0.1ms  [RadixAttention 前缀匹配 —— 核心调度创新]","+         ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐","+         │ Radix Tree（压缩前缀树）结构:                  │","+         │                                              │","+         │  root                                        │","+         │   └─ \"The theory of \" ──── [KV_blk_0]       │ ← 跨请求共享","+         │        ├─ \"relativity\" ─── [KV_blk_1]       │ ← Req_A缓存","+         │        │    ├─ \" explains\" ─ [KV_blk_2]     │ ← Req_A继续","+         │        │    └─ \" is complex\" ─ [KV_blk_3]   │ ← Req_B分支","+         │        └─ \"evolution\" ────── [KV_blk_4]     │ ← Req_C路径","+         │                                              │","+         │ 新请求 \"The theory of relativity explains...\"│","+         │ 匹配路径: root→\"The theory of \"→\"relativity\" │","+         │ → 命中 blk_0 + blk_1 (2 blocks缓存命中)      │","+         │ → 跳过prefill，直接复用已有KV cache            │","+         │ → 仅需prefill未命中部分: \"explains...\"         │","+         └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘"," ","-TensorRT-LLM (NVIDIA) 是 NVIDIA 官方 LLM 推理框架，架构为 **C++ runtime + graph optimization pipeline**：","+T=0.2ms  [Token-Level KV-Cache 物理分配]","+         # 与vLLM block-level(16 tokens/block)不同，","+         # SGLang采用token-level粒度:","+         for matched_segment in radix_tree.match_prefix(prompt):","+             req.token_kv_ptrs.append(matched_segment.kv_ptr)","+         for remaining_token in unmatched_tokens:","+             new_kv_slot = kv_pool.allocate_token()  # 单token分配","+             req.token_kv_ptrs.append(new_kv_slot)"," ","-```","-TensorRT-LLM 架构:","-┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│  Model Definition (Python API)                │","-│  - 构建 TensorRT-LLM 模型图                   │","-│  - 指定并行策略 (TP/PP/EP)                    │","-│  - 配置 FP8/INT8/INT4 量化                    │","-├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  Graph Optimization Pipeline (C++)            │","-│  - Graph Rewriting (算子融合)                  │","-│  - Memory Planning (KV cache + workspace)     │","-│  - Kernel Auto-Tuning (最佳 kernel 选择)       │","-│  - CUDA Graph Capture (decode loop)            │","-├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  Runtime (C++)                                │","-│  ├─ Execution Context 管理                     │","-│  │   - 维护 per-request KV cache state         │","-│  │   - 管理 in-flight batching slot            │","-│  ├─ In-Flight Batching (IFB)                  │","-│  │   - 动态增删请求 (不中断 decoder)            │","-│  │   - Context Phase (prefill) + Generation    │","-│  │     Phase (decode) 混合调度                 │","-│  └─ GptSession: 统一多 GPU 执行接口            │","-├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  NVIDIA GPU (H100 preferred)                   │","-│  - FP8 Tensor Core (Transformer Engine)        │","-│  - TMA (HBM↔SMEM 异步传输)                    │","-│  - NVLink/NVSwitch (多 GPU 通信)               │","-└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+T=0.5ms  [In-Flight Batching 调度]","+         # 混合prefill和decode请求","+         decode_reqs = [r for r in running if r.is_decode]","+         prefill_reqs = schedule_prefills(waiting, available_memory)","+         batch = decode_reqs + prefill_reqs"," ","-### 3.2 In-Flight Batching 执行模拟（单 GPU H100，MoE 模型）","+T=0.8ms  [模型执行 —— FlashInfer Backend]","+         # FlashInfer是SGLang的底层attention kernel库","+         # 支持BSR(Block-Sparse Row)格式的Paged KV-cache","+         if prefill_reqs:","+             flashinfer.prefill_with_paged_kv_cache(prefill_reqs)","+         if decode_reqs:","+             flashinfer.decode_with_paged_kv_cache(decode_reqs)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md`（FasterTransformer MoE 实现细节）","+T=1.0ms  [CUDA Graph Decode Launch]","+         # Pure decode batch走CUDA Graph快速路径","+         # launch overhead <0.5ms（笔记SGLang记录）","+         cudaGraphLaunch(decode_graph_exec, compute_stream)"," ","+T=1.5ms  [Token 采样 + Radix Tree 更新]","+         for req in batch:","+             next_token = sample(req.logits)","+             # 新token的KV自动插入Radix Tree","+             radix_tree.insert(req.full_sequence, next_token_kv_ptr)","+             # 后续请求可自动复用"," ```","-═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","-TensorRT-LLM IFB 调度模拟 (Mixtral 8x7B, H100)","-═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"," ","-时间    IFB Scheduler                          GPU 硬件","-────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","-T=0     Request_1 到达 (prompt_len=2048)","-        Scheduler 分配 context slot[0]         SM 132 全参与 prefill","-        Context Phase: prefill 2048 tokens      Tensor Core: FP8 MMA","-        → 产出 KV cache + 首 token             TMA: 异步加载权重 tile 到 SMEM","+**注解**:","+- **数据结构**: Radix Tree 节点存储 `{token_seq: bytes, kv_cache_ptr: int64, ref_count: int, children: dict[token_id → node]}`；Token-level KV pool 为 linked-list 结构（笔记PiLLM/5-Implementation）","+- **并发粒度**: Radix Tree 的查找/插入为 Python 端单线程操作（~μs级别），与 GPU kernel 执行（~ms级别）相比开销可忽略","+- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: SGLang 使用 `torch.compile` + Triton JIT 生成 GPU kernel（运行时编译），vs TensorRT-LLM 的 AoT 离线编译。JIT更灵活但引入首次编译延迟"," ","-T=30    Request_2 到达 (prompt_len=512)         SM: Context Phase 与 Generation","-        IFB: Context Phase[slot=1] +            Phase 混合执行","-        Generation Phase[slot=0] 并行           - 60 SM → Request_1 decode","-        (不同 phase 在不同 batch slot)           - 72 SM → Request_2 prefill","+**硬件体系结构 —— SGLang的GPU硬件特定优化**:"," ","-T=35    Request_2 prefill 完成                  SM: 132 全参与 decode","-        IFB 合并: slot[0]+slot[1] 双请求        Tensor Core utilization ↑","-        generation phase","+**(a) FlashInfer BSR (Block-Sparse Row) Attention Kernel**"," ","-T=40    Request_3 到达 (prompt_len=8192)        Context Phase 占用更多 SM","-        IFB: Context[slot=2] + Gen[0,1]         长 prompt → 大量 HBM 访问","-        Scheduler: chunked prefill              分块 prefill 分摊 HBM 压力","-        (8192 tokens 分 4 块, 每块 2048)","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity.md` (score: 171.4) 描述 FlashInfer 使用 BSR 格式统一表示 Paged KV-cache："," ","-T=100   Request_1 完成 (EOS)                    Scheduler 释放 slot[0]","-        IFB: slot[1]+slot[2] decode             KV cache blocks 回收","-        Request_3 的 chunked prefill 继续        ","-────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"," ```","+// BSR格式: KV-cache pages → BSR non-zero blocks","+// page table / radix tree → BSR indices (kv_indptr + kv_indices)","+// 支持任意block sizes (Br, Bc) — Br对齐query tile, Bc由KV-cache粒度决定","+// Vector sparsity (Bc=1): page-level KV-cache sparsity for token-level scheduling","+//","+// 关键: gather/scatter将分散的global memory搬运到contiguous shared memory","+// → 在dense shared memory数据上使用Tensor Core MMA","+// → 避免irregular sparse pattern导致的memory access inefficiency","+```"," ","-**注解**:","-- **数据结构**: Execution Context 维护 `[max_batch_size]` 个 slot，每个 slot 包含：`{request_id, kv_cache_blocks[], tokens_generated, sampling_params, state (IDLE/CONTEXT/GENERATION/DONE)}`。In-Flight Batching 允许在 generation 循环中途插入/移除请求。","-- **FP8 Transformer Engine**: H100 上 TensorRT-LLM 利用 FP8 Tensor Core 执行 GEMM（通过 `Transformer Engine` 库），峰值算力 1979 TFLOPS (FP8) vs 989 TFLOPS (FP16)，但需管理 FP8→FP16 的 scaling factor，增加调度复杂度。","-- **TMA 利用**: 笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` 显示，TMA 在 H100 上实现 HBM→SMEM 异步数据传输（单线程发起、硬件加速 barrier、支持 multicast），TensorRT-LLM 的 attention kernel 可通过 TMA 加载 K/V tile 与 Tensor Core MMA 计算 overlap。","-- **硬件依赖**: TensorRT-LLM 深度绑定 NVIDIA 生态（CUDA、cuBLAS、cuDNN、NCCL、Transformer Engine），跨平台移植难度最大。","+**(b) SM Spatial Sharing (Bullet方案)**"," ","-### 3.3 TensorRT-LLM 跨硬件移植","+笔记 SGLang 记录 Bullet 在 SGLang v0.4.6 基础上实现 SM 分区并行：","+- Prefill worker 和 Decode worker 作为两个独立进程","+- 使用 MPS spatial sharing + `libsmctrl` SM masking","+- CUDA IPC 共享 GPU memory、ZeroMQ 传递 metadata（CPU端）","+- 此方案使 prefill（compute-bound）和 decode（memory-bound）在不同 SM 分区上并行，避免资源竞争"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md`（间接证据：NVLink one-sided alltoall 为 TensorRT-LLM 优化）","+**跨平台适配现状**:"," ","-| 硬件平台 | 移植状态 | 说明 |","-|----------|----------|------|","-| **NVIDIA H100/A100** | 完整支持 | FP8 Tensor Core + TMA + NVLink/NVSwitch 深度优化 |","-| **AMD MI300X** | 笔记未明确说明 | TensorRT-LLM 依赖 CUDA 生态，AMD ROCm 有 HIP 兼容层但 TensorRT-LLM 的图优化引擎（C++ 闭源）不直接可移植。推断需主要重写 |","-| **NPU Ascend 910B** | 笔记未明确说明 | CANN 提供类似图优化的 Ascend Graph，但与 TensorRT-LLM 的 Graph Optimization Pipeline 不兼容 |","-| **Google TPU** | 不适用 | TPU 使用 XLA 编译器路径（JAX/TF），与 TensorRT-LLM 架构不兼容 |","+| 平台 | 适配状态 | 说明 |","+|------|----------|------|","+| NVIDIA H100/A100 | 原生完全支持 | FlashInfer + CUDA Graph + torch.compile + Triton |","+| Mooncake Store | 2025.09 正式支持 | KV Cache 分布式池化共享 |","+| 华为 Ascend 910B | 笔记未明确说明 | RadixAttention tree逻辑(Python端)硬件无关，但FlashInfer(CUDA)需替换为CANN算子 |","+| AMD MI300X | Triton ROCm backend理论可行 | 笔记未验证，wavefront=64 vs warp=32差异需适配 |","+| Google TPU | 笔记未明确说明 | — |"," "," ---"," ","-## 4. TGI (Text Generation Inference) 实现","+### 方法3: TensorRT-LLM —— C++ Runtime + Graph Optimization Pipeline"," ","-**笔记证据**: `learning_outputs/.../Q2.2_L2_answer.md`（间接证据，Q2.2 答案中有详细框架描述）","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md` (score: 188.2), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md` (score: 16.5)"," ","-TGI (HuggingFace) 采用 **Rust-based router + Python backend** 架构：","+**方法细节**（L2框架执行模拟）："," ","+TensorRT-LLM (NVIDIA) 是 FasterTransformer 的后继者，采用 **离线图优化 + 运行时 C++ 执行** 架构：","+"," ```","-TGI 架构:","-┌──────────────────────────────────────┐","-│  Rust Router (高性能 HTTP/gRPC 层)    │","-│  - 请求路由与模型选择                  │","-│  - Watermark-based Batching           │","-│    · 水位线: 当 pending requests ≥ N  │","-│      或 oldest request age ≥ T_max    │","-│      → 触发 batch generation          │","-│  - 并发连接管理与背压控制               │","-├──────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  Python Backend (模型执行)             │","-│  - HuggingFace Transformers 集成       │","-│  - Flash Attention / Paged Attention   │","-│  - 量化支持 (bitsandbytes/GPTQ)        │","-├──────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  GPU Hardware                         │","-└──────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","+      TensorRT-LLM 推理编译与运行时执行流程","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"," ","-**Watermark-based Batching 执行模拟**:","+Phase 1: 离线编译（AoT Graph Optimization）"," ","-```","-时间    Pending Queue        Watermark 状态         动作","+[Step 1] 模型导入与IR构建","+  HuggingFace PyTorch checkpoint","+    → TensorRT-LLM Python Model Definition API","+    → 构建 GraphIR（内部计算图中间表示）","+    → 注入并行策略: TP(切Attention/Norm) + EP(分布Expert权重) + PP","+","+[Step 2] Graph Optimization Pass Pipeline","+  ├─ Operator Fusion Pass:","+  │   ├─ GEMM + GELU/SwiGLU → fused_gemm_activation","+  │   ├─ LayerNorm + QKV Projection → fused_ln_qkv","+  │   ├─ MoE: Router + Dispatch + GroupedGEMM + Combine → FusedMoE","+  │   └─ Residual Add + LayerNorm → fused_residual_layernorm","+  ├─ Memory Planning Pass:","+  │   ├─ 预分配 KV Cache buffer（PagedAttention兼容格式）","+  │   ├─ 中间tensor buffer复用（liveness分析→最小化peak memory）","+  │   └─ Workspace预分配（量化scale/zero_point存储）","+  ├─ Kernel Auto-Tuning Pass:","+  │   ├─ GEMM: cuBLASLt / CUTLASS / custom kernel 在线profile选最优","+  │   ├─ Attention: FlashAttention-2 / FlashAttention-3 (Hopper)","+  │   └─ MoE: NVLink one-sided alltoall（替代AllGather+ReduceScatter）","+  └─ FP8 Precision Pass (H100 SM90):","+      ├─ 量化校准: FP16 weights → FP8 E4M3 (per-tensor/channel scale)","+      ├─ Transformer Engine集成（动态管理scaling factor）","+      └─ FP8 Tensor Core GEMM路径（wgmma指令）","+","+[Step 3] TRT Engine 序列化","+  GraphIR + 优化后kernel binary → 单一TRT Engine文件","+  → 写入磁盘（跨session复用，无需重新编译）","+"," ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","-T=0     [Req_1]              N=1 < N_min(4)         等待","-T=5     [Req_1, Req_2]       N=2 < N_min            等待","-T=10    [Req_1..Req_4]       N=4 ≥ N_min            → 触发 batch","-        batch_size=4 prefill + decode 开始","-T=15    [Req_5]              N=1 < N_min            Req_5 等待","-T=20    [Req_5]              age=10ms ≥ T_max(10ms) → 超时触发","-        batch_size=1 prefill + decode","-─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","-```"," ","-**注解**:","-- **Rust Router 优势**: Rust 零成本抽象 + 无 GC，router 延迟 <100μs（vs Python ~1ms），适合高吞吐场景。","-- **硬件适配**: TGI 的 Rust router 为 CPU 端组件（硬件无关），Python backend 依赖 PyTorch → 理论支持所有 PyTorch 兼容硬件（CUDA/ROCm/DirectML）。但笔记未明确说明在 NPU 上的具体移植工作。","-- **单请求场景适用性**: Watermark-based batching 面向多用户高并发场景。在单请求推理场景中，watermark 机制无实际作用——单请求直接进入 prefill→decode 流程，无批量等待。","+Phase 2: 运行时推理（C++ Runtime — GptSession）"," ","----","+[Step 4] Execution Context 初始化","+  TRT Engine 加载 → 创建 GptSession","+  ├─ 预分配 input/output/kv-cache tensor buffers","+  ├─ CUDA Graph 预录制（decode专用，固定batch size + seq len）","+  └─ 多个 CUDA stream 预分配（计算stream + 通信stream + copy stream）"," ","-## 5. LightLLM 调度实现","+[Step 5] In-Flight Batching (IFB) 调度循环","+  while not all_requests_done:","+      # 动态批次管理","+      new_reqs = poll_incoming()","+      for req in new_reqs:","+          slot = alloc_ifb_slot()  # 分配IFB slot","+          req.state = CONTEXT  # Prefill阶段"," ","-**笔记证据**: `learning_outputs/.../Q2.2_L2_answer.md`（间接证据）","+      # Context Phase (Prefill) & Generation Phase (Decode) 同批混合","+      context_slots = [s for s in slots if s.state == CONTEXT]","+      gen_slots = [s for s in slots if s.state == GENERATION]"," ","-LightLLM 采用 **token-level scheduling** 细粒度调度策略：","+      # 分阶段执行","+      if context_slots:","+          execute_context_phase(context_slots)  # compute-bound","+      if gen_slots:","+          if use_cuda_graph:","+              cudaGraphLaunch(gen_graph_exec)   # 单次launch","+          else:","+              execute_generation_phase(gen_slots)  # memory-bound"," ","+      # KV Cache更新 + 完成检测","+      for slot in slots:","+          if slot.gen_token == EOS:","+              free_ifb_slot(slot)","+","+[Step 6] MoE Layer 执行细节（基于FasterTransformer MoE实现）","+  对每个MoE层:","+  1. Router: token → gate_logits → top-k expert indices + weights","+  2. Token Dispatch: 按expert_id排序 → 连续内存布局","+  3. Expert FFN: CUTLASS Grouped GEMM (FP8/FP16/INT4)","+     - 利用CUB radix sort进行token routing排序","+     - Grouped GEMM避免per-expert独立kernel launch","+  4. Token Combine: 按原始token顺序重排 + 加权求和","+  5. NVLink One-Sided AlltoAll: 跨GPU expert并行通信"," ```","-LightLLM 调度特点:","-┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│  Token-Level Scheduler                      │","-│  - 以单个 token 为调度单元（非 request 级）  │","-│  - 每个 forward step 动态选择 batch 组成    │","-│  - 异步 Encoding 调度 (多模态场景)          │","-│    · Vision Encoder 异步执行                │","-│    · 不阻塞 LLM decode pipeline             │","-├────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  异步 Encoding 流程:                        │","-│  请求含图像 → Vision Encoder 编码(异步)     │","-│             → 编码完成信号 → LLM Prefill    │","-│  请求纯文本 → 直接 LLM Prefill              │","-│  两者可在同一步中混合调度                    │","-├────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  硬件: NVIDIA GPU (CUDA)                    │","-│  笔记未明确说明 NPU/TPU 移植状态             │","-└────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```"," "," **注解**:","-- **Token-level vs Request-level**: Token-level 调度每次 forward 可混合不同请求的不同数量 token（如 Req_1 取 1 token decode + Req_2 取 128 tokens prefill），比 request-level batching 更灵活，GPU 利用率更高。","-- **异步 Encoding**: 多模态场景中，Vision Encoder 计算（ViT 前向）与 LLM Decode 可在不同 SM 分区或不同 GPU 上并行，消除模态间串行等待。","+- **数据结构**: `IFB Slot` = `{state: CONTEXT|GENERATION|DONE, kv_cache_blocks[], tokens_generated: int, sampling_params: struct}`；`GptSession` 封装多GPU执行上下文","+- **并发粒度**: In-flight batching 在 iteration 级别混合 prefill 和 decode；NVLink one-sided alltoall 通过 GPU 硬件 RDMA 引擎异步执行，与 expert FFN 计算 overlap","+- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: TensorRT-LLM 将重量级优化（算子融合、kernel选择、内存规划）全部前移到离线编译，运行时仅需执行预编译 TRT Engine——CPU overhead 接近零"," ","----","+**硬件体系结构 —— TensorRT-LLM 的 H100 深度整合**:"," ","-## 6. Mooncake 调度架构","+**(a) FP8 Tensor Core（Transformer Engine）**"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/vLLM-Omni.../span-idpage-3-0span3.1.-Overview.md` (score: 3756.0)","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/FP8 Quantization for MoE Inference.md` (score: 17.8) 记录：","+- H100 FP8 Tensor Core 峰值: 1979 TFLOPS（vs FP16: 989 TFLOPS）","+- Mixtral 8x7B 在 2×H100 上 FP8 streaming 达 38.4 req/s（NVIDIA blog报告）","+- 需管理 FP8→FP16 scaling factor，TensorRT-LLM 通过 Transformer Engine 库自动处理"," ","-Mooncake 采用 **KV-cache 为中心的分离式架构（Disaggregated Architecture）**：","+**(b) TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) 异步数据搬运**"," ","+笔记 `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3.../3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md` (score: 15243.6) 详细描述 TMA 在 attention kernel 中的用法：","+"," ```","-Mooncake 架构 (以 vLLM-Omni 集成 Mooncake Store 为例):","-┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│  Mooncake Store (分布式 KV Cache 存储)               │","-│  - 拓扑感知的多协议传输引擎 (RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared)     │","-│  - 异步 tensor 传输接口                              │","-│  - KV cache 跨节点/跨实例共享                        │","-├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  vLLM-Omni Backend (多模态模型服务)                   │","-│  ├─ Encoder 实例: 处理视觉/音频编码                   │","-│  ├─ Prefill 实例: LLM prefill + KV cache 构建        │","-│  ├─ Decode 实例: 自回归生成                           │","-│  └─ 通过 Mooncake Store 传输:                        │","-│      - Encoder 特征 → Prefill (E-P 传输)            │","-│      - Prefill KV cache → Decode (P-D 传输)          │","-├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤","-│  硬件: 笔记提及支持 GPU/TPU/其他加速器                 │","-│  具体 NPU 移植状态: 笔记未明确说明                    │","-└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+// TMA warp-specialization + pingpong scheduling (FlashAttention-3)","+// 两个warpgroup: Producer (DQ) 和 Consumer (DC)"," ","-**注解**:","-- Mooncake Store 是 KV-cache 传输的中间件层，其硬件适配主要通过多协议支持实现（RDMA 用于 InfiniBand/RoCE、TCP 用于以太网、CXL 用于 CXL 内存池、Shared Memory 用于同机通信）。","-- 在单加速器场景中，分离式架构的优势有限（无跨机 KV 传输需求），但 EPD 解耦可在单 NPU 上实现逻辑隔离（如 EPD-Serve 的 (E-P)-D 共置模式）。","+// Producer (DQ): 使用TMA异步预取数据","+for each tile:","+    tma_load(K_tile, V_tile)  // HBM→SMEM, TMA硬件执行, 不占CUDA core","+    // TMA自动处理:","+    //   - PagedAttention场景: 通过virtual shape tensor map descriptor","+    //   - 非连续memory: SM90_TMA_LOAD_PAGED_OP处理page边界","+    //   - hardware barrier: 写入完成后自动signal Consumer"," ","----","+// Consumer (DC): 在TMA搬运期间同时执行计算","+for each tile:","+    wait(tma_barrier)  // 等待TMA完成当前tile搬运","+    WGMMA(Q_tile, K_tile)  // Tensor Core MMA (SMEM数据)","+    softmax + rescale","+    WGMMA(P_tile, V_tile)","+    // 与Producer的下一轮TMA搬运完全重叠","+```"," ","-## 7. S-LoRA 调度实现","+**注解**: TMA 使 H100 上的 attention 计算与数据搬运完全 overlap，HBM bandwidth utilization 提升至接近理论峰值"," ","-**笔记证据**: 笔记搜索结果中未找到 S-LoRA 专门知识笔记，以下基于 paper_secs 搜索结果推断。","+**(c) 跨硬件移植限制**"," ","-S-LoRA 专注于 **LoRA adapter 的动态调度与多模型复用**：","+TensorRT-LLM 深度绑定 NVIDIA 生态（CUDA/CUBLAS/CUDNN/NCCL/Transformer Engine），跨平台移植最困难："," ","-- **核心功能**: 在单 GPU 上服务数千个 LoRA adapter（每个 adapter 对应一个微调任务），S-LoRA scheduler 动态加载/卸载 adapter 权重。","-- **调度策略**: 运行时按需加载 adapter（tiered caching：热 adapter 常驻 GPU、温 adapter 缓存 CPU、冷 adapter 从 SSD 加载）。","-- **硬件侧重**: 笔记未明确说明具体硬件适配。推断：adapter 加载/卸载通过 CUDA stream 异步执行，与计算 overlap。","+| 硬件平台 | 移植状态 | 原因 |","+|----------|----------|------|","+| NVIDIA H100/A100 | 完整支持 | 原生CUDA生态 |","+| AMD MI300X | 笔记未明确说明 | C++ runtime闭源，依赖CUDA API |","+| NPU Ascend 910B | 笔记未明确说明 | CANN算子库≠CUDA生态 |","+| Google TPU | 不适用 | XLA编译器路径，架构完全不相容 |"," "," ---"," ","-## 8. 硬件特定优化深度对比","+### 方法4: LightLLM / Mooncake / TGI 调度器要点"," ","-### 8.1 GPU (NVIDIA H100) 硬件特定优化","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/74-PiLLM.../5-Implementation.md` (score: 1058.1), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md` (score: 30.2)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 11417.1)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph in MoE Serving.md`","+#### (a) LightLLM — Token-Level KV Cache + PD分离"," ","-| 优化技术 | 框架利用 | 硬件机制 | 性能影响 |","-|----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| **TMA** | TensorRT-LLM attention kernel、FlashInfer | H100 专用 DMA 引擎：HBM↔SMEM 异步传输、单线程触发、硬件 barrier | 2× small transfer BW vs A100 cp.async；FP8 GEMM 1.4-2.2× over cuBLAS FP16 |","-| **FP8 Tensor Core** | TensorRT-LLM (Transformer Engine) | H100 第4代 Tensor Core，FP8 MMA 1979 TFLOPS | 2× 算力 vs FP16；需管理 scaling factor |","-| **CUDA Graph** | vLLM、SGLang、TensorRT-LLM (decode phase) | GPU 内核级图重放，消除 per-kernel launch overhead（~5-10μs/kernel） | Decode phase kernel launch overhead 从 ~100μs 降至 ~5μs |","-| **NVLink/NVSwitch** | TensorRT-LLM all-to-all (one-sided) | 900 GB/s GPU-GPU 带宽 (H100) | All-to-All 通信 3-5× vs PCIe |","-| **Device-Side Launch** | Infera (daemon kernel) | CUDA Dynamic Parallelism：GPU SM 自主发射 kernel | Launch latency <10μs vs host-side ~50μs |","+PiLLM 论文 (5-Implementation) 描述 LightLLM 调度架构："," ","-### 8.2 NPU (华为昇腾 Ascend 910B) 硬件特定优化","+```","+LightLLM / PiLLM 三层架构:","+┌──────────────────────────────────────┐","+│ Layer 1: API Layer                    │","+│   - 客户端请求入口                     │","+│   - Input length信息收集             │","+├──────────────────────────────────────┤","+│ Layer 2: Global Scheduling Layer      │","+│   ├─ Dispatcher: 按计算特征路由请求    │","+│   └─ Instance Count Manager: GPU资源  │","+│       动态分配 + spike reaction      │","+├──────────────────────────────────────┤","+│ Layer 3: Execution Instances          │","+│   ├─ Prefill Instances: 输入token处理 │","+│   └─ Decode Instances: 输出token生成  │","+│   (Token-level KV cache = linked list │","+│    而非block-level，支持batch内共享)   │","+└──────────────────────────────────────┘"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/EPD Disaggregation.md`（间接证据）、`learning_outputs/.../L4_问题空间.md`（CANN/TBE 信息）","+Token-Level KV Cache (区别于vLLM block-level):","+  KV cache = linked list of individual token slots","+  每个token slot独立分配/释放（非16-token block）","+  优势: 任意粒度跨请求共享、batch内memory sharing灵活","+  代价: 管理metadata overhead更高（per-token vs per-block）","+```"," ","-| 优化技术 | 框架利用 | 硬件机制 | 与 GPU 差异 |","-|----------|----------|----------|-------------|","-| **Ascend Graph** | vLLM-Ascend (图编译重放) | CANN 图编译：静态计算图录制与重放 | 类似 CUDA Graph，但对动态 shape 支持更受限 |","-| **CANN/TBE 算子** | EPD-Serve、vLLM-Ascend | TBE (Tensor Boost Engine)：类似 GPU kernel 的 NPU 算子开发框架 | 需手动适配 attention/KV cache 算子 |","-| **片上 L1 Buffer** | 各框架的 attention kernel | Ascend 910B 片上 buffer 不同于 GPU shared memory | Bank 结构、大小差异影响 tile size 选择 |","-| **HCCL 通信** | EPD-Serve 多 NPU 部署 | Huawei Collective Communication Library | 类似 NCCL，但算法实现和性能特征不同 |","-| **脉动阵列 (Systolic Array)** | MatMul 算子 | Ascend 910B 的矩阵计算单元 | 不同于 GPU Tensor Core 的 MMA 指令；数据流模式差异 |","+#### (b) Mooncake Store — KVCache 分布式存储引擎"," ","-### 8.3 片上存储管理差异对比","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md` (score: 30.2):"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md`（H100 shared memory）、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Attention Buffer _ 片上注意力缓冲区.md`（NPU on-chip buffer）","+- **Transfer Engine**: 拓扑感知多协议（RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared Memory），40GB KVCache 达 190 GB/s (8×400Gbps RoCE)","+- **Store**: 分布式缓存池（DRAM/VRAM/NVMe分层），已集成vLLM/SGLang/TensorRT-LLM","+- **Conductor**: KVCache感知全局调度器","+- **2025里程碑**: vLLM-Ascend (2025.08)、SGLang (2025.09)、TensorRT-LLM (2025.12)"," ","-```","-片上存储层次对比 (单加速器视角):","-                    GPU H100              NPU Ascend 910B       TPU v5e","-──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","-L1/Shared Memory    228 KB/SM             推断: L1 Buffer        向量 Memory","-                    (可编程分配 L1/SMEM)   (架构不同)            (不同于 GPU SMEM)","-L2 Cache            50 MB                 推断: 片上 Buffer      —","-HBM                 80 GB (3.35 TB/s)     推断: HBM (容量待查)    HBM","-──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","+#### (c) TGI (Text Generation Inference)"," ","-Scheduler 影响:","-- GPU:  block table 在 HBM 或 SMEM；attention tile 在 SMEM（228KB 限制 tile size）","-- NPU:  attention KV tile 在 L1 Buffer；block table 管理方式与 GPU 类似但 ","-         buffer 大小和 bank 结构不同→需调整 tile size 和 padding 策略","-- TPU:  XLA 编译器自动管理向量 Memory 分配；scheduler 不需要显式控制 tile 放置","-```","+笔记 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Batched MoE Inference.md` 仅提及 TGI 支持 continuous batching。TGI 的 Rust-based router + watermark-based batching 的具体实现在 vault 中**笔记未明确说明**——以下基于公开知识补充：","+- Rust Router: HTTP/gRPC层，watermark策略（pending请求数≥N 或 最老请求age≥T_max → 触发batch），延迟<100μs","+- Python Backend: HuggingFace Transformers + Flash Attention/Paged Attention集成","+- 硬件无关性: Rust router为CPU端组件（纯CPU）；Python backend通过PyTorch支持CUDA/ROCm"," "," ---"," ","-## 9. 框架与硬件 Command Queue 交互深度","+## 二、框架Dispatcher与硬件Command Queue交互深度"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Host Kernel Queue _ Device Kernel Queue (HKQ_DKQ).md` (score: 372.4)、`knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Daemon Kernel for Device-Side Launch.md` (score: 851.3)","+### 2.1 GPU 侧（NVIDIA H100/A100）"," ","-### 9.1 GPU 上 Kernel Launch Overhead 优化","-"," ```","-传统 Host-Side Launch:","-  CPU: cuLaunchKernel(k1) → wait → cuLaunchKernel(k2) → wait → ...","-       每次 launch 约 5-10μs overhead（driver stack + MMIO）","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","+      Serving框架 → CUDA Driver → GPU Hardware 全链路","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"," ","-CUDA Graph (vLLM/SGLang 使用):","-  # 一次性录制","-  cudaStreamBeginCapture(stream)","-    k1<<<...>>>(); k2<<<...>>>(); ...; kN<<<...>>>();","-  cudaStreamEndCapture(stream, &graph)","-  # 运行时单次重放","-  cudaGraphLaunch(graph_exec, stream)  // <5μs 总 overhead","+[Layer 1: 框架 Scheduler]","+vLLM Scheduler (Python) / TensorRT-LLM Runtime (C++)","+  ├─ 组装batch、管理block table","+  ├─ 调用 model_runner.execute_model() 或 GptSession::execute()","+  └─ 最终路径: cudaGraphLaunch() 或 cudaLaunchKernel()"," ","-Device-Side Launch (Infera daemon kernel):","-  daemon_kernel:  // 常驻 1 个 SM","-    while(true):","-      kernel = DKQ.pop()","-      cudaLaunchDevice(kernel, ...)  // fire-and-forget <10μs","-```","+[Layer 2: CUDA Driver/Runtime (Userspace)]","+cudaGraphLaunch(cudaGraphExec_t, cudaStream_t)","+  → CUDA Driver内部: 参数校验、地址翻译、stream排队","+  → Host→Device Command Push (通过MMIO写入GPU Command Buffer)","+  → 开销: CUDA Graph: <5μs total; 独立kernel: ~3-5μs per kernel"," ","-### 9.2 NPU 上 Task Descriptor 链","+[Layer 3: GPU Hardware — GigaThread Engine]","+  ├─ 接收CUDA stream中的kernel blocks队列","+  ├─ 读取每个SM的available resources:","+  │   thread_capacity, free_shared_mem, free_registers","+  ├─ Left-Over Scheduling (闭源，不可配置):","+  │   for each pending block:","+  │     for each SM (0..131 for H100):","+  │       if SM.free_threads >= block.threads:","+  │         dispatch(block, SM)","+  │         break","+  └─ Block分配粒度: 每个block只能被1个SM执行（不拆分）"," ","-**笔记证据**: 笔记未明确说明 Ascend NPU 的 task descriptor 链细节。推断：Ascend CANN 的 task scheduler 通过 task descriptor queue 管理 NPU 计算任务，类似 GPU 的 command queue 但调度策略和 descriptor 格式不同。","+[Layer 4: Per-SM Warp Scheduler + Dispatch Unit]","+  ├─ Warp Scheduler: 从dispatched blocks选active warps","+  │   (round-robin或priority-based, 硬件决策)","+  ├─ Dispatch Unit: 发射warp指令到执行单元","+  │   (每个cycle可发射1条warp指令 per scheduler)","+  └─ 执行单元:","+      ├─ Tensor Core (第4代): FP8/FP16/INT8 MMA (wgmma指令)","+      ├─ CUDA Core: FP32 FMA + INT32 ALU","+      ├─ SFU: sin/cos/exp/sqrt等超越函数","+      └─ LD/ST Unit: shared memory + global memory访问","+```"," ","-### 9.3 TPU 上 XLA 编译期调度与运行时调度边界","+**注解**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元).md`, score: 13.7）:","+- **MAC数量**: H100 per SM含4个第4代Tensor Core，每Tensor Core每时钟1024 FP16 FMA=2048 ops；132 SM×4×2048×1.98GHz≈2000 TFLOPS FP8；989 TFLOPS FP16","+- **带宽**: H100 HBM3 3.35 TB/s; L2 Cache 50MB (~12 TB/s); SMEM per SM 256KB (~200 TB/s per SM)","+- **闭源限制**: GPU Dispatch Unit细节未公开。left-over scheduling策略不可配置，μShare通过修改kernel blocksize间接影响调度决策（非直接控制）","+- **并行度**: 单H100可同时执行的最多blocks取决于SM数(132)×per-SM max blocks(32)=4224 blocks，但受shared memory/register限制"," ","-**笔记证据**: 笔记未明确说明 TPU XLA 的调度边界。推断：","-- **编译期**: XLA 将模型图编译为 HLO → LLO → TPU executable，此时确定算子 fusion、内存分配、Tile 配置。","-- **运行时**: TPU runtime 仅负责 feed 输入数据、执行编译好的 executable、收集输出。无类似于 GPU 上 vLLM/CUDA Graph 的运行时调度灵活性。","-- **影响**: XLA 的编译期调度更适合固定 shape 的推理负载，但对于 MoE 的动态 expert routing 或可变 prompt 长度的 prefix caching，灵活性不如 GPU 上的 CUDA Graph + runtime scheduler。","+### 2.2 NPU 侧（华为 Ascend 910B）"," ","----","+```","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","+      Serving框架 → CANN → Ascend NPU Hardware 全链路","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"," ","-## 10. Infera 协同编译与调度架构（补充参考）","+[Layer 1: 框架 Scheduler]","+vLLM-Ascend / MixServe","+  ├─ vLLM Python Scheduler（复用，硬件无关）","+  ├─ CANN Adapter: CUDA API → CANN API 映射层","+  └─ Ascend Graph 替代 CUDA Graph（静态图编译）"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md` (score: 18.4)","+[Layer 2: CANN (Compute Architecture for Neural Networks)]","+  ├─ ACL (Ascend Computing Library):","+  │   提供GEMM/Conv/Attention等预优化算子","+  │   等价于cuBLAS/cuDNN","+  ├─ Ascend Graph (图编译):","+  │   计算图→Task Descriptor Chain→硬件TS执行","+  │   与CUDA Graph的关键差异: 硬件TS直接解析执行,","+  │   无需类似GigaThread Engine的软件层干预","+  └─ HCCL (Huawei Collective Communication Library):","+     替代NCCL, 支持HCCS(片间互联60 GB/s)+RoCE(25 GB/s)"," ","-Infera 代表了 Serving 调度架构的一种极端设计方向——将编译与调度深度融合：","+[Layer 3: Ascend NPU Hardware Task Scheduler (TS)]","+  ├─ 接收编译好的Task Descriptor Chain","+  ├─ 按task dependency顺序发射到AI Core","+  ├─ 支持配置优先级 + task queue depth","+  │   (vs GPU Dispatch Unit闭源不可配置)","+  └─ 笔记未明确说明TS的调度策略细节"," ","+[Layer 4: Da Vinci AI Core]","+  ├─ Cube Unit (脉动阵列): MatMul主力, 等价GPU Tensor Core","+  │   但数据流模式不同 (systolic vs MMA指令)","+  ├─ Vector Unit (SIMD): 向量计算, 等价GPU CUDA Core","+  ├─ Scalar Unit: 标量/控制流","+  └─ L1 Buffer + L0 Buffer:","+     (分离设计, 非GPU shared memory统一模型)"," ```","-Infera 协同编译与调度流程:"," ","-离线编译阶段:","-  ONNX Model → TVM Relay Graph","-    → Tile-based Partition (大算子切 micro-op, 小算子合并 shepherd-op)","-    → Multi-Version Kernel Generation (不同 ILP/TLP/intensity)","-    → Cut-and-Patch Instruction Scheduling (SASS 级 ILP 优化)","-    → CUDA Binary Static Library","+**注解**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused AR-A2A Communication Algorithm.md`, score: 21.7）:","+- **MixServe实测**: Ascend 910B上DeepSeek-R1 TTFT 2.67× vs vLLM TP+PP, 1.70× vs vLLM DP+EP","+- **通信架构差异**: HCCS片间60 GB/s vs NVLink 900 GB/s——跨节点通信成为Ascend集群的主要瓶颈（MixServe的Fused AR-A2A算法正是为解决此问题）","+- **片上存储差异**: Ascend 910B L1 Buffer与GPU shared memory的容量/bank结构不同，PagedAttention的tile size需针对性调优。vault中未提供精准spec数值","+- **Task Descriptor Chain vs CUDA Graph**: Ascend Graph编译后产出task descriptor chain，由硬件TS直接解析——消除了GPU上GigaThread Engine的软件层block调度延迟"," ","-在线推理阶段:","-  JDU (Job Dispatch Unit): Job 分发 (按 GPU 显存 + estimated time)","-    → TSU (Task Schedule Unit): Priority Scheduling (EDF/FIFO/GCFS)","-    → TEU (Task Execution Unit):","-        SelectKernels (在线回归模型选最优 kernel 版本)","-        → FuseKernels (warp-level horizontal fusion)","-        → LaunchKernel (HKQ → GDRCopy → DKQ → daemon kernel CDP launch)","+### 2.3 三大硬件平台 Serving 适配关键差异对比","+"," ```","+┌──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┐","+│   适配维度        │  NVIDIA GPU      │  华为 Ascend NPU  │  Google TPU      │","+│                  │  (CUDA/H100)     │  (CANN/910B)     │  (XLA/v5p)       │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ 编程模型          │ CUDA C++/Python  │ CANN C++/Python  │ XLA HLO          │","+│                  │ 灵活kernel开发   │ ACL算子库+TS调度  │ (编译器驱动,     │","+│                  │                  │                  │  不可手写kernel) │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ KV Cache管理      │ PagedAttention   │ PagedAttention   │ 编译器静态管理   │","+│                  │ (动态block分配)  │ (需CANN适配)     │ (运行时不可变)   │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ 片上存储         │ Shared Memory    │ L1 Buffer (分离) │ Vector Memory    │","+│                  │ (256KB/SM,       │ + L0 Buffer      │ (编译器管理)     │","+│                  │  可编程分配)     │ (硬件管理)       │                  │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ 图调度机制        │ CUDA Graph       │ Ascend Graph     │ XLA编译期调度    │","+│                  │ (Record→Replay,  │ (Task Descriptor │ (静态图,         │","+│                  │  GigaThread分发) │  Chain→硬件TS)   │  无运行时调度)   │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ Kernel Launch    │ ~3-10μs/kernel   │ 笔记未明确说明   │ 0 (编译期固定)   │","+│ Overhead         │ →~100μs total    │                  │                  │","+│                  │ CUDA Graph解决)  │                  │                  │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ 集合通信          │ NCCL (NVLink     │ HCCL (HCCS       │ ICI (Inter-Chip  │","+│                  │  900 GB/s)       │  60 GB/s)        │  Interconnect)   │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ Dispatch可控性   │ 低 (GigaThread   │ 中 (TS可配置     │ 无 (编译器决定)  │","+│                  │  Engine闭源)     │  queue depth)    │                  │","+├──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┤","+│ 框架移植难度      │ 原生支持         │ 中等 (CANN适配   │ 高 (XLA路径      │","+│                  │ (基准平台)       │  即可, 非易架构) │  完全重编译)     │","+└──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┘","+```"," "," **注解**:","-- Infera 在 multi-model mixed serving 中实现 1.6×-3.5× speedup vs operator-based scheduling。","-- 该架构依赖 GPU 特定的 CUDA Dynamic Parallelism 和 GDRCopy，在 NPU/TPU 上需要对应的硬件原语（尚未验证）。","+- **SM亲和性绑定**(GPU): Bullet/SGLang通过`libsmctrl`实现SM masking，将prefill和decode绑定不同SM分区——但这是利用CUDA MPS特性间接实现，非直接控制GPU Dispatch Unit","+- **片上buffer感知**(NPU): Ascend 910B的L1 Buffer分离设计（非GPU unified SMEM），PagedAttention block size可能需要从16调整为NPU友好的粒度（vault未提供具体优化数值）","+- **TPU编译期边界**: XLA在编译期完成所有算子排布和内存分配，运行时零scheduling overhead——但代价是完全丧失动态batch灵活性。MoE的动态expert routing在TPU上通过编译器静态unrolling处理（非运行时动态dispatch）"," "," ---"," ","-## 方法对比表","+## 三、方法对比表"," ","-| 框架 | 调度器核心机制 | 实现语言 | 硬件平台 | 关键硬件优化 | 跨平台移植状态 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|---------------|----------|----------|-------------|---------------|----------|","-| **vLLM** | PagedAttention + Continuous Batching + CUDA Graph | Python + C++/CUDA | NVIDIA GPU (H100/A100) | CUDA Graph、TMA (间接)、GPU-side block table (BrownoutServe) | Ascend CANN (社区 fork)、ROCm (移植版可用) | 多条 knowledge_notes + paper_secs |","-| **SGLang** | RadixAttention (tree-based prefix reuse) + Token-level KV pool | Python + C++/Triton | NVIDIA GPU | torch.compile + Triton kernel 生成、FlashInfer | ROCm 理论可行 (Triton)、NPU/TPU 未明确 | paper_secs (BlendServe)、knowledge_notes |","-| **TensorRT-LLM** | IFB + Graph Optimization + Execution Context | C++ (闭源 runtime) + Python API | NVIDIA GPU (H100 深度优化) | FP8 Tensor Core、TMA、NVLink one-sided alltoall | 跨平台移植最困难 (深度绑定 CUDA 生态) | knowledge_notes (FasterTransformer) |","-| **TGI** | Watermark-based Batching + Rust Router | Rust + Python | NVIDIA GPU (CUDA) | HuggingFace 生态、Flash Attention | 理论支持 PyTorch 兼容硬件、NPU 未明确 | knowledge_notes (间接) |","-| **LightLLM** | Token-level Scheduling + 异步 Encoding | Python + CUDA | NVIDIA GPU | Token 级细粒度调度、异步 Vision Encoder | 笔记未明确 | paper_secs (间接) |","-| **Mooncake** | KV-cache 中心分离式架构 + 多协议传输 | C++/Python | GPU/TPU/多加速器 | RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared Memory 多协议 KV 传输 | 传输层硬件无关、具体计算层未明确 | paper_secs (vLLM-Omni) |","-| **S-LoRA** | LoRA Adapter 动态调度 + Tiered Caching | Python + CUDA | NVIDIA GPU | Adapter 异步加载/卸载 (CUDA stream) | 笔记未明确 | paper_secs (间接) |","-| **Infera** | Cooperative Compilation & Scheduling + Daemon Kernel | C++/CUDA (TVM-based) | NVIDIA GPU | CDP device-side launch、GDRCopy、HKQ/DKQ | NPU/TPU 需对应硬件原语 (未验证) | knowledge_notes (3 条) |","+| 框架 | 核心调度机制 | 实现语言 | 硬件平台 | 关键硬件优化 | 跨平台移植 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|-------------|----------|----------|-------------|-----------|---------|","+| **vLLM** | PagedAttention block管理 + Continuous Batching + Prefix Caching Hash | Python+C++/CUDA | H100/A100原生; Ascend 910B已集成(2025.08) | CUDA Graph、FusedMoE(Triton)、FP8 Tensor Core、GPU-side block table | CANN适配(vLLM-Ascend)、ROCm社区移植中 | vLLM.md(472.9), vLLM MoE(390.5), Mooncake Store(30.2) |","+| **SGLang** | RadixAttention tree前缀复用 + Token-Level KV Pool + Programmable Scheduler | Python+PyTorch/Triton | H100/A100原生; Mooncake集成(2025.09) | FlashInfer BSR attention、torch.compile JIT、SM spatial sharing | ROCm理论可行(Triton); NPU/TPU未明确 | SGLang.md(291.2), Vector Sparsity(171.4) |","+| **TensorRT-LLM** | AoT图优化 + In-Flight Batching + Execution Context | C++闭源runtime+Python API | NVIDIA GPU专属(H100深度整合) | FP8 Tensor Core、TMA、Transformer Engine、NVLink one-sided alltoall | 跨平台极难(深度绑定CUDA生态) | FasterTransformer(188.2), FP8 MoE(17.8), A2A Comm(16.5) |","+| **LightLLM/PiLLM** | Token-Level KV Cache(linked list) + PD分离 + Hierarchical三层架构 | Python+CUDA | GPU(具体型号笔记未明确) | Token粒度内存共享、细粒度KV分配/释放 | 笔记未明确 | PiLLM 5-Impl(1058.1) |","+| **Mooncake Store** | KVCache分布式缓存 + 拓扑感知传输 + 全局Conductor调度 | C++/Python | 跨平台传输层; 已集成三大框架 | RDMA/RoCE/CXL多协议、分层缓存(DRAM/VRAM/NVMe) | vLLM-Ascend(2025.08)、SGLang(2025.09)、TensorRT-LLM(2025.12) | Mooncake Store(30.2) |","+| **AMoE/AEP** | µ-queue异步expert调度 + Defragging Scheduler | Python+C++ (pybind11, 兼容vLLM) | GPU(兼容vLLM) | 消除all-to-all barrier、GPU自决策layer执行 | 兼容vLLM API(理论上vLLM支持的所有平台) | AEP(206.1) |","+| **MixServe** | Fused AR-A2A通信融合 + 混合TP-EP | Python+C++ (vLLM/Tutel) | Ascend 910B + H20 | HCCL多stream异步、HCCS/RoCE通信重叠 | Ascend 910B(vLLM) + H20(Tutel)实测 | Fused AR-A2A(21.7) |"," "," ---"," ","-## 不确定性","+## 四、不确定性"," ","-1. **SGLang 在 NPU/TPU 上的移植状态**: 笔记未明确说明。SGLang 的 Python 端调度逻辑（RadixAttention tree）是硬件无关的，但底层 attention kernel（FlashInfer）为 CUDA 专用，移植需要替换整个 kernel 层。","-2. **TGI 的具体硬件适配细节**: 笔记仅提供间接信息（Q2.2 答案中的框架描述），未找到 TGI 在 NPU/TPU 上的实验数据或移植报告。","-3. **LightLLM / Mooncake / S-LoRA 的调度器内部实现细节**: 笔记搜索结果中未找到这三者的专门知识笔记或详细论文章节。现有信息来自 Q2.2 答案的间接描述和 vLLM-Omni 论文中对 Mooncake Store 的提及。","-4. **Ascend CANN 的 Ascend Graph 与 CUDA Graph 的具体差异**: 笔记未提供 Ascend Graph 的 API 细节或性能对比数据，仅能从 CANN 文档特征推断其对动态 shape 支持更受限。","-5. **TPU XLA 编译期调度 vs 运行时调度的精确边界**: 笔记未明确说明。TPU 的 XLA 编译路径与 GPU 的 CUDA runtime 调度模型差异巨大，上述分析基于对 XLA 架构的一般理解，非笔记原文。","-6. **Google TPU v5e/v5p、AMD MI300X 上的框架性能数据**: 笔记未提供这些硬件平台上的任何 benchmark 数据或性能对比。","+1. **TGI 调度器内部细节**: vault 未找到 TGI 的 Rust router + watermark batching 实现的详细笔记。上述 TGI 内容为公开知识补充，标注「笔记未明确说明」","+2. **S-LoRA 实现**: vault 中未找到 S-LoRA LoRA adapter 动态调度的专门笔记，该框架在答案中未详述","+3. **Ascend 910B 精准硬件参数**: vault 中未找到 Ascend 910B 的 L1 Buffer 大小、MAC 数量、HBM 带宽等精准 spec。上述数据来自论文上下文推断或标注「笔记未明确说明」","+4. **AMD MI300X ROCm 移植**: vault 仅 HipKittens 论文提及 ROCm hardware features，未找到 vLLM/SGLang 在 MI300X 上的基准测试或移植报告","+5. **TPU v5e/v5p 框架适配**: vault 未找到任何 serving 框架在 TPU 上的适配笔记。TPU 分析基于 XLA 编译原理推断","+6. **LightLLM/S-LoRA 性能指标**: 笔记仅描述架构特性，未提供具体 throughput/latency 基准数据","+7. **TMA 在 vLLM PagedAttention 中的具体实现**: 笔记(FlashAttention-3)描述了 TMA 机制和 `SM90_TMA_LOAD_PAGED_OP` 类的存在，但 vLLM 如何具体集成 TMA 的代码路径在 vault 中**笔记未明确说明**","+8. **Mooncake 在单加速器场景下的收益**: Mooncake 设计面向 PD 分离式多节点架构，单加速器场景下其分布式 KV cache 池化优势有限——但笔记未提供单加速器 vs 多节点 Mooncake 的消融实验对比"," ","----","-","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L2-Q2.5","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q2.5"]}],"originalFile":"# Q2.5 — 开源 Serving 框架调度器/Dispatcher 具体实现方式与跨硬件平台适配现状\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md | 914.7 | vLLM 架构：PagedAttention、continuous batching、CUDA Graph、block table 管理 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md | 188.5 | FasterTransformer/TensorRT-LLM 编译流程、MoE kernel 实现、FP8 支持 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA _ 张量内存加速器).md | 11417.1 | H100 TMA 硬件加速引擎：异步数据传输、硬件 barrier、multicast |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention.md | 367.0 | BrownoutServe GPU-side block table 优化：消除 CPU→GPU 传输延迟 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph in MoE Serving.md | 22.2 | CUDA Graph 在 MoE serving 中的录制与重放、PROBE 解决 Graph 兼容性 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Host Kernel Queue _ Device Kernel Queue (HKQ_DKQ).md | 372.4 | Infera HKQ/DKQ 多级队列架构、GDRCopy 低延迟传输 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Daemon Kernel for Device-Side Launch.md | 851.3 | Infera daemon kernel：device-side fire-and-forget launch、<10μs 延迟 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md | 18.4 | Infera 协同编译与调度架构：离线多版本 kernel + 在线动态选择 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md | 32.9 | FlashMoE megakernel：1 次 launch vs 33-550 次，Scheduler/Processor warp specialization |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 23.7 | MoE All-to-All 通信调度：NVLink one-sided、分层 all-to-all、EPS-MoE 通信-计算 overlap |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/EPD Disaggregation (Encode-Prefill-Decode Disaggregation).md | — | EPD-Serve 三阶段解耦：Encode-Prefill-Decode 在 Ascend NPU 上的部署 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/GPU Task Preemption for Inference.md | 33.2 | Infera GPU 任务抢占：Infera-P ~10μs、Infera-R ~5μs |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md | 11.7 | Nimble 框架调度开销分析：6 步 CPU overhead 消除策略 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM.md | 5314.2 | Fast-dLLM v2 两级缓存 + FlashInfer 作为 vLLM/SGLang/TensorRT-LLM 底层 kernel 库 |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT.../Keqiu-Li...md | 3055.9 | PAT：vLLM scheduler 集成、block table 与 prefix-aware attention |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/Toward Cost-Efficient Serving of MoE with Asynchrony.md | 1775.1 | vLLM Python/C++ backend 架构、MoE 异步调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 1. vLLM Scheduler 实现与硬件适配\n\n### 1.1 架构概览\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md` (score: 914.7)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention.md` (score: 367.0)\n\nvLLM (UC Berkeley, SOSP 2023) 采用 **Python-frontend + C++/CUDA backend** 分层架构：\n\n```\nvLLM 架构分层:\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Python Scheduler (Frontend)                 │\n│  - 请求队列管理 (add_request/abort_request)    │\n│  - Continuous Batching 决策                  │\n│  - Block Table 管理 (CPU 端逻辑映射)          │\n│  - Prefix Caching Hash 计算与管理            │\n│  - Preemption 策略 (Swap/Recompute)          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  C++/CUDA Backend (Model Executor)           │\n│  - PagedAttention Kernel (GPU 端)            │\n│  - KV Cache Block 物理分配/释放              │\n│  - CUDA Graph 录制与重放                     │\n│  - FlashInfer/CUDA Kernel 调用               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  GPU Hardware (H100/A100/...)                │\n│  - SM: 执行 attention/FFN kernel             │\n│  - HBM: 存储 KV Cache blocks + 模型权重       │\n│  - TMA: HBM↔SMEM 异步数据传输 (H100)         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 1.2 调度器执行模拟（单 GPU H100，单请求 prefill → decode）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/vLLM (LLM Serving Framework).md`、`paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT.../Keqiu-Li...md` (score: 3055.9)\n\n以下模拟一个 MoE 模型（Mixtral 8x7B）单请求推理的 vLLM scheduler 执行流程，展示 scheduler 决策与硬件映射：\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n时间轴 (伪时间线，单位 μs)     Scheduler 动作                  GPU 硬件状态\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nT=0      请求到达                Scheduler.add_request()      GPU idle\n         prompt_len=4096         分配 initial blocks\n         \nT=0~50   Prefill 阶段             Block Table:                 SM 132个全部参与\n         Scheduler 分配 256 个    req_0: [b0,b1,...,b255]     HBM 读取模型权重\n         KV cache blocks          每个 block=16 tokens         Tensor Core 计算 attention\n         (4096/16=256 blocks)     prefix_caching_hash 计算     输出首 token t0\n\nT=50     Prefill 完成             记录 KV cache 引用          HBM: 256 blocks 已占用\n         CUDA Graph 录制          进入 decode loop             ~1GB KV cache\n\nT=51~60  Decode Step 1            CUDA Graph 重放:            SM: 1 个 SM 执行 sampling\n         (每 token ~10μs)         1. 取 Q[t0]                 其余 131 SM 执行 attention\n                                  2. PagedAttention 查 block    + expert FFN (top-2 experts)\n                                     table → 读取 K/V\n                                  3. MoE gate: 选 expert_3,7\n                                  4. Expert FFN(3,7)\n                                  5. Sampling → t1\n\nT=61~70  Decode Step 2            Graph 重放 (同上)           同上\n         ...                                                  \nT=510    生成第 50 个 token       block 表扩展到 260 blocks    HBM: 260 blocks\n         请求完成 (EOS)           Scheduler 释放 blocks         GC 回收 KV cache\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `req_0` 为请求 ID；`b0..b255` 为物理 block 编号；每个 block 存 16 个 token 的 K/V（head_dim=128, num_heads=32 → 每 block ~128KB）；`prefix_caching_hash` 为 prompt prefix 的哈希值，用于跨请求复用 KV cache。\n- **复杂度分析**: Prefill 阶段计算复杂度 O(L²·d)（L=prompt_len, d=hidden_dim），受 HBM 带宽约束（H100 HBM 带宽 3.35 TB/s）。Decode 阶段每步 O(L·d)，受 Tensor Core 利用率约束——单 token decode 时 Tensor Core 利用率极低（<5%），这是 continuous batching 的核心动机。\n- **数据依赖**: 每 decode step 生成 token t_i → 作为下一步输入 t_{i+1}，严格串行。但 attention 计算内部各 head 独立，可并行。\n- **并发可行性**: vLLM continuous batching 将多请求的 decode step 合并为一个 batch，提升 SM 和 Tensor Core 利用率。单请求场景下并发度受限于模型内算子级并行（如 MoE expert 间并行）。\n\n### 1.3 Block Table 与 Prefix Caching 实现\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU-side Block Table for PagedAttention.md` (score: 367.0)\n\nvLLM 的 block table 原在 CPU 端管理，BrownoutServe 将其迁移至 GPU 端：\n\n```\n// vLLM 原始实现: CPU-side block table\n// 每 iteration 需 CPU→GPU 传输 block_table\n//\n// Scheduler (Python, CPU):\nblock_table[req_id] = [phys_block_0, phys_block_1, ..., phys_block_k]\n// 传输到 GPU:\nblock_table_gpu.copy_(block_table_cpu)     // ← PCIe 传输延迟\n\n// BrownoutServe 优化: GPU-side block table\n// block_table 分配为 torch.tensor(device='cuda')\n// Scheduler 更新通过 GPU kernel:\n@triton.jit\ndef update_block_table_kernel(block_table_ptr, req_id, new_block):\n    block_table_ptr[req_id, free_slot] = new_block  // 直接 GPU 端更新\n    \n// Attention kernel 内直接查询 GPU block table:\nphysical_block = tl.load(block_table_ptr + req_id * max_blocks + logical_idx)\nk_tile = tl.load(k_cache_ptr + physical_block * block_size * head_dim + ...)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `block_table` 为 [num_requests × max_blocks] 的 int32 矩阵；`physical_block` 为 HBM 中 KV cache block 的实际地址索引；`logical_idx` 为请求内的逻辑 token 位置。\n- **复杂度分析**: GPU-side block table 消除每 iteration 的 CPU→GPU memcpy（典型延迟 ~5-10μs），对于 decode step 仅 10μs 的场景，这是约 50% 的 overhead 削减。\n- **硬件依赖**: 该优化要求 GPU 支持 kernel 内指针间接访问（所有现代 GPU 均支持），且 block table 占用 HBM 极小（如 256 请求 × 2048 blocks × 4B = 2MB）。\n\n### 1.4 vLLM 在 NPU/AMD GPU 上的移植现状\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/EPD Disaggregation (Encode-Prefill-Decode Disaggregation).md`（间接证据）、`learning_outputs/.../Q2.2_L2_answer.md`（间接证据）\n\n| 移植目标 | 状态 | 关键差异与适配 |\n|----------|------|---------------|\n| **华为昇腾 Ascend 910B (CANN)** | vLLM-Ascend 社区 fork 已可用 | (1) PagedAttention kernel 用 CANN 算子重写（替换 CUDA kernel）；(2) Block table 管理保持 Python 端不变，底层通过 Ascend ACL 接口分配 device memory；(3) CUDA Graph → Ascend Graph（CANN 图编译），但 Ascend Graph 对动态 shape 支持较 CUDA Graph 更受限；(4) 通信后端从 NCCL 替换为 HCCL（Huawei Collective Communication Library） |\n| **AMD MI300X (ROCm)** | vLLM ROCm 移植版可用 | (1) CUDA kernel → HIP kernel（多数通过 hipify 自动转换）；(2) PagedAttention 利用 AMD Matrix Core（类似 Tensor Core）但 tile size 和 warp size 差异需手动调优（AMD wavefront=64 vs NVIDIA warp=32）；(3) 内存管理：MI300X 使用统一 HBM 架构（无独立 L1 cache），block table 与 KV cache 共享同一 HBM 池 |\n| **Google TPU v5e/v5p** | 笔记未明确说明 | TPU 通常通过 XLA 编译器路径运行模型，非 vLLM 的原生 CUDA 路径。推断：需将 vLLM 的调度逻辑（block table、continuous batching）与 XLA 编译的 TPU executable 集成，存在较大工程差距 |\n\n**注解**:\n- NPU 片上存储差异：vLLM 的 PagedAttention 假设 GPU shared memory（~228KB/SM on H100）用于 attention tile 缓存。NPU Ascend 910B 的片上 buffer 为 L1 buffer（架构不同），大小和 bank 结构差异影响 attention kernel 的 tile size 选择和 bank conflict 避免策略。\n- Ascend Graph vs CUDA Graph：Ascend Graph 在 CANN 中通过 `aclgrphBuildGraph` 接口构建静态图，对 MoE 的动态 expert routing（每 token 激活不同 expert）存在图构建期不确定性挑战——笔记推断与 PROBE 论文中 CUDA Graph 面临的问题类似。\n\n---\n\n## 2. SGLang Scheduler 实现与硬件适配\n\n### 2.1 RadixAttention 实现\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/7-BlendServe.../span-idpage-13-1spanAlgorithm-3-Dual-Scan.md` (score: 673.9)、`knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM.md` (score: 5314.2)\n\nSGLang (Stanford/LMSYS, 2024) 的核心创新是 **RadixAttention**——基于前缀树（Trie）的 KV cache 池管理：\n\n```\nSGLang Scheduler 架构:\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SGLang Frontend (Python)                     │\n│  ├─ RadixAttention Tree (前缀树)              │\n│  │   - 每个节点: (token_seq, KV cache ptr)    │\n│  │   - 分支: 不同请求的后续 token 分叉         │\n│  │   - 共享: 共同前缀共享 KV cache 节点       │\n│  ├─ Token-level KV-cache Pool 管理            │\n│  │   - 每个 token 独立分配/释放               │\n│  │   - 引用计数 + LRU 驱逐                    │\n│  └─ Programmable Scheduler API                │\n│      (用户可注册调度钩子)                       │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  SGLang Runtime (C++/CUDA/Triton)             │\n│  ├─ torch.compile 集成                        │\n│  │   - 自动 kernel fusion                     │\n│  │   - Triton kernel 生成                     │\n│  ├─ FlashInfer Backend (attention kernel)     │\n│  └─ CUDA Graph (decode phase)                 │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  GPU Hardware                                 │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 2.2 RadixAttention 调度执行模拟（多请求前缀共享场景）\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n场景: 三个请求共享前缀 \"The capital of France\"\n       Req_A: \"The capital of France is Paris\"\n       Req_B: \"The capital of France is a city in Europe\"\n       Req_C: \"The capital of Germany is Berlin\"\n\nRadix Tree 状态:\n                      root\n                       │\n                 \"The capital of\"\n                       │\n                   \"France\" ───── \"Germany\"\n                    /    \\            │\n               \"is Paris\" \"is a city...\"  \"is Berlin\"\n               (Req_A)   (Req_B)        (Req_C)\n\n时间轴        Scheduler 操作                         硬件映射\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nT=0     Req_A 到达 → 在 Radix Tree 中查找      GPU: 计算 prefix hash\n        匹配 prefix=\"The capital of France\"      查询已缓存的 KV\n        → 加载已缓存 KV (4 tokens)              HBM: 读已有 KV cache\n        → 仅需计算 \" is Paris\" 的 KV            SM: 仅 3 个 token prefill\n\nT=10    Req_B 到达 → 匹配 prefix=\"The capital     GPU: 复用 A 的 prefix KV\n         of France\" (与 A 共享)                  无需重复计算\n        → 仅 prefill \" is a city in Europe\"      HBM 节省 ~50% KV 存储\n\nT=20    Req_C 到达 → 仅匹配 prefix=\"The           GPU: 仅复用 \"The capital of\"\n         capital of\" (与 A,B 部分共享)            需 prefill \"Germany is Berlin\"\n        → prefill 剩余 token\n\nT=30+   Decode Phase (continuous batching)        CUDA Graph 重放\n        三请求同时 decode                         批量 GPU kernel 执行\n        Radix Tree 每步追加新 token 节点          HBM: 增量分配 KV\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **数据结构**: Radix Tree 每个节点存储 `(token_id, KV_cache_ptr, ref_count, children: dict[token_id → node])`。LRU 驱逐遍历整个树标记可回收节点（ref_count=0 且不在活跃路径上）。\n- **并发粒度**: Tree 操作（查找、插入）在 Python 端单线程执行（~μs 级），与 GPU kernel 执行（~ms 级）不在同一时间尺度，不会成为瓶颈。\n- **硬件权衡**: token-level KV cache 相比 vLLM 的 block-level（16 tokens/block）更细粒度，减少碎片化但增加管理 overhead。在 HBM 带宽充裕的 H100 上，细粒度管理的优势大于 overhead。\n\n### 2.3 SGLang 硬件移植状态\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记未明确说明 SGLang 在 NPU/TPU 上的移植状态。\n\n- **NVIDIA GPU (H100/A100)**: 原生支持，通过 `torch.compile` + Triton 生成 GPU kernel，配合 FlashInfer 作为 attention backend。\n- **AMD GPU (ROCm)**: 推断：SGLang 依赖 Triton 语言（AMD 有 Triton ROCm backend），理论可移植但需验证 attention kernel 在 AMD Matrix Core 上的性能。\n- **NPU (Ascend)**: 笔记未明确说明。SGLang 的 RadixAttention tree 逻辑是 Python 端实现的（硬件无关），但底层 attention kernel（FlashInfer）为 CUDA 专用，需替换为 CANN 算子。\n- **TPU**: 笔记未明确说明。\n\n---\n\n## 3. TensorRT-LLM Runtime 实现与硬件适配\n\n### 3.1 架构概览\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md` (score: 188.5)、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 11417.1)\n\nTensorRT-LLM (NVIDIA) 是 NVIDIA 官方 LLM 推理框架，架构为 **C++ runtime + graph optimization pipeline**：\n\n```\nTensorRT-LLM 架构:\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Model Definition (Python API)                │\n│  - 构建 TensorRT-LLM 模型图                   │\n│  - 指定并行策略 (TP/PP/EP)                    │\n│  - 配置 FP8/INT8/INT4 量化                    │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Graph Optimization Pipeline (C++)            │\n│  - Graph Rewriting (算子融合)                  │\n│  - Memory Planning (KV cache + workspace)     │\n│  - Kernel Auto-Tuning (最佳 kernel 选择)       │\n│  - CUDA Graph Capture (decode loop)            │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Runtime (C++)                                │\n│  ├─ Execution Context 管理                     │\n│  │   - 维护 per-request KV cache state         │\n│  │   - 管理 in-flight batching slot            │\n│  ├─ In-Flight Batching (IFB)                  │\n│  │   - 动态增删请求 (不中断 decoder)            │\n│  │   - Context Phase (prefill) + Generation    │\n│  │     Phase (decode) 混合调度                 │\n│  └─ GptSession: 统一多 GPU 执行接口            │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  NVIDIA GPU (H100 preferred)                   │\n│  - FP8 Tensor Core (Transformer Engine)        │\n│  - TMA (HBM↔SMEM 异步传输)                    │\n│  - NVLink/NVSwitch (多 GPU 通信)               │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 3.2 In-Flight Batching 执行模拟（单 GPU H100，MoE 模型）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/FasterTransformer.md`（FasterTransformer MoE 实现细节）\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nTensorRT-LLM IFB 调度模拟 (Mixtral 8x7B, H100)\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n时间    IFB Scheduler                          GPU 硬件\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nT=0     Request_1 到达 (prompt_len=2048)\n        Scheduler 分配 context slot[0]         SM 132 全参与 prefill\n        Context Phase: prefill 2048 tokens      Tensor Core: FP8 MMA\n        → 产出 KV cache + 首 token             TMA: 异步加载权重 tile 到 SMEM\n\nT=30    Request_2 到达 (prompt_len=512)         SM: Context Phase 与 Generation\n        IFB: Context Phase[slot=1] +            Phase 混合执行\n        Generation Phase[slot=0] 并行           - 60 SM → Request_1 decode\n        (不同 phase 在不同 batch slot)           - 72 SM → Request_2 prefill\n\nT=35    Request_2 prefill 完成                  SM: 132 全参与 decode\n        IFB 合并: slot[0]+slot[1] 双请求        Tensor Core utilization ↑\n        generation phase\n\nT=40    Request_3 到达 (prompt_len=8192)        Context Phase 占用更多 SM\n        IFB: Context[slot=2] + Gen[0,1]         长 prompt → 大量 HBM 访问\n        Scheduler: chunked prefill              分块 prefill 分摊 HBM 压力\n        (8192 tokens 分 4 块, 每块 2048)\n\nT=100   Request_1 完成 (EOS)                    Scheduler 释放 slot[0]\n        IFB: slot[1]+slot[2] decode             KV cache blocks 回收\n        Request_3 的 chunked prefill 继续        \n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **数据结构**: Execution Context 维护 `[max_batch_size]` 个 slot，每个 slot 包含：`{request_id, kv_cache_blocks[], tokens_generated, sampling_params, state (IDLE/CONTEXT/GENERATION/DONE)}`。In-Flight Batching 允许在 generation 循环中途插入/移除请求。\n- **FP8 Transformer Engine**: H100 上 TensorRT-LLM 利用 FP8 Tensor Core 执行 GEMM（通过 `Transformer Engine` 库），峰值算力 1979 TFLOPS (FP8) vs 989 TFLOPS (FP16)，但需管理 FP8→FP16 的 scaling factor，增加调度复杂度。\n- **TMA 利用**: 笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` 显示，TMA 在 H100 上实现 HBM→SMEM 异步数据传输（单线程发起、硬件加速 barrier、支持 multicast），TensorRT-LLM 的 attention kernel 可通过 TMA 加载 K/V tile 与 Tensor Core MMA 计算 overlap。\n- **硬件依赖**: TensorRT-LLM 深度绑定 NVIDIA 生态（CUDA、cuBLAS、cuDNN、NCCL、Transformer Engine），跨平台移植难度最大。\n\n### 3.3 TensorRT-LLM 跨硬件移植\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md`（间接证据：NVLink one-sided alltoall 为 TensorRT-LLM 优化）\n\n| 硬件平台 | 移植状态 | 说明 |\n|----------|----------|------|\n| **NVIDIA H100/A100** | 完整支持 | FP8 Tensor Core + TMA + NVLink/NVSwitch 深度优化 |\n| **AMD MI300X** | 笔记未明确说明 | TensorRT-LLM 依赖 CUDA 生态，AMD ROCm 有 HIP 兼容层但 TensorRT-LLM 的图优化引擎（C++ 闭源）不直接可移植。推断需主要重写 |\n| **NPU Ascend 910B** | 笔记未明确说明 | CANN 提供类似图优化的 Ascend Graph，但与 TensorRT-LLM 的 Graph Optimization Pipeline 不兼容 |\n| **Google TPU** | 不适用 | TPU 使用 XLA 编译器路径（JAX/TF），与 TensorRT-LLM 架构不兼容 |\n\n---\n\n## 4. TGI (Text Generation Inference) 实现\n\n**笔记证据**: `learning_outputs/.../Q2.2_L2_answer.md`（间接证据，Q2.2 答案中有详细框架描述）\n\nTGI (HuggingFace) 采用 **Rust-based router + Python backend** 架构：\n\n```\nTGI 架构:\n┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Rust Router (高性能 HTTP/gRPC 层)    │\n│  - 请求路由与模型选择                  │\n│  - Watermark-based Batching           │\n│    · 水位线: 当 pending requests ≥ N  │\n│      或 oldest request age ≥ T_max    │\n│      → 触发 batch generation          │\n│  - 并发连接管理与背压控制               │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Python Backend (模型执行)             │\n│  - HuggingFace Transformers 集成       │\n│  - Flash Attention / Paged Attention   │\n│  - 量化支持 (bitsandbytes/GPTQ)        │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  GPU Hardware                         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Watermark-based Batching 执行模拟**:\n\n```\n时间    Pending Queue        Watermark 状态         动作\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nT=0     [Req_1]              N=1 < N_min(4)         等待\nT=5     [Req_1, Req_2]       N=2 < N_min            等待\nT=10    [Req_1..Req_4]       N=4 ≥ N_min            → 触发 batch\n        batch_size=4 prefill + decode 开始\nT=15    [Req_5]              N=1 < N_min            Req_5 等待\nT=20    [Req_5]              age=10ms ≥ T_max(10ms) → 超时触发\n        batch_size=1 prefill + decode\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Rust Router 优势**: Rust 零成本抽象 + 无 GC，router 延迟 <100μs（vs Python ~1ms），适合高吞吐场景。\n- **硬件适配**: TGI 的 Rust router 为 CPU 端组件（硬件无关），Python backend 依赖 PyTorch → 理论支持所有 PyTorch 兼容硬件（CUDA/ROCm/DirectML）。但笔记未明确说明在 NPU 上的具体移植工作。\n- **单请求场景适用性**: Watermark-based batching 面向多用户高并发场景。在单请求推理场景中，watermark 机制无实际作用——单请求直接进入 prefill→decode 流程，无批量等待。\n\n---\n\n## 5. LightLLM 调度实现\n\n**笔记证据**: `learning_outputs/.../Q2.2_L2_answer.md`（间接证据）\n\nLightLLM 采用 **token-level scheduling** 细粒度调度策略：\n\n```\nLightLLM 调度特点:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Token-Level Scheduler                      │\n│  - 以单个 token 为调度单元（非 request 级）  │\n│  - 每个 forward step 动态选择 batch 组成    │\n│  - 异步 Encoding 调度 (多模态场景)          │\n│    · Vision Encoder 异步执行                │\n│    · 不阻塞 LLM decode pipeline             │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  异步 Encoding 流程:                        │\n│  请求含图像 → Vision Encoder 编码(异步)     │\n│             → 编码完成信号 → LLM Prefill    │\n│  请求纯文本 → 直接 LLM Prefill              │\n│  两者可在同一步中混合调度                    │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  硬件: NVIDIA GPU (CUDA)                    │\n│  笔记未明确说明 NPU/TPU 移植状态             │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Token-level vs Request-level**: Token-level 调度每次 forward 可混合不同请求的不同数量 token（如 Req_1 取 1 token decode + Req_2 取 128 tokens prefill），比 request-level batching 更灵活，GPU 利用率更高。\n- **异步 Encoding**: 多模态场景中，Vision Encoder 计算（ViT 前向）与 LLM Decode 可在不同 SM 分区或不同 GPU 上并行，消除模态间串行等待。\n\n---\n\n## 6. Mooncake 调度架构\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/vLLM-Omni.../span-idpage-3-0span3.1.-Overview.md` (score: 3756.0)\n\nMooncake 采用 **KV-cache 为中心的分离式架构（Disaggregated Architecture）**：\n\n```\nMooncake 架构 (以 vLLM-Omni 集成 Mooncake Store 为例):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Mooncake Store (分布式 KV Cache 存储)               │\n│  - 拓扑感知的多协议传输引擎 (RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared)     │\n│  - 异步 tensor 传输接口                              │\n│  - KV cache 跨节点/跨实例共享                        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  vLLM-Omni Backend (多模态模型服务)                   │\n│  ├─ Encoder 实例: 处理视觉/音频编码                   │\n│  ├─ Prefill 实例: LLM prefill + KV cache 构建        │\n│  ├─ Decode 实例: 自回归生成                           │\n│  └─ 通过 Mooncake Store 传输:                        │\n│      - Encoder 特征 → Prefill (E-P 传输)            │\n│      - Prefill KV cache → Decode (P-D 传输)          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  硬件: 笔记提及支持 GPU/TPU/其他加速器                 │\n│  具体 NPU 移植状态: 笔记未明确说明                    │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- Mooncake Store 是 KV-cache 传输的中间件层，其硬件适配主要通过多协议支持实现（RDMA 用于 InfiniBand/RoCE、TCP 用于以太网、CXL 用于 CXL 内存池、Shared Memory 用于同机通信）。\n- 在单加速器场景中，分离式架构的优势有限（无跨机 KV 传输需求），但 EPD 解耦可在单 NPU 上实现逻辑隔离（如 EPD-Serve 的 (E-P)-D 共置模式）。\n\n---\n\n## 7. S-LoRA 调度实现\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记搜索结果中未找到 S-LoRA 专门知识笔记，以下基于 paper_secs 搜索结果推断。\n\nS-LoRA 专注于 **LoRA adapter 的动态调度与多模型复用**：\n\n- **核心功能**: 在单 GPU 上服务数千个 LoRA adapter（每个 adapter 对应一个微调任务），S-LoRA scheduler 动态加载/卸载 adapter 权重。\n- **调度策略**: 运行时按需加载 adapter（tiered caching：热 adapter 常驻 GPU、温 adapter 缓存 CPU、冷 adapter 从 SSD 加载）。\n- **硬件侧重**: 笔记未明确说明具体硬件适配。推断：adapter 加载/卸载通过 CUDA stream 异步执行，与计算 overlap。\n\n---\n\n## 8. 硬件特定优化深度对比\n\n### 8.1 GPU (NVIDIA H100) 硬件特定优化\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 11417.1)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph in MoE Serving.md`\n\n| 优化技术 | 框架利用 | 硬件机制 | 性能影响 |\n|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **TMA** | TensorRT-LLM attention kernel、FlashInfer | H100 专用 DMA 引擎：HBM↔SMEM 异步传输、单线程触发、硬件 barrier | 2× small transfer BW vs A100 cp.async；FP8 GEMM 1.4-2.2× over cuBLAS FP16 |\n| **FP8 Tensor Core** | TensorRT-LLM (Transformer Engine) | H100 第4代 Tensor Core，FP8 MMA 1979 TFLOPS | 2× 算力 vs FP16；需管理 scaling factor |\n| **CUDA Graph** | vLLM、SGLang、TensorRT-LLM (decode phase) | GPU 内核级图重放，消除 per-kernel launch overhead（~5-10μs/kernel） | Decode phase kernel launch overhead 从 ~100μs 降至 ~5μs |\n| **NVLink/NVSwitch** | TensorRT-LLM all-to-all (one-sided) | 900 GB/s GPU-GPU 带宽 (H100) | All-to-All 通信 3-5× vs PCIe |\n| **Device-Side Launch** | Infera (daemon kernel) | CUDA Dynamic Parallelism：GPU SM 自主发射 kernel | Launch latency <10μs vs host-side ~50μs |\n\n### 8.2 NPU (华为昇腾 Ascend 910B) 硬件特定优化\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/EPD Disaggregation.md`（间接证据）、`learning_outputs/.../L4_问题空间.md`（CANN/TBE 信息）\n\n| 优化技术 | 框架利用 | 硬件机制 | 与 GPU 差异 |\n|----------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| **Ascend Graph** | vLLM-Ascend (图编译重放) | CANN 图编译：静态计算图录制与重放 | 类似 CUDA Graph，但对动态 shape 支持更受限 |\n| **CANN/TBE 算子** | EPD-Serve、vLLM-Ascend | TBE (Tensor Boost Engine)：类似 GPU kernel 的 NPU 算子开发框架 | 需手动适配 attention/KV cache 算子 |\n| **片上 L1 Buffer** | 各框架的 attention kernel | Ascend 910B 片上 buffer 不同于 GPU shared memory | Bank 结构、大小差异影响 tile size 选择 |\n| **HCCL 通信** | EPD-Serve 多 NPU 部署 | Huawei Collective Communication Library | 类似 NCCL，但算法实现和性能特征不同 |\n| **脉动阵列 (Systolic Array)** | MatMul 算子 | Ascend 910B 的矩阵计算单元 | 不同于 GPU Tensor Core 的 MMA 指令；数据流模式差异 |\n\n### 8.3 片上存储管理差异对比\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md`（H100 shared memory）、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Attention Buffer _ 片上注意力缓冲区.md`（NPU on-chip buffer）\n\n```\n片上存储层次对比 (单加速器视角):\n                    GPU H100              NPU Ascend 910B       TPU v5e\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nL1/Shared Memory    228 KB/SM             推断: L1 Buffer        向量 Memory\n                    (可编程分配 L1/SMEM)   (架构不同)            (不同于 GPU SMEM)\nL2 Cache            50 MB                 推断: 片上 Buffer      —\nHBM                 80 GB (3.35 TB/s)     推断: HBM (容量待查)    HBM\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nScheduler 影响:\n- GPU:  block table 在 HBM 或 SMEM；attention tile 在 SMEM（228KB 限制 tile size）\n- NPU:  attention KV tile 在 L1 Buffer；block table 管理方式与 GPU 类似但 \n         buffer 大小和 bank 结构不同→需调整 tile size 和 padding 策略\n- TPU:  XLA 编译器自动管理向量 Memory 分配；scheduler 不需要显式控制 tile 放置\n```\n\n---\n\n## 9. 框架与硬件 Command Queue 交互深度\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Host Kernel Queue _ Device Kernel Queue (HKQ_DKQ).md` (score: 372.4)、`knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Daemon Kernel for Device-Side Launch.md` (score: 851.3)\n\n### 9.1 GPU 上 Kernel Launch Overhead 优化\n\n```\n传统 Host-Side Launch:\n  CPU: cuLaunchKernel(k1) → wait → cuLaunchKernel(k2) → wait → ...\n       每次 launch 约 5-10μs overhead（driver stack + MMIO）\n\nCUDA Graph (vLLM/SGLang 使用):\n  # 一次性录制\n  cudaStreamBeginCapture(stream)\n    k1<<<...>>>(); k2<<<...>>>(); ...; kN<<<...>>>();\n  cudaStreamEndCapture(stream, &graph)\n  # 运行时单次重放\n  cudaGraphLaunch(graph_exec, stream)  // <5μs 总 overhead\n\nDevice-Side Launch (Infera daemon kernel):\n  daemon_kernel:  // 常驻 1 个 SM\n    while(true):\n      kernel = DKQ.pop()\n      cudaLaunchDevice(kernel, ...)  // fire-and-forget <10μs\n```\n\n### 9.2 NPU 上 Task Descriptor 链\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记未明确说明 Ascend NPU 的 task descriptor 链细节。推断：Ascend CANN 的 task scheduler 通过 task descriptor queue 管理 NPU 计算任务，类似 GPU 的 command queue 但调度策略和 descriptor 格式不同。\n\n### 9.3 TPU 上 XLA 编译期调度与运行时调度边界\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记未明确说明 TPU XLA 的调度边界。推断：\n- **编译期**: XLA 将模型图编译为 HLO → LLO → TPU executable，此时确定算子 fusion、内存分配、Tile 配置。\n- **运行时**: TPU runtime 仅负责 feed 输入数据、执行编译好的 executable、收集输出。无类似于 GPU 上 vLLM/CUDA Graph 的运行时调度灵活性。\n- **影响**: XLA 的编译期调度更适合固定 shape 的推理负载，但对于 MoE 的动态 expert routing 或可变 prompt 长度的 prefix caching，灵活性不如 GPU 上的 CUDA Graph + runtime scheduler。\n\n---\n\n## 10. Infera 协同编译与调度架构（补充参考）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md` (score: 18.4)\n\nInfera 代表了 Serving 调度架构的一种极端设计方向——将编译与调度深度融合：\n\n```\nInfera 协同编译与调度流程:\n\n离线编译阶段:\n  ONNX Model → TVM Relay Graph\n    → Tile-based Partition (大算子切 micro-op, 小算子合并 shepherd-op)\n    → Multi-Version Kernel Generation (不同 ILP/TLP/intensity)\n    → Cut-and-Patch Instruction Scheduling (SASS 级 ILP 优化)\n    → CUDA Binary Static Library\n\n在线推理阶段:\n  JDU (Job Dispatch Unit): Job 分发 (按 GPU 显存 + estimated time)\n    → TSU (Task Schedule Unit): Priority Scheduling (EDF/FIFO/GCFS)\n    → TEU (Task Execution Unit):\n        SelectKernels (在线回归模型选最优 kernel 版本)\n        → FuseKernels (warp-level horizontal fusion)\n        → LaunchKernel (HKQ → GDRCopy → DKQ → daemon kernel CDP launch)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- Infera 在 multi-model mixed serving 中实现 1.6×-3.5× speedup vs operator-based scheduling。\n- 该架构依赖 GPU 特定的 CUDA Dynamic Parallelism 和 GDRCopy，在 NPU/TPU 上需要对应的硬件原语（尚未验证）。\n\n---\n\n## 方法对比表\n\n| 框架 | 调度器核心机制 | 实现语言 | 硬件平台 | 关键硬件优化 | 跨平台移植状态 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|---------------|----------|----------|-------------|---------------|----------|\n| **vLLM** | PagedAttention + Continuous Batching + CUDA Graph | Python + C++/CUDA | NVIDIA GPU (H100/A100) | CUDA Graph、TMA (间接)、GPU-side block table (BrownoutServe) | Ascend CANN (社区 fork)、ROCm (移植版可用) | 多条 knowledge_notes + paper_secs |\n| **SGLang** | RadixAttention (tree-based prefix reuse) + Token-level KV pool | Python + C++/Triton | NVIDIA GPU | torch.compile + Triton kernel 生成、FlashInfer | ROCm 理论可行 (Triton)、NPU/TPU 未明确 | paper_secs (BlendServe)、knowledge_notes |\n| **TensorRT-LLM** | IFB + Graph Optimization + Execution Context | C++ (闭源 runtime) + Python API | NVIDIA GPU (H100 深度优化) | FP8 Tensor Core、TMA、NVLink one-sided alltoall | 跨平台移植最困难 (深度绑定 CUDA 生态) | knowledge_notes (FasterTransformer) |\n| **TGI** | Watermark-based Batching + Rust Router | Rust + Python | NVIDIA GPU (CUDA) | HuggingFace 生态、Flash Attention | 理论支持 PyTorch 兼容硬件、NPU 未明确 | knowledge_notes (间接) |\n| **LightLLM** | Token-level Scheduling + 异步 Encoding | Python + CUDA | NVIDIA GPU | Token 级细粒度调度、异步 Vision Encoder | 笔记未明确 | paper_secs (间接) |\n| **Mooncake** | KV-cache 中心分离式架构 + 多协议传输 | C++/Python | GPU/TPU/多加速器 | RDMA/TCP/CXL/Shared Memory 多协议 KV 传输 | 传输层硬件无关、具体计算层未明确 | paper_secs (vLLM-Omni) |\n| **S-LoRA** | LoRA Adapter 动态调度 + Tiered Caching | Python + CUDA | NVIDIA GPU | Adapter 异步加载/卸载 (CUDA stream) | 笔记未明确 | paper_secs (间接) |\n| **Infera** | Cooperative Compilation & Scheduling + Daemon Kernel | C++/CUDA (TVM-based) | NVIDIA GPU | CDP device-side launch、GDRCopy、HKQ/DKQ | NPU/TPU 需对应硬件原语 (未验证) | knowledge_notes (3 条) |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **SGLang 在 NPU/TPU 上的移植状态**: 笔记未明确说明。SGLang 的 Python 端调度逻辑（RadixAttention tree）是硬件无关的，但底层 attention kernel（FlashInfer）为 CUDA 专用，移植需要替换整个 kernel 层。\n2. **TGI 的具体硬件适配细节**: 笔记仅提供间接信息（Q2.2 答案中的框架描述），未找到 TGI 在 NPU/TPU 上的实验数据或移植报告。\n3. **LightLLM / Mooncake / S-LoRA 的调度器内部实现细节**: 笔记搜索结果中未找到这三者的专门知识笔记或详细论文章节。现有信息来自 Q2.2 答案的间接描述和 vLLM-Omni 论文中对 Mooncake Store 的提及。\n4. **Ascend CANN 的 Ascend Graph 与 CUDA Graph 的具体差异**: 笔记未提供 Ascend Graph 的 API 细节或性能对比数据，仅能从 CANN 文档特征推断其对动态 shape 支持更受限。\n5. **TPU XLA 编译期调度 vs 运行时调度的精确边界**: 笔记未明确说明。TPU 的 XLA 编译路径与 GPU 的 CUDA runtime 调度模型差异巨大，上述分析基于对 XLA 架构的一般理解，非笔记原文。\n6. **Google TPU v5e/v5p、AMD MI300X 上的框架性能数据**: 笔记未提供这些硬件平台上的任何 benchmark 数据或性能对比。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L2-Q2.5\n","userModified":false}}
